2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 1417 in Graham, Stirlingshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT William was the direct ancestor of the present family. He was a soldier, and for his faithful services to King James (his uncle), obtained, in early life, a grant of the lands and barony of Garvock.
