1 NOTE {geni:about_me} •  Robert Graham  •  Prefix: 1st of Fintry Sir  •  Given Name: Robert  •  Surname: Graham 
2 CONT
2 CONT •  Birth: ABT 1415 in of Fintry, Angus, Scotland  •  Death: BEF 29 MAY 1490
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: William Graham b: 1374 in Of Kincardine and Old Montrose  Mother: Mary Stewart b: ABT 1380 in Of Dumfermline, Fifeshire, Scotland c: 1458 in Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Janet Lovell b: ABT 1409 in Fintry, Angus, Scotland Married: ABT 1434 in Of Fintry and Claverhouse, Angus, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT  Robert Graham b: ABT 1435 in Fintry, Fofar, Scotland
2 CONT  Elizabeth Graham b: ABT 1437 in of Fintry, Angus, Scotland
2 CONT  Margaret (Marjory) Graham b: ABT 1438 in Fintry, Angus, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 2 Matilda Scrimgeour b: ABT 1433 in Dudhope Castle, Dundee, Forfarshire, Scotland Married: 1479 in <Ballargus, Kirriemuir, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT  David Graham b: ABT 1482 in Ballargus, Kirriemuir, Scotland
2 CONT  John Graham b: 23 NOV 1482 in Of Fintry and Claverhouse, Angus, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://worldconnect.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=rdgmmb&id=I8403
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Bobert Graham of Strathcarron and Fintry, eldest son of William, Lord Graham of Kincardine, by his second wife, Lady Mary Stewart, second daughter of King Robert III., married Janet, daughter of Sir Richard Lovel of Ballumbie,
2 CONC  and by her had issue Robert Graham of Fintry. In 1476 he married Lady Elizabeth Douglas, third daughter of George, fourth Earl of Angus, and is ancestor of the Grahams of Claverhouse, and the Grahams of Duntrune.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: https://books.google.com/books?id=7_4HAAAAQAAJ&pg=PA19&lpg=PA19&dq=robert+graham+married+jonet+lovel+and+matilda+scrymgeour&source=bl&ots=WzUo3hLd41&sig=7WLdpdaarKBBZmMRl6GP6AvwokU&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0CDsQ6AEwBWoVChMIyZW4g4Tsx
2 CONC gIVhKkeCh1FZAg9#v=onepage&q=robert%20graham%20married%20jonet%20lovel%20and%20matilda%20scrymgeour&f=false
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Robert Married Lady Janet Lovel and married Lady Elizabeth Douglas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Robert was of Strathcarron, co. Ross and Cromarty. He was the 1st chief of Fintry co. Stirling. He was Provost of Dundee in 1465.
2 CONT --------------------
