1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1.	Euphame Wallace was born ABT 1446 in Ochiltree, East Ayrshire, Scotland. She was the daughter of 2. George Wallace and 3. Catherine Graham. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Robert Colville III Sir Laird Hiltoun ABT 1461 in Cumnock, East Ayrshire, Scotland, son of Robert Colville II Sir Laird of Ochiltree and Christian Crichton. He was born ABT 1446 in Cumnock, East Ayrshire, Scotland, and
2 CONC  died BEF 24 JAN 1488/89.  	 
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Eupheme Wallace:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p14750.htm#i147491
2 CONT
2 CONT Eupheme Wallace [1]
2 CONT *F, #147491
2 CONT *Last Edited=22 May 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Eupheme Wallace and Sir Robert Colville
2 CONT *1. Janet Colville+[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S2] Peter W. Hammond, editor, The Complete Peerage or a History of the House of Lords and All its Members From the Earliest Times, Volume XIV: Addenda & Corrigenda (Stroud, Gloucestershire, U.K.: Sutton Publishing, 1998), pag
2 CONC e 104. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage, Volume XIV.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From Descendants of Sir Malcolm "1st Lord of Elderslie" Wallace I (Father of  Sir William "Braveheart" Wallace ) - unsourced
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.facebook.com/pages/Different-Ancestors-in-The-Attic/364049247063659?sk=app_139478552796147
2 CONT
2 CONT Sixth Generation (parents')
2 CONT
2 CONT 12. George Wallace was born in 1405 in Elderslie, Renfrewshire, Scotland and died in 1468 in Elderslie, Renfrewshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT George married Catherine Graham in 1439 in Elderslie, Renfrewshire, Scotland. Catherine was born in 1420 in Angusshire, Kincardineshire, Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT *1. 14 M    i. Patrick Wallace was born in 1440 in Elderslie, Renfrewshire, Scotland and died in 1513.
2 CONT *2. + 15 F    ii. Euphemia Wallace was born in 1451 in Ochiltree, Ayrshire, Scotland and died in 1488 in Hilton, Berwickshire, Scotland.
2 CONT **16 F    iii. Eufame Wallace was born in 1451 in Elderslie, Renfrewshire, Scotland and died in 1488 in Hilton, Berwickshire, Scotland. (same daughter)
2 CONT *3. 17 F    iv. Helen Wallace was born in 1457 in Ochiltree, Ayrshire, Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Seventh Generation
2 CONT
2 CONT 15. Euphemia Wallace was born in 1451 in Ochiltree, Ayrshire, Scotland and died in 1488 in Hilton, Berwickshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Euphemia married Sir Robert Colville in 1468 in Kilmarnock, Ayrshire, Scotland. Sir was born in 1451 in Ochiltree Castle, Ayrshire, Scotland and died before 1488 Jan 24 in Hiltoun, Stirlingshire, Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT *1. + 18 F    i. Janet Colville was born about 1467 in Ochiltree, Ayreshire, Scotland and died on 1504 Apr 21 in Kilmarnock, Ayrshire, Scotland.
2 CONT *2. 19 M    ii. Sir William COLVILLE was born in 1469 in Ochiltree, Ayrshire, Scotland and died in 1508.
2 CONT *3. 20 M    iii. Robert Colville was born in 1473 in Hilton, Berwickshire, Scotland and died on 1495 Jan 6 in Hilton, Berwickshire, Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
