2 CONT Charts	Pedigree of James Irvine
2 CONT '''     William Graham, 2nd Lord Graham was born at of Kincardine, Forfarshire, Scotland. He married Eleanor (Elene) Douglas''', daughter of Sir William Douglas, 2nd Earl of Angus, Lord of Liddesdale, Jedburgh Forest, & Bonkle and
2 CONC  Margaret Hay, '''before 1460. William Graham, 2nd Lord Graham died in 1472.'''
