1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JOHN RALSTON===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Ralston: "joh. Railstoune filio dict Joh. secundo" was the principal witness to the charter by which his father transferred ownership of Ralston to his eldest son Thomas. The charter was issued at Paisley on 4 January 1505
2 CONC  and confirmed under the Great Seal of Scotland on 8 February 1506. [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi02scot#page/621/mode/1up Register of the Great Seal of Scotland, charter number 2925]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
