1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  
2 CONT
2 CONT ===BLAISE VANS OF BARNBARROCH===
2 CONT
2 CONT was born before 1456. He was the son of Robert Vaux of Barnbarroch and Euphemia Graham. He married Elizabeth Shaw, daughter of Sir John Shaw of Haillie. He died in 1482 [http://thepeerage.com/p13265.htm#i132649 Darryl Lundy's Peer
2 CONC age]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Notes'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Blaise Vans of Barnbarroch and Elizabeth Shaw
2 CONT
2 CONT  1.George Vaux d. 1570
2 CONT  2.Ninian Vaux
2 CONT  3.Margaret Vaux
2 CONT  4.Patrick Vaux of Barnbarroch d. 1528
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 263. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Peerage 
2 CONC and Baronetage, 107th edition
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. The Peerage http://thepeerage.com/p13265.htm#i132649
2 CONT
