2 CONC ird of Spittal, married Isabel Cimningham, daughter of the ist Earl of Glencaim. He acquired the lands of Spittal in 1519, those of Arrochymore in 1530, and those of Blairvockie (Blairwoky or Blairvoky^) in 1535. 
