1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===HELEN GRAHAM (aka CATHERINE GRAHAM)===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''According to Sir James Balfour Paul, Lord Lyon King of Arms, Helen Graham is the daughter of William, Earl of Montrose. He does not say who her mother was although it is generally assumed that she was a daughter of Annabel Drum
2 CONC mond, rather than Janet Edmonstone.  [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun06paul#page/225/mode/1up The Scots Peerage, vi, p. 225]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Helen Graham married Humphrey Colquhoun of Luss. They were third cousins, both descended from Robert. Lord Erskine, and his wife Elizabeth Lindsay, and because they were so closely related they required a dispensation from the 
2 CONC church. This was granted on 13 July 1509.  [https://archive.org/stream/liberprotocollor02bain#page/295/mode/1up Liber Protocollrum M Cuthbert Simonis, A.D. 1499-1513, protocol number 376 on pp. 295-96]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-John-Colquhoun-of-Luss/6000000007048545448?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1487608751049&through=6000000054510042896
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Patrick-Colquhoun/6000000015006010562?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1487608933135&through=6000000005597656022
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Adam-Colquhoun-clerk/6000000003714014937?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526943271816&through=6000000005597656022
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/James-Colquhoun-of-Garscube/6000000015006010552?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526943359706&through=6000000005597656022
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Helen-Colquhoun/6000000003714021125?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526943483005&through=6000000005597656022
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Marion-Colquhoun/6000000054510042896?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526943606843&through=6000000005597656022
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence From the Protocol Book of Cuthbert Simons===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''13 July 1509: Dispensation for a marriage between Humphrey Colquhoun of Luss and Helen Graham, daughter of the Earl of Montrose. [https://archive.org/stream/liberprotocollor02bain#page/295/mode/1up Liber Protocollrum M Cuthbert
2 CONC  Simonis, A.D. 1499-1513, protocol number 376 on pp. 295-96]'''
2 CONT
