2 CONT Lady Elizabeth Drummond
2 CONT
2 CONT By his second marriage, William, earl of Montrose, had a daughter, Lady Elizabeth, who married Walter, grand-son and apparent heir of John, first Lord Drummond, in 1513.
2 CONT
2 CONT ("Genealogical memoir of the most noble and ancient house of Drummond" by David Malcolm pub. 1808)
