1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Erskine of Balhaggardy married before 1551, a daughter of the neighbouring Laird of Kenmay, Sir Archibald Douglas of Glenbervie, and had a son, John, (who appears in 1565 as eldest son). 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Erskine of Balhaggardy (his son) must have succeeded before 1615, when Thomas Erskine appears as fiar (p. 418). – (John Davidson 1878, Inverurie and the Earldom of the Garioch)
