2 CONT
2 CONT * Sir Thomas Erskine of Brechin (a 1542, Lord of Session) m1. Agnes Ogilvy m2. Elizabeth Scrymgeour (dau of Sir James Scrymgeour of Dudhope, Constable of Dundee)
2 CONT ** 1.	Thomas Erskine (dsp) 	m. Ann Ogilvy (dau of James Ogilvy, 4th Lord of Airlie) ''TSP (Airlie) names the 4th Lord's daughter (who married Sir Thomas of Brechin) as Agnes. As BLG1886 mentions only Elizabeth Scrymgeour as wife o
2 CONC f Thomas's father Thomas, there is a suspicion that there has been some confusion as to which Thomas married a daughter of Lord Airlie.''
2 CONT ** 2.	John Erskine of Balhagardy (b 1528)	m. (before 1551) Margaret Douglas (dau of Sir Archibald Douglas of Glenbervie)
2 CONT *** 	A.	John Erskine of Balhagardy (d 1625) 	m. ?? Gordon (dau of John Gordon of Cluny)
2 CONT ***  	B.	Margaret or Magdalen Erskine possibly of this generation 	m. James Leslie of Milltown (d 1620)
2 CONT **3.	Margaret Erskine	m. (before 14.07.1541) John Allardyce of Allardyce (b c1505, d Pinkie 09.09.1547)
2 CONT ** 4.	Mary Erskine 	m. George Barclay, 10th of Mathers (d 1607)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
