1 NAME William /Lundy of Benholm/
2 GIVN William
2 SURN Lundy of Benholm
2 _MARNM Lundy of Benholm
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 25 JUN 1551
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===WILLIAM LUNDY OF BENHOLM===
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Spurious Pedigree'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''William Lundy, here treated, is identified as the son of Robert Lundy of Benholm in Dr. Robert Lundy Smith's account of the family. [https://www.electricscotland.com/webclans/htol/lundin8.html Lundie of Benholm] Thi
2 CONC s is wrong, however. William Lundy of Benholm was the son of Andrew Lundy of Benholm. [http://www.lundie.org/newsite/book/pdf/Lundy_lundie_lundin_book_benholm.pdf The House of Benholm]'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''William Lundy of Benholm, here treated, is the son and heir of Andrew Lundy of Benholm. His father was killed in action at the Battle of Pinkie Cleugh in September 1547. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/de
2 CONC tails.aspx?reference=GD4%2f27&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Andrew+Lundy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n NRS: GD4/27]''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===EVIDENCE FROM THE NATIONAL RECORDS OF SCOTLAND===
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''2 July 1548: Sasine to William Lundy [Lundie], as heir of Andrew Lundy [Lundie] of Benholme [Benholm] his father (who was killed in the battle of Pinkie), of the Manis of Benholme [Benholm], the lands of Inchmedden [Inchmeddan]
2 CONC , Tullo of Benholme [Tully of Benholm], and Kirktoun of Benholme [Kirkton of Benholm], with mill thereof. On Chancery Precept of Clare Constat dated 4 June an. reg. 6 (A.D.1548). [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalo
2 CONC gue/details.aspx?reference=GD4%2f27&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Andrew+Lundy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Scott family of Benholm, Kincardineshire and Hedderwick, Angus, reference GD4/27]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''6 February 1559-60: Assignation of the ward and nonentry of the lands of the deceased William Lundy [Lundie] of Benholme [Benholm], and of the marriage of Isabel (or Elizabeth) Lundy [Lundie] his daughter and apparent heir, by 
2 CONC Robert Carnegye [Carnegie] of Kynnarde [Kinnaird] knight to Robert Keycht [Keith] second son of William earl Merschel [Earl Marischal], whom failing, to William Keycht [Keith] second son of William master Marscheall, whom failing,
2 CONC  to George Keycht [Keith] the master's eldest son, whom failing, to any other person whom the earl or his heirs should name. At Benholm. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD4%2f30&st=1&t
2 CONC c=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=elizabeth+lundy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Scott family of Benholm, Kincardineshire and Hedderwick, Angus, reference GD4/30]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===GENEALOGY===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.lundie.org/newsite/book/pdf/Lundy_lundie_lundin_book_benholm.pdf The House of Benholm]
2 CONT # [https://www.electricscotland.com/webclans/htol/lundin8.html Lundie of Benholm]
2 CONT # [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ll/lundin2.php Stirnet: Lundin 2]
