2 CONT ===JOHN RALSTON===
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh Ralston of that Ilk (Otherwise Hew Ralstoun of that Ilk) made his last will and testament on 23 May 1613 and died in August the same year. He appointed his wife, Janet Hamilton, his only executor. His sons Hugh and John witne
2 CONC ssed this deed [William Hamilton of Wishaw, Descriptions of the Sheriffdoms of Lanark and Renfrew (Maitland Club, Glasgow, MDCCCXXXI), page 79] https://archive.org/stream/descriptionsofsh00hami#page/79/mode/1up
1 FAMC @F6000000017152699280@
1 RFN geni:6000000110349106857
1 SUBM @S6000000008879398364@
