2 CONT ===Bastard Son===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir Patrick Bellenden of Stenness had a bastard son who was also named Patrick Bellenden. His date of birth and the name of his mother is not known but he and his father are mentioned in a charter which was issued at Kirkwall i
2 CONC n Orkney on 23 March 1567-68. [https://archive.org/stream/publicationsofsc27scot#page/287/mode/1up Records of the Earldom of Orkney, charter number CLXX on pp. 287-88]'''
