2 CONT '''22 February 1564: Inventory of writs delivered by Patrick McDowell of Logan to Francis Hay of Arioland concerning the lands of Mochrum Loch. Contract betwixt Margaret Dunbar relict of John Wemis and a sister and heir of deceast
2 CONC  Andrew Dunbar of Loch disponing her part of the lands to Patrick Bellenden of Stenhous sheriff of Orkney  22 Feb 1564. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD141%2f214&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&
2 CONC tp=n&k=Patrick+Bellenden&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, McDouall family of Logan, Wigtownshire, reference GD141/214]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
