1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''James Ogilvy, 4th Lord Ogilvy, Lord Airlie'''1
2 CONT Last Edited	4 Apr 2020
2 CONT M, #2998, '''d. between 27 November 1547 and 13 July 1548'''
