2 CONT Charts	Pedigree of James Irvine
2 CONT '''    James Ogilvy, 4th Lord Ogilvy, Lord Airlie was born at of Airlie, Forfarshire, Scotland. He married Elinor Sinclair''', daughter of Henry Sinclair, 3rd Lord Sinclair and Margaret Hepburn. '''James Ogilvy, 4th Lord Ogilvy, L
2 CONC ord Airlie died between 27 November 1547 and 13 July 1548.'''
2 CONT '''Family'''
