1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lady Elizabeth Graham1
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #19539, d. before 4 April 1576
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=8 Sep 2012
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.85%
2 CONT
2 CONT      Lady Elizabeth Graham was the daughter of William Graham, 2nd Earl of Montrose and Lady Janet Keith.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married George Sinclair, 4th Earl of Caithness, son of John Sinclair, 3rd Earl of Caithness and Elizabeth Sutherland.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died before 4 April 1576.1 Her will was probated on 4 April 1576 at Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland.3
2 CONT
2 CONT      As a result of her marriage, Lady Elizabeth Graham was styled as  Countess of Caithness. Her married name became Sinclair.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Elizabeth Graham and George Sinclair, 4th Earl of Caithness
2 CONT * 1.Barbara Sinclair d. c 1573
