1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mungo Graham, who married (contract 26 March 1571) Marjorie, daughter of Sir William Edomonstone of Duntreath, was Master of the Household to James VI for many years and died before 15 May 1590.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Mungo Graham of Orchill was the son of William Graham, 2nd Earl of Montrose and Lady Janet Keith.2 A contract for the marriage of Mungo Graham of Orchill and Marjory Edmonstone was signed on 26 March 1571.1 He died before 1592.1
2 CONT
2 CONT On 25 August 1547 he had a charter of Rathernis, Perthshire.2 On 8 December 1560 he had a charter of Orchill.2 He was ancestor of the Grahams of Orchill.2
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
