1 NOTE {geni:about_me} David Drummond, 2nd Lord Drummond M, #22028, b. between 1515 and 1517, d. 1571 Consanguinity Index=0.26% David Drummond, 2nd Lord Drummond was born between 1515 and 1517.1 He was the son of Walter Drummond, Master 
2 CONC of Drummond and Lady Elizabeth Graham.2 He married, firstly, Margaret Stewart, daughter of Alexander Stewart and Margaret Stewart, in 1535.3 He married, secondly, Lilias Ruthven, daughter of William Ruthven, 2nd Lord Ruthven and J
2 CONC anet Halyburton, Lady Dirletoun, before 7 December 1543.3 He died in 1571. He succeeded to the title of  2nd Lord Drummond [S., 1488] in 1519.4 Child of David Drummond, 2nd Lord Drummond and Margaret Stewart 1.Sybilla Drummond1 Ch
