2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT John (James) Somerville , 3rd of Cambusnethan
2 CONT * Birth:	1520 - Carnwath, Lanarkshire, Scotland
2 CONT * Death:	1594 - Cowthally, Carnwath, Lanarkshire, Scotland
2 CONT * Parents:	John Somerville, Margaret Graham
2 CONT
2 CONT # abt 1537 to Katherine Carmichael b: ABT 1515 d March 1550.  This may possibly be the Katherine/Elizabeth Carmichael who was mistress to King James V. Mother of the Earl of Bothwell b 1532  & Janet, who married the Earl of Caegyl
2 CONC e. 
2 CONT # in 1552 to Katherine Murray d 1605, also a former mistress of James V
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Katherine Carmichael 
2 CONT #  James, 'Velvet Eye' 4th' of Cambusneth b: ABT 1539.  Married Margaret Hamilton.
2 CONT # Robert. 
2 CONT # daughter.  "married meanly by her stepmother" to Gavin Hamilton of the Nether Hills
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Katherine Murray (3 sons, 4 daughters)
2 CONT # John Patrick.  Of Green and Patherhall.
2 CONT #  William.
2 CONT # Thomas, Cardinal of Padua.
2 CONT # 1st daughter.  Married Sir John Skeine.
2 CONT #  Jean.  Married Laird of Dunlop.
2 CONT #  Helen.  Married  Laird of Miltoun of the surname of Whiteford.
2 CONT #  Nicola, 4th daughter.  Married Walter Stewart.
2 CONT
