2 CONT == [http://www.oocities.org/smdnz/gene/craigends.htm Biographical Summary] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''William Cuninghame, 4th Laird of Craigends; married Margaret Cuninghame (died 1618). William died in 1568.  William's widow Margaret remarried twice. She is buried in the Old Kilmadock churchyard, near Doune, Perthshire. Childr
2 CONC en: (1)  Alexander Cuninghame, 5th Laird of Craigends (2) William Cuninghame (3) John Cuninghame of Rawis (4) Gabriel Cuninghame (5) Grisell Cuninghame; married Robert Laminton of Inch (6) Elizabeth Cuninghame; married the goodman
2 CONC  of Grange (7) Janet Cuninghame (8) Dorothy Cuninghame; married about 1589 to her step-brother James Dog of Dunrobin (born about 1573, died February 1634) [http://www.oocities.org/smdnz/gene/craigends.htm The Cunynghame Family of 
2 CONC Craigends]'''
