1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/dd/dunbar03.php#dau2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''daughter of  	Sir Alexander Dunbar of Cumnock & Westfield, Sheriff of Murray (d c1576) and his second wife Janet Leslie (dau of John Leslie of Parkhill) '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Anna DUNBAR  Female Abt 1500 - 
2 CONT *     Name  	Margaret Anna DUNBAR  [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]  
2 CONT *     Born  	Abt 1500  	Cumnock, , Ayr, Scotland 
2 CONT *     Gender  	Female  
2 CONT *     Alt. Birth  	1502  	, , Moray, Scotland  
2 CONT *     Alt. Birth  	1520  
2 CONT *     _ 
2 CONT *     Died  	, , , Scotland 
2 CONT *     Father  	Sir Alexander DUNBAR,   b. Abt 1477, , , , Scotland 
2 CONT *     Mother  	Jean FALCONER,   b. Abt 1479,   d. Yes, date unknown 
2 CONT *     Family  	Sir Robert MUNRO, XIV of Foulis,   b. Abt 1508,   d. 10 Sep 1547, Musselburgh, , Midlothian, Scotland
2 CONT    Married  	, , , Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Children  	
2 CONT *      	1. Robert Mor MUNRO, XV of Foulis,   b. Abt 1523,   d. 4 Nov 1588, Dingwall, Ross-Shire, Scotland, (Foulis Castle) 
2 CONT *      	2. George MUNRO, I of Katewell,   b. 1524, Cromarty, , Ross and Cromarty, Scotland ,   d. 10 Sep 1547, Musselburgh, , Midlothian, Scotland 
2 CONT *      	3. Elizabeth MUNRO,   b. Abt 1533,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT *      	4. Hugh MUNRO, I Of Assynt,   b. Abt 1526, Dingwall, , Ross and Cromarty, Scotland ,   d. 1596, Evanton, , Ross and Cromarty, Scotland 
2 CONT *      	5. Catherine MUNRO,   b. Abt 1537,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT *      	6. Hector MUNRO, I Of Fyrish, Contullich,   b. Abt 1539,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT *      	7. Janet MUNRO,   b. Abt 1541,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes  	
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref: "The Munro Tree (1734)" by R. W. Munro - Q
2 CONT
2 CONT "Robert Barron of Fowlis married Margaret daughter to Sir Alexander Dunbar Sheriff of Murray by whom he had 4 sons and 3 daughters he was slain at the Battle of Pinkie with many of his followers in [? September] 1547."
2 CONT
2 CONT "...His wife is named Anna Dunbar in 1663 birthbrief to descendant Alexander R/15 (TGSI xii 386, Mackenzie 173); their four sons appear below as Robert R, Hector Q/1, Hugh Q/18 and George Q/45; for dr Catherine see M/4."
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref: "History of the Munros" by A. Mackenzie - p. 42
2 CONT
2 CONT "He [Robert] married Margaret, only daughter of Sir Alexander Dunbar of Cumnock and Westfield, Sheriff of Morayshire, by his second wife Janet, daughter of John Leslie of Parkhill, son of William third Earl of Rothes. The Coul MS.
2 CONC  says that Lady Dunbar was a daughter of "the Laird of Haggerton Falcken," no doubt meaning the family of Falconer of Halkerton, Kincardineshire, from whom the present Earl of Kintore is descended."
2 CONT
2 CONT Compiled and edited by Allen Alger, Genealogist, Clan Munro Association, USA - e-mail: alger@alum.mit.edu
2 CONT
