2 CONT Sir Alexander Falconer, 5th Laird of Halkerton1 Last Edited	23 Dec 2019 M, #94604, b. circa 1520, d. 10 November 1587 Father	David Falconer, 4th Laird of Halkerton d. a 8 Oct 1546 Mother	Mariot Dunbar
2 CONT      Sir Alexander Falconer, 5th Laird of Halkerton was born circa 1520 at of Halkerton, Kincardineshire, Scotland. He married Elizabeth Douglas, daughter of Sir Archibald Douglas and Agnes Keith, circa 1549. Sir Alexander Falcone
2 CONC r, 5th Laird of Halkerton died on 10 November 1587 at of Halkerton, Kincardineshire, Scotland.1 Family Elizabeth Douglas b. c 1525 Child	 Sir Alexander Falconer b. c 1550, d. Dec 1595 Citations [S11649] Clan MacFarlane & Associate
2 CONC d Clans Genealogy, www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info Family ID=F17781. ________________________________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p10972.htm#i109716
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Alexander Falconer, 5th of Halkerton1  M, #109716, b. circa 1522, d. 10 November 1587 Last Edited=1 Dec 2013
2 CONT      Sir Alexander Falconer, 5th of Halkerton was born circa 1522 at Halkerstoun, Forfarshire, Scotland.2 He was the son of David Falconer, 4th of Halkerton and Mariot Dunbar.2 A contract for the marriage of Sir Alexander Falconer
2 CONC , 5th of Halkerton and Elizabeth Douglas was signed on 1 June 1543.1 He died on 10 November 1587 at Lethen, Scotland.2
2 CONT      He lived at Halkerton, ScotlandG.1 Child of Sir Alexander Falconer, 5th of Halkerton and Elizabeth Douglas Alexander Falconer, 6th of Halkerton+2 b. c 1545, d. Dec 1595 Citations [S8] BP1999 volume 1, page 1283. See link for 
2 CONC full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S8] [S3268] Hans Harmsen, "re: Chester Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 21 August 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Chester Family." ________________________________
2 CONC __________________________________
