1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == RIGHT REVEREND DAVID LINDSAY ==
2 CONT
2 CONT == Minister of the Gospel at Leith in Midlothian; Chaplain to James VI, King of Scots, Bishop of Ross; Member of the Privy Council of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Minister of the Gospel at Leith. [https://archive.org/details/fastiecclesiu01scotuoft/page/160/mode/1up Fasti of the Church of Scotland I: 160-1]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Moderator of the Church of Scotland. [https://archive.org/details/fastiecclesiaesc00scot/page/438/mode/1up Fasti of the Church of Scotland VIII: 438]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
