2 CONT “The family of Leslie of Tarbet in Ireland is descended from the Wardis branch of the family of Leslie, Barons of Balquhain.
2 CONT
2 CONT “I. James Leslie of Milton, fourth son of William Leslie, fourth Baron of Wardis, by his wife, Janet Innes, married, Magdalen Erskine of Pittodrie, and had issue-
2 CONT
2 CONT *   I. John. 
2 CONT *  II. James, a clergyman in the Established Church in Ireland.  James Leslie of Milton, died in 1620.
