1 NAME William /Ralston of that ilk/
2 GIVN William
2 SURN Ralston of that ilk
2 _MARNM Ralston of that ilk
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1576
1 DEAT
2 DATE JUL 1623
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == WILLIAM RALSTON OF THAT ILK ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Fake Genealogy'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''It has been claimed that William Ralston of that Ilk, here treated, is the same person as https://www.geni.com/people/William-Roulston/6000000156296995891 [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Rolstoun-1 WikiTree] This is 
2 CONC Wrong. For example, https://www.geni.com/people/William-Roulston/6000000156296995891 is said to have had a son named John Roulstone who was born in about 1624, [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Roulstone-33 Wikitree] but William Rals
2 CONC ton of that Ilk, here treated, died intestate in July 1623 and there is no mention of a son named John in his testament dative. [NRS: CC9/7/20]'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == The Question of Identity ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''According to James Hamilton of Wishaw, William Ralston of that Ilk, here treated, succeeded Hugh Ralston of that Ilk, his grandfather. [https://archive.org/stream/descriptionsofsh00hami#page/79/mode/1up Lanark and Renfrew:  79]
2 CONC '''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''William Ralston of that Ilk, here treated, died intestate in July 1623. He probably died at Woodside in the parish of Beith, in the Cunningham division of Ayrshire.  [NRS: CC9/7/20]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == The Testament Dative and Inventory of William Ralston of that Ilk and his wife Barbara Hamilton ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''William Ralston of that Ilk died intestate in July 1623, probably at Woodside in the parish of Beith, in the Cunningham division of Ayrshire. His wife Barbara Hamilton died intestate in October 1623. Their testamet dative and i
2 CONC nventory was given up by William Mure of Glanderston, tutor testamentar to Jonet Ralton, Barbara Ralston, Issobell Ralston Jeane Ralston, Margaret Ralston, and Kathrein Ralston, their children.  John Hamilton of Udston acted himse
2 CONC lf as cautioner for William Mure of Glanderston and confirmation was granted to him on 19 November 1625. [National Records of Scotland, Glasgow Commissary Court, The Testament Dative and Inventory of Williame Ralstoune of that Ilk
2 CONC , parish of Beith, and Barbara Hammiltoune, his spous, reference CC9/7/20]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000203894861822 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000203894809822 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000203894665830 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000203894578862 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''William Ralston of that Ilk married Barbara Hamilton. She died in October 1623. [NRS: CC9/7/20]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
