2 CONC  George Robertson (Cunningham Press, Irvine, 1820), 442 pp. For Ralston of Ralston see pp. 276-9]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/details/historyofcountyo01pateuoft/page/n6/mode/1up History of the County of Ayr : with a genealogical account of the families of Ayrshire. By James Paterson. Vol. I (John Dick, Ayr, MDCCCXLVII), 463 pp. 
2 CONC For Ralston of that Ilk see pp. 265-70]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/details/bub_gb_0NEKAAAAYAAJ/page/n2/mode/1up Burke's Genealogical and Heraldic History of the Landed Gentry of Great Britain and Ireland. By John Burke, Esq., and John Bernard Burke, Esq. Vol II. M - Z (H
2 CONC enry Colburn, London, MDCCCXLVII), 1673 pp. For Ralston of Ralston see p. 1096]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/stream/descriptionsofsh00hami#page/n10/mode/1up Descriptions of the Sheriffdoms of Lanark and Renfrew compiled about M. DCC.X. By William Hamilton of Wishaw. (Maitland Club, Glasgow, M.DCCC.XXXI.), 304 pp
2 CONC . plus indexes. For Ralston of that Ilk see pp. 78-9]'''
