2 CONT '''Hugh Wallace is the son of William Wallace of Elderslie.[http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=RH6%2f2666&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Ellirslie&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y NRS:RH6/2666]'''
