2 CONT 4. George Buchanan of that Ilk, c 1557 George Buchanan succeeded his grandfather in 1526. He married twice. (1) Margaret Edmonstone, ( 2 ) Janet Cunningham. By his first wife he had John and by his second wife William ( first of A
2 CONC uchmar ) , and Margaret. George died 15 February 1560/61. A shield of arms couché: Three ( boar's or bear's ) heads and necks erased. Crest unknown. Inscription illegible. Source, ( Leny and Bardowie Ch. ). From: http://www.buchan
2 CONC an-heraldry.net.nz/body/seals.html
