2 CONT *''''''     Duncan Campbell was the son of Duncan Campbell and unknown daughter Buchanan.2 He married Mary Macleod, daughter of William Macleod of Dunvegan in Skye, in 1573.1 He died in 1594 at Glenlivet, Banffshire, Scotland, pos
2 CONC sibly killed with his father.1
2 CONT *''''''     He held the office of Captain of Castleswene.1
2 CONT *''''''Children of Duncan Campbell and Mary Macleod
