2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT https://landedfamilies.blogspot.com/2013/10/80-alexander-of-menstrie-earls-of.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander, Alexander (d. 1580/1). Eldest son of William Alexander (d. 1574) and his wife Elizabeth, daughter of Alan Coutts or Couttie.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married c.1567, Marion, daughter of Gilbert Graham of Gartavertane
2 CONT
