2 CONT Lady Margaret Graham was the daughter of William Graham, 3rd Earl of Menteith and Margaret Moubray.1 She married Archibald Campbell, 4th Earl of Argyll, son of Colin Campbell, 3rd Earl of Argyll and Jean Gordon, on 21 April 1541 a
2 CONC t Priory of Inchmahome, Inchmahome.1
2 CONT      After her marriage, Lady Margaret Graham was styled as Countess of Argyll on 21 April 1541. From 21 April 1541, her married name became Campbell. Children of Lady Margaret Graham and Archibald Campbell, 4th Earl of Argyll
2 CONT
