2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''7 April 1568: Precept of Charter of Conjugation ifeft to Duncan Lawmont fiar of Innerin and Issobell  Stewart his spouse of the eight merk land of Kilmichaell and the two and one half merk land of Maldeloch, lying the the Balli
2 CONC ery of Cowale and shire of Argyll. At Glasgpw 7 April 1569. [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=mdp.39015025923007&view=1up&seq=110&skin=2021 Lamont Papers: number 265 on p. 86]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''7 April 1568: The King confirmed to Duncan Lowmand, fiar of Inverrin, and Isabel Stewart, his spouse, 8 m. of the lands of Kilmichaell, two and one half m. of Maldeloch, with the mill of those places, in the bailiert of Cowall 
2 CONC and sheriffdom of Argyll; which the said Duncan resigned. [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=mdp.39015025923007&view=1up&seq=110&skin=2021 Lamont Papers: number 266 on p. 86]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Printed Evidence ==
