2 CONT
2 CONT '''18 July 1597: Extract Registered Contract between John, Earl of Cassillis, and Sir Thomas Kennadie of Culzeane, his uncle, with Elizabeth McGill, spouse, and Thomas K., son, of the said Thomas, ratifying certain bonds, charters
2 CONC  and decreets, etc. granted to and by the said Thomas as tutor to the Earl, and incorporating various renunciations and re-grants, all covered by GD25/1/849-1094. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx
