2 CONC reof). [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD25%2f9%2f73&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Elizabeth+Makgill&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1500&dt=1600&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Kennedy 
