2 CONT '''2 January 1617: Discharge by Gilbert Ross, provost of Maybole, in name of Sir Andrew Melvine of Garvock (Garua), to Elizabeth McGill, lady Culzeane, of £22, being few maills for 1616. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonli
2 CONC necatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD25%2f3%2f81&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=elizabeth+mcgill&ko=p&r=&ro=m&df=&dt=1622&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Kennedy Family, Earls of Cassillis (Ailsa Muniments), reference
2 CONC  GD25/3/81]'''
