2 CONC r and resignation. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD25%2f4%2f2&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=elizabeth+mcgill&ko=p&r=&ro=m&df=&dt=1622&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Ke
