2 CONC t of sasine. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD25%2f4%2f3&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=elizabeth+mcgill&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Kennedy Fami
