2 CONC GD25%2f8%2f104b&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=elizabeth+mcgill&ko=p&r=&ro=m&df=&dt=1622&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Kennedy Family, Earls of Cassillis (Ailsa Muniments), reference GD25/8/104b]'''
