1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  *** Sir John Campbell, 3rd Laird of Lawers ***
2 CONT
2 CONT  Hon Jean Colville, mar. after 23 Jun 1595 Sir James Campbell of Lawers (d. Jan 1645), 1st son and heir of Sir John Campbell of Lawers and Aberuchill by his wife and cousin Beatrix Campbell, dau. of Sir Colin Campbell of Glenorchy
2 CONC , and had issue
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.cracroftspeerage.co.uk/online/content/Colville1604.htm
2 CONT =========================
2 CONT Sir John Campbell of Lawers1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Sir John Campbell of Lawers was the son of Archibald Campbell of Lawers, younger and Agnes Ross.2,3 He married Beatrix Campbell, daughter of Sir Colin Campbell of Glenorchy and Margaret Stewart.1 He died in 1611.2
2 CONT      He was invested as a Knight in 1590.2 In 1594 he acquired Aberuchill and other lands from the Morays of Abercairny, making them over to his second son the following year.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir John Campbell of Lawers and Beatrix Campbell
2 CONT  1.Sir James Campbell of Lawers+3 d. Jan 1645
2 CONT  2.Archibald Campbell3
2 CONT  3.Colin Campbell of Aberuchill+3 d. 1618
2 CONT
