1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===MARJORY EDMONSTONE===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marjory Edmonstone is the daughter of Sir William Edmonstone of Duntreath. She married by contract, firstly, Mungo Graham of Orchill, son of William Graham, 2nd Earl of Montrose and Lady Janet Keith, on 26 March 1571 She and Si
2 CONC r John Maxwell of Pollok obtained a marriage license on 17 September 1592.
2 CONT
