2 CONT '''Patrick Bellenden is the bastard son of Sir Patrick Bellenden of Stenness. His date of birth and the name of his mother is not known but he is named as his father's heir of entail of a charter which confirms his father's posses
2 CONC sion of certain lands in Orkney. The charter was issued on 30 June 1564 and Patrick junior must therefore have been born before this date. [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi04scot#page/418/mode/1up Register of the Great 
2 CONC Seal of Scotland, A.D. 1546-1580, charter number 1710 on pp. 418-19]'''
