2 CONT
2 CONT == Research Notes ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Younger brother of Thomas Craig
2 CONT
2 CONT Royal physician to JamesVI of Scotland from 1603 and continuing when he became James I of England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Not to be confused with his nephew, also Dr John Craig ( - 1655), the 3rd son of Thomas who was also Royal Physician to James I and Charles I
2 CONT
2 CONT Oxford Dictionary of National Biography - article by John Henry
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.math.nus.edu.sg/~matgswa/JohnCraig.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT Younger brother of Thomas Craig, he was Royal Physician to James I. 
2 CONT Not to be confused with his nephew (Dr John Craig d 1655) who was also Royal Physician to James I and Charles I
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.math.nus.edu.sg/~matgswa/JohnCraig.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth Craig was the only child of John Craig and Lady Elizabeth Moir. Lady Elizabeth's grandfather, Sir John Craig, was the physician to Charles I and a member of the nobility. It is said her father's estate reverted to t
2 CONC he Crown because he died without a male heir.
