2 CONT '''     Marion Ogilvy was born at of Airlie, Scotland. She married Patrick Gray, 4th Lord Gray''', son of Gilbert Gray and Egidia Mercer, '''circa 21 September 1537. Marion Ogilvy died after 1569.'''
2 CONT '''Family'''
