2 CONT **[S11649] Clan MacFarlane & Associated Clans Genealogy, Family ID=F17725.
2 CONT **[S11568] The Complete Peerage, by Cokayne, Vol. I, p. 314.
2 CONT * < [https://gw.geneanet.org/tdowling?lang=en&pz=timothy+michael&nz=dowling&p=helen&n=ogilvy&oc=1 Tim DOWLING's Family Tree] > (no citations) has James Stewart 1565-1615  Married to Catherine Fryer 1567-1617.  This is disproved. 
