2 CONC  #21-v12pt2-p63> bef 17 Nov 1576, probably several years before to accomodate birth of William; ASSUMPTION: #21-v12pt2-p64> 1st son William born abt 1574 making John, Baron Tullibardine 14 yrs at time of birth; CONFLICT: #21-v12pt
2 CONC 2-p62fn(d) states> possibly born abt 1550, but in a portrait-1593 he was supposedly 33 yrs; <TITLE> Earl of Tullibardine;
