1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.archive.org/stream/heraldryofmurray00john#page/20/mode/2up Page 20 No.97c
2 CONT
2 CONT (97) Sir William Murray of Tullibardine,  died 16th March 1582-83. (B-p states 1583) He was served heir to his grandfather 8th April 1530. His Will recorded 28th May 1599 (Edinburgh). He was Controller of Scotland from 1566 till s
2 CONC hortly before his death. He married, before 27th May 1547, Agnes Graham, daughter of William, second Earl of Montrose, and had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 97(a) Sir John (No. 98 below).
2 CONT * 97(b) Captain William Murray of Pitcairly, living 1618.
2 CONT * 97(c) '''Colonel Alexander Murray of Drumdewan'''. He was in the Dutch service, and was killed at Bommel 19th May 1599.
2 CONT * 97(d) Sir Mungo, ancestor of Murray of Blebo (No. 127 below).
