2 CONC  deceased Sir John Colquhoun of Lus of an annualrent furth of the barony of Fyndlaystoun Cunninghame, 31 May 1580, containing a reversion of the said annualrent, [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx
