2 CONC lace betuix yow and me quhair he mycht carie a deutie first to yow, and quhair I mycht oversie his weill'. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD112%2f39%2f26%2f4&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n
