2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Alexander Colquhoun of Luss was the son of Sir John Colquhoun of Luss and Agnes Boyd.2 He married Helen Buchanan, daughter of Sir George Buchanan of that Ilk.3 He died on 23 May 1617.3
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1603 he continued the feud with the MacGregors, reaching a climax in an encounter at Glenfruin.3 He lived at Luss, Argyllshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
