2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Colquhoun married Sir James Edmonstone of Duntreath in 1585. [https://archive.org/stream/genealogicalacco00inedmo#page/46/mode/1up Duntreath: 46] Her husband gave her a liferent of the lands of Mochomran and Auchingree
2 CONC , in which she was infeft on 12 and 13 February 1585. She received a crown charter for these lands on 3 January 1598. [https://archive.org/stream/chiefsofcolquhou01fras#page/138/mode/1up The Chiefs of Colquhoun I: 138-39]'''
