2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrick Drummond, 3rd Lord Drummond was born in 1550.1 He was the son of David Drummond, 2nd Lord Drummond and Lilias Ruthven.1 He married, firstly, Lady Elizabeth Lindsay, daughter of David Lindsay, 9th Earl of Crawford and Kathe
2 CONC rine Campbell, before 21 October 1572.1 He married, secondly, Agnes Drummond, daughter of Sir John Drummond of Innerpeffray and Margaret Stewart, in 1588.1 He died circa 1602.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Patrick Drummond, 3rd Lord Drummond succeeded to the title of 3rd Lord Drummond [S., 1488] in 1571.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Patrick Drummond, 3rd Lord Drummond and Lady Elizabeth Lindsay
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.Lilias Drummond+ b. 1574, d. 8 May 16012
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.Katherine Drummond+ b. 1576
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.Jane Drummond+ b. 1578, d. 7 Oct 1643
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.James Drummond, 1st Earl of Perth+ b. c 1580, d. 8 Dec 1611
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.Elizabeth Drummond+ b. 1581, d. 1 Dec 1637
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.Anne Drummond+ b. 15833
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.John Drummond, 2nd Earl of Perth+ b. c 1584, d. 11 Jun 1662
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinc
2 CONC t or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume IV, page 471. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT
