2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == His Mother's Testament Dative and Inventory ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Testament Dative and Inventory of the deceased Katherine Murray: "relict of umqle Johne Somervell of Cambusnethe" was given up by: "Thomas Somervell induellar in Edr sone lull to the defunct and executor dative decernit to 
2 CONC his said umqulle mothr". At the time of her death Katherine Murray was owed two hundred and twenty pounds by James Somerville of Cambusnethan. Confirmation was granted to Thomas Somerville on 16 December 1605. [National Records of
2 CONC  Scotland, Edinburgh Commissary Court, Katherene Murray, relict of John Somervell of Cambusnethen, sheriffdom of Lanark, reference CC8/8/40]'''
2 CONT
