2 CONC ambusnethan, Katherine Murray Falahall. Siblings:Helen Somerville, Hugh Lord Somerville Husband:James Dunlop. Children:..., William Dunlap, Hugh Dunlop, William Dunlap, Robert Dunlop, Reverend Alexander Dunlop, Dorothy Dorothea Du
2 CONC nlop, Allan Dunlop, Kathrine.'''
