2 CONT == [http://www.clandunlop.com Biographical Summary by Clan Dunlop] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''In 1588, when James was 14, he married Jean SOMERVILLE of Cambusnethan, daughter of Sir John (James) SOMERVILLE, 3rd. of Cambusnethan & Katherine MURRAY of Philiphaugh & Falahill, in Paisley, Renfrewshire, Scotland. They had th
2 CONC e following children: (1)  James (~1590-1634) (2)  Alexander (1592-?1649) (3) John (1594-1662) (4) Thomas (1596-~1646) (5) William (1598-) (6) Dorothy (Dorothea) (~1611-) (7) Alan (9) Katherine (Christian)'''
