1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JOHN BOYLE OF KELBURN===
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''formerly John Boyle of Polruskane'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/bb4fz/boyle01.php Stirnet: Boyle 01]
2 CONT # [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/bb4fz/boyle02.php Stirnet: Boyle 02]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biographical Summary===
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: John Boyle
2 CONT Surname: Boyle Given Name: John Sex: M Death: BEF 26 Feb 1559/1560 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Patrick Boyle
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Agnes Fraser
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT     Has Children John Boyle of Kelburne
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT     Title: Genealogical Account of the Boyles of Kelburne, Earls of Glasgow
2 CONT     Author: Col. Robert Boyle
2 CONT     Publication: Privately printed, 1904 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Boyle, after the death of his father, and before that of his grandfather, was styled 'of Polruskane.'" On 28 April 1519 John Boyle of Kelburne granted the lands of Kelburne to John Boyle, his grandson and apparent heir, by a 
2 CONC charter which was confirmed 29 May 1549.' On 9 May 1554 John Boyle, grandson and heir apparent of John Boyle of Kelburne, had sasine, as undoubted and nearest heir of the deceased Patrick Boyle, his father, of the 4 merk land of t
2 CONC he Mains of Rysholm.' He died before 26 February 1559-60.' He married Agnes Frascr, who survived him, and was married, secondly, before 14 March 1501-62, to Patrick Crawfurd of Aueliinames. She is said to have been daughter of Joh
2 CONC n Fraser of Knock by Margaret, only child and heir of Sir John Stuart of Glanderston.' She died 6 January 1595.'° By her John Boyle of Kelburne had [Genealogical Account of the Boyles of Kelburne, Earls of Glasgow]
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: [http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=aet%2Dt&id=I36927 rootsweb]
