2 CONT *[S86] Balnagowan, J. Douglas Ross, (http://www.greatclanross.org/htext6.html), http://www.greatclanross.org/htext6.html.
2 CONT *[S6] Stirnet Genealogy, Peter Barns-Graham, Munro02.
