1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===SIR ROBERT CARNEGIE OF KINNAIRD===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===GENEALOGY===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.lundie.org/newsite/book/pdf/Lundy_lundie_lundin_book_benholm.pdf The House of Benholm]
2 CONT #  [http://books.google.com.au/books?id=grI2AAAAIAAJ An Historical Account of the Senators of the College of Justice: From Its Institution in MDXXXII; by George Brunton, David Haig; 1832; Page 90]
2 CONT # [http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p99.htm#i2955 Ancestors]
2 CONT # [http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=ancestorsearch&id=I1583 rootsweb]
