2 CONT William Cavendish, 3rd Duke of Devonshire (1698-1755) is the Ancestor of
2 CONT
2 CONT Victor Cavendish, 9th Duke of Devonshire is William 3rd Duke of Devonshire's daughter's husband's fourth great nephew.
2 CONT
2 CONT Victor Christian William Cavendish, 9th Duke of Devonshire, was born 31 May 1868 in Marylebone, London, England, United Kingdom to Edward Cavendish (1838-1891) and Emma Elizabeth Lascelles (1838-1920) and died 6 May 1938 Chatswort
2 CONC h House, Derbyshire, England, United Kingdom of unspecified causes. He married Evelyn Emily Mary Fitz Maurice (1870-1960) 30 July 1892 . Charlemagne (747-814)/s, Hugh Capet (c940-996)/s.
2 CONT
2 CONT CAVENDISH, VICTOR CHRISTIAN WILLIAM, 9th Duke of DEVONSHIRE, governor general; b. 31 May 1868 in London, England, eldest son of Lord Edward Cavendish and Emma Elizabeth Lascelles; m. there 30 July 1892 Lady Evelyn Emily Mary Petty
2 CONC -Fitzmaurice (d. 1960), elder daughter of the 5th Marquess of Lansdowne [Petty-Fitzmaurice*], and they had two sons and five daughters; d. 6 May 1938 at Chatsworth House, Derbyshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Cavendish, Duke of Devonshire, was born 26 September 1698 in Hardwick Hall, Derbyshire, England, United Kingdom to William Cavendish, 2nd Duke of Devonshire (1672-1729) and Rachel Russell (1674-1725) and died 5 December 17
2 CONC 55 Chatsworth House, Derbyshire, England, United Kingdom of unspecified causes. He married Catherine Hoskins (c1700-1777) 27 March 1718 in Oxted, Surrey, England, United Kingdom. Charlemagne (747-814)/s, Henry II of England (1133-
2 CONC 1189)/s, Hugh Capet (c940-996)/s, William I of England (1027-1087)/s.
