2 CONT
2 CONT '''7 January 1691: Petition of Patrick McDouall of French against the officers of state as representing the forfeited Viscount of Dundee and his brother David Graham. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details
2 CONC .aspx?reference=PA7%2f14&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=viscount+of+dundee&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1650&dt=1700&di=y National Records of Scotland, Supplementary Warrants and Parliamentary Papers, reference PA7/14]'''
