2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anne Graham, here treated: married (liferent charter to her 24 November 1666) to Robert Young of Auldbar. By him she had issue Anna, married (contract 6 February 1707) to James Barclay of Balmakewan. William, eldest son of Anna
2 CONC  and James Barclay of Balmakewan, had the entail, 10 May 1743, of Morphie from Captain Francis Graham, son of Magdalene Graham and Sir Robert Graham of Morphie, on which followed a Crown charter of confirmation 13 February 1744. [
2 CONC https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03paul/page/324/mode/1up The Scots Peerage III: 324]'''
2 CONT
