2 CONC  go to Ireland. The first John COCHRAN was called John of Fernois, of Scotland. The first John COCHRAN was called John of Fernois, of Scotland.  His son Hugh (the eldest) lived on the River Killough.  The second son was John who w
2 CONC ent to sea and no further account was given of him.  James the third son called "Old James of Maboy", was well written in the manuscript by his grandson, Robert (Deaf) COCHRAN.
2 CONT
