2 CONT
2 CONT Jane Drummond was born in 1578.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Robert Ker, 1st Earl of Roxburghe, son of Sir William Ker of Cessford, on 10 January 1614. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 7 October 1643.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was also known as Jean Drummond.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Patrick Drummond, 3rd Lord Drummond and Lady Elizabeth Lindsay. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Kerr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Jane Drummond and Robert Ker, 1st Earl of Roxburghe
