1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Extract from The Scots Peerage (Volume III) by Sir James Balfour Paul (Edinburgh 1906) page 541 (http://archive.org/details/cu31924092516206)
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, 28 April 1607, Elizabeth Drummond, fourth daughter of Patrick, third Lord Drummond, by his first wife, daughter of David (Lindsay), Earl of Crawford. She was living 1 December 1637. He had by her ten children, most of 
2 CONC whom died at an early age :— 1. Alexander, born 6 June 1608 ; died in his third year. 2. James, born 3 June 1609 ; died young. 3. Alexander, born 18 September 1612 ; died young. 4. John, born 6 June 1619 ; died in his second year.
2 CONC  5. Jean, born 8 April 1611 ; died, unmarried, after 1630. 6. Lilias, born 26 November 1613 ; married to her cousin Alexander, sixth Lord Elphinstone. 7. Elisabeth, living in 1633. 8. Mary, born 12 January 1621 ; died young. 9. Is
2 CONC ohel, born 16 June 1623 ; died young. 10. Anna, born 18 July 1625 ; died young.
