2 CONC n Preston, and, second, before 17th April 1582, Agnes Lindsay. He had two sons:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 96(c)1 John Murray of Pardewis, died about 1606.
2 CONT * 96(c)2 '''Patrick Murray of Pardewis'''. Served heir to his brother, 30th October 1606. He married Margaret, daughter of Alexander Colvill, Commendator of Culross.
