1 NAME William ‘of Hightower’ /Armstrong/
2 GIVN William ‘of Hightower’
2 SURN Armstrong
2 _MARNM Armstrong
2 NICK Hightower
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1602
2 ADDR
