2 CONT * < [http://www.thepeerage.com/p26383.htm#i263823 ''thePeerage.com''] > 
2 CONT * Pedigree of Armstrong, Later Heaton Armstrong of Straffan, Co. Kildare, of Farney Castle, Co. Tipperary, and Mount Heaton, Kings Co., C.1640 - 1888.
