2 CONT
2 CONT '''21 November 1617: Disposition and assignation by Robert Graham, younger of Auchincloich, eldest lawful son of Robert Graham, sometime of Grugar and now of Auchincloich and deceased Margaret Montgomery, his spouse, upon reaching
2 CONC  the age of 21 years, in favour of John Montgomery of Cocklebie, his uncle, of a wadset right for an annualrent of £1000 out of the lands of Balmore, Sommerstoun and Malichen, redeemable by payment of £10,000 after the said Robert
2 CONC  reaches the age of 22 years at two terms; at Edinburgh. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD220%2f1%2fA%2f8%2f5%2f3&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=malichen&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y Nationa
