2 CONT '''5 December 1677: Declaration by Archibald, Earl of Argyll, that he will not make use of the tack by Ronald McDonald of Sanda [Macdonald of Sanda] to William Ralstoune of that ilk [Ralston of that ilk], tacksman of the lands of 
2 CONC Machriemore and mills thereof, whereby he has astricted the multures and sequels of his lands to said mills for 15 years, to infer a thirlage thereto. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=G
