1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JAMES WALLACE===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Wallace is the son of William Wallace, elder of Elderslie, very probably his second son. [National Records of Scotland, Commissary Records of Glasgow, The Testament Dative of umqle Wm Wallace elder of Elderslie, reference
2 CONC  CC9/7/20 pp. 585-87] According to the Reverend Charles Rogers, his father was married to Katherine Wallace (aka Katherine Crawfurd) but this is wrong on two counts. First, Katherine Wallace and Katherine Crawford are different pe
2 CONC ople. Second, Katherine Wallace was James Wallace's grandmother, not his mother.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Wallace's name is noticed in the list of debts owed to his deceased aunt Geillis Wallace and her second husband Gabriell Wallace. She died on 21 April 1598: "Item to James Wallace sone lawll to Wm Wallace of Ellirslie of 
2 CONC lent moy xx li." His older brother: "Wm Wallace younger of Ellirslie" was present on 20 April 1598 when his aunt Geillis made her last will and testament at Stanely near Paisley in Renfrewshire. [National Records of Scotland, Edin
2 CONC burgh Commissary Records, The Testament Testamentar of umqle Geillis Wallace ladie Stanelie smtyme spous to Gabriell Wallace lawll sone to Wallace of Ellerslie, reference CC8/8/32 pp. 49-52]''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Following the death of his father in July 1623, James Wallace gave up his testament dative and the inventory of his moveable estate. Confirmation was granted to him on 21 July 1625. [National Records of Scotland, Commissary Rec
2 CONC ords of Glasgow, The Testament Dative of umqle Wm Wallace elder of Elderslie, reference CC9/7/20 pp. 585-87]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===His Father's Testament Dative===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Wallace's father, 'William Wallace, elder of Elderslie, died intestate in July 1623. [National Records of Scotland, Commissary Records of Glasgow, The Testament Dative of umqle Wm Wallace elder of Elderslie, reference CC9
2 CONC /7/20 pp. 585-87]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000076681984218& Image of Testament 1]
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000076693079076& Image of Testament 2]
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000076692978867& Image of Testament 3]
