2 CONT William Graham, 5th Earl of Menteith [1]
2 CONT *M, #23493, 
2 CONT *d. September 1578
2 CONT *Last Edited=19 Aug 2012
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.06%
2 CONT
2 CONT William Graham, 5th Earl of Menteith was the son of John Graham, 4th Earl of Menteith and Marion Seton.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Margaret Douglas, daughter of Sir James Douglas, 7th of Drumlanrig and Christian Montgomerie, circa 16 May 1571.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in September 1578.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded to the title of 5th Earl of Menteith [S., 1427] in January 1564/65.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was invested as a Privy Counsellor (P.C.) [Scotland] in 1577/78.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of William Graham, 5th Earl of Menteith and Margaret Douglas
2 CONT *1. John Graham, 6th Earl of Menteith+1 b. c 1574, d. Dec 1598
2 CONT
