1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == MASTER DAVID MAKGILL OF CRANSTOUN-RIDDELL ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == The Testament Dative and Inventory of his deceased mother Marie Sinclair ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''David Makgill of Cranstoun-Riddell, here treated, gave up the Testament Dative and Inventory of his deceased mother, Marie Sinclair, on 28 June 1609. In this deed his mother is identified as the widow of: "ane honoll man Mr Dav
2 CONC id Makgill of Cranstoun-Riddell ane of the ordinair senators of the College of Justice." Confirmation was granted to him on the same day. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Commissary Court, The Testament Dative and Inventor
2 CONC y of Marie Sinclare, sometime spouse to umquhile Mr. David Makgyll of Cranstoun-Riddell, ordinary senator of the College of Justice, reference CC8/8/45]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000186024940024 Image of Testament Dative]
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000186025258913 Image of Testament Dative]
