2 CONC spouse, according to marriage contract of 25 August 1613. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD25%2f8%2f83b&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=helen+kennedy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Rec
