2 CONC  father of the said Alexander, from all debts contracted by Helen Kennedy, relict of [John] Mure of Auchindrane, his spouse, before date of their marriage contract. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.as
