2 CONT
2 CONT [http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~lelandva/kenne015.htm#id4023 Biographical Summary] 
2 CONT
2 CONT 19. Sir Alexander15 Kennedy of Craignoch (Thomas14, Gilbert13, Gilbert12, David11, John10, Gilbert9, James8, Gilbert7, John6, Gilbert5de Carrick, Gilbert4, Roland3, Nicol,2, Duncan1) married Agnes Kennedy, daughter of Thomas Kenne
2 CONC dy of Ardmillan.90 He died in 1652.91 
2 CONT
2 CONT He acquired Culzean from his brother in 1622.92
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir Alexander15 Kennedy of Craignoch and Agnes Kennedy were as follows: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i. John16 succeeded to Culzean, ancestor of tenth Earl of Cassillis. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 21. ii. Alexander of Craigoch and Kilhenzie, m. Anna Crawford. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Major Thomas of Baltersan. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. James. 
