2 CONT [http://www.thepeerage.com/p2430.htm#i24297 Biographical Summary by Darryl Lundy's Peerage]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Alexander Kennedy1 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #24297, d. September 1652
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=29 Jun 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      Sir Alexander Kennedy was the son of Sir Thomas Kennedy, Master of Cassillis and Elizabeth McGill.1 He married Agnes Kennedy, daughter of Thomas Kennedy.2 He died in September 1652.2
2 CONT
2 CONT      Sir Alexander Kennedy was invested as a Knight in 1632.2 He lived at Culzean, Ayrshire, Scotland.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir Alexander Kennedy and Agnes Kennedy
