1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JAMES EDMONSTONE===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Edmonstone, here treated, is the bastard son of Sir James Edmonstone of Duntreath. The name of his mother in not known. On 25 January 1596-97 he witnessed a sasine made in favour of Ninian Steward and his wife Dorothy Bri
2 CONC sbayne. [https://archive.org/details/abstractsofproto10glas/page/63/mode/1up Glasgow Protocols X: 3175]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the Protocol Books of the Town Clerks of Glasgow===
2 CONT
2 CONT 25 January 1596-97: [https://archive.org/details/abstractsofproto10glas/page/63/mode/1up Glasgow Protocols X: 3175]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Secondary Source Evidence===
2 CONT
