1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JOHN EDMONSTONE===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Edmonstone, here treated, is the lawful son of Sir James Edmonstone of Duntreath. He may be a son of his father's first wife, Helen Stirling, but, presently, the name of his mother is not known. On 25 January 1596-97, acti
2 CONC ng as his father's bailie, he gave sasine of an annualrent to Ninian Steward and his wife Dorothy Brisbayne. [https://archive.org/details/abstractsofproto10glas/page/63/mode/1up Glasgow Protocols X: 3175]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the Protocol Books of the Town Clerks of Glasgow===
