2 CONC  conform to dispostion granted by him and Anna Graham, his wife, with consent of Adam Bellenden, elder of Stenhous.''' Recorded in the particular register of sasines for Orkney 22 June 1627. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrs
2 CONC onlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD1%2f45%2f22&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=adam+Bellenden&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Title deeds to lands in Orkney, reference GD1/45/22]
