2 CONC rticular register of sasines for Orkney 15 June 1633. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD1%2f45%2f26&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=+Bellenden&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of 
2 CONC Scotland, Title deeds to lands in Orkney, reference GD1/45/26]
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT 25 June 1633: Charter of sale by Edward Swanna, indweller in Swanna, above the hill in Birsay, and Margaret Brek, his spouse, to George Bellenden of Midhous of their four merk udal land in Brek in Costa in the parish of Evie. Give
2 CONC n at the place of Birsay. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD1%2f45%2f27&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=+Bellenden&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Title deeds to lan
2 CONC ds in Orkney, reference GD1/45/27]
