2 CONC n Kirkwall, with consent of Jonet Robertson, his wife, and Archibald Dundas of Arrisdaill, dated 27 March 1635. Registered in the particular register of sasines for Orkney 21 April 1635. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonli
2 CONC necatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD1%2f45%2f32&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=+Bellenden&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Title deeds to lands in Orkney, reference GD1/45/32]
