2 CONC he parish of Evie. Given at Edinburgh. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD1%2f45%2f43&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=+Bellenden&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Title
