2 CONT
2 CONT Annas Ballenden (aka Agnes Ballenden) is the daughter of Robbert Ballenden of How. [https://archive.org/stream/publicationsofsc27scot#page/448/mode/1up Records of the Earldom of Orkney]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Her Testament Datrive===
2 CONT
2 CONT 29 August 1679 Commissary Records of Orkney and Shetland, reference [CC17/2/12]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT Annas Ballenden married Gilbert Sinclair of Essinquoy. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD31%2f56&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=+Bellenden&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Sco
2 CONC tland, Papers of the family of Fea of Clestrain, Orkney, reference GD31/56]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Second Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Ballenden (aka Agnes Ballenden married Robert Halcro of Aetoft. [https://archive.org/stream/publicationsofsc27scot#page/448/mode/1up Records of the Earldom of Orkney, p. 448] They were married before 10 August 1647. [http://c
2 CONC atalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD31%2f63&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=+Bellenden&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the family of Fea of Clestrain, Orkney, referen
2 CONC ce GD31/63]
