2 CONT ===CAPTAIN JAMES STEWART (aka DUCI JACOBI SSTEWART)===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Captain James Stewart is the son of Robert Stewart of Culbeg. [https://archive.org/stream/registerprivyco03coungoog#page/n399/mode/1up RPCS: page 339] 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Captain James Stewart died before 21 June 1634. [RGSS: 143]'''
