2 CONT '''14 November 1654: Discharge by Mr Johne Dishingtoune to George Smyth for two meils meal in payment of the board of Harie and Walter Stewart, sons of the deceased Mr Walter Stewart. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinec
