2 CONT '''Margaret Craig, here treated, is the eldest daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Craig-writer-in-Edinburgh/6000000151449149909?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1600522444423&through=6000000151713937891 The name of her mother 
