1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Agnes Gray:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p2811.htm#i28106
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes Gray [1]
2 CONT *F, #28106
2 CONT *Last Edited=30 Apr 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.29%
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes Gray was the daughter of Patrick Gray, 4th Lord Gray and Marion Ogilvy.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, Robert Logan of Restalrig.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, thirdly, Sir Thomas Lyon of Auldbar.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Alexander Home, 5th Lord Home, son of George Home, 4th Lord Home and Mariot Halyburton, before 3 May 1568.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Lyon.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Logan.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From before 3 May 1568, her married name became Home.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Agnes Gray and Alexander Home, 5th Lord Home
2 CONT *1. Isabel Home [2]
2 CONT *2. Alexander Home, 1st Earl of Home+[2] b. c 1566, d. 5 Apr 1619
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 1642. Hereinafter cited as Burke's 
2 CONC Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT *2. [S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 2, page 1949.
