2 CONT '''     Mary Gray was born circa 1542 at of Buttergask, Ardoch, Perthshire, Scotland. She married Sir David Seaton, Comptroller of Scotland''', son of Sir Gilbert Seton and Helen Leslie, '''circa 12 April 1568 at Drumkilbo, Tays, 
2 CONC Scotland. Mary Gray died after 1600.'''
