2 CONT '''     Mary Gray was the daughter of''' Patrick Gray, 4th Lord Gray and Marion Ogilvy.1,2 '''She married David Seton, 7th of Parbroath''', son of Gilbert Seton of Parbroath, younger and Lady Helen Leslie, '''in 1568.'''2
2 CONT '''     From 1568, her married name became Seton'''.2
2 CONT '''Children of Mary Gray and David Seton, 7th of Parbroath'''
