2 CONT '''     James Gray was born circa 1552 at of Buttergask, Ardoch, Perthshire, Scotland. He married Elizabeth Bethune''', daughter of Sir John Bethune, 2nd Laird of Creich and Janet Hay, '''in June 1573.1 James Gray and Elizabeth Be
