2 CONC 400 merks each, not to harm James, Commendator of Incheffray, Johne Drummond, son of the late Andro Drummond of Balliclone, Patrik Grahame of Inchebreky, David Drummond tutor of Drummenerinoch, William Drummond, portioner of Belli
2 CONC clone, Johne Broune, burgess of Perth, tutors and curators to the said Johne, MARGARET CAMPBELL, RELICT OF THE SAID ANDRO, ALEXANDER M'GRUDER, NOW HER SPOUSE, William Drummond, younger of Belliclone, William Moreis there, Johne Lo
2 CONC utfute or Hew Eilsoun (Neilsoun) there. - Mr. Thomas Wilsoune, advocate, registers the band, written by Adam Oswald, notary public, and subscribed at [ - ], 25th May, before Johne Vaus of Fornoch, Robert Murray, son and apparent h
2 CONC eir of Andro Murray of Lacok, James Oswald in Tullibardin, and said writer hereof. [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=hvd.32044032327793&view=1up&seq=691 The Register of the Privy Council of Scotland. Edited and Abridged by D
