1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sir John Sinclair''' (b. after 1567, d. before 21 December 1627) was the son of John Sinclair, Master of Caithness and Lady Jean Hepburn.2 He married Janet Sutherland. He died before 21 December 1627.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 7 April 1613 he was granted the charter of the Rattar by his elder brother, 5th Earl of Caithness.1 He lived at Greenland, Scotland. He lived at Rattar, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Child of Sir John Sinclair and Janet Sutherland===
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sir James Sinclair+
2 CONT
