1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===SIR JOHN SINCLAIR OF DUNBEATH===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''11 November 1598: Precept under the signet for the intimation of the assignation made by George Sinclair of Mey, for fulfilling a contract with John, lord Forbes, and the deceased William, lord Forbes, to James, John, Elizabeth
2 CONC , Agnes and Barbara Sinclair, sons and daughters of the said George and of Margaret Forbes, his spouse, of the profits and duties of the said George's lands for certain crops and years. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlin
2 CONC ecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD96%2f281&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=lord+forbes&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1570&dt=1610&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Sinclair family of Mey, Caithness, reference GD96/281]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir John Sinclair, of Dunbeath</strong>, co Caithness, 2nd son of the Hon. George Sinclair of Mey, by Margaret, daughter of William (Forbes), Lord Forbes [S], which George was younger son of George, Earl of Caithness [S],
2 CONC  is said to have been created a Baronet [S] 3 January 1631, with rem. to the heirs male of his body. He was M.P. [S] for Caithness-shire 1649-50. He married firstly, before 31 July 1634 (when she was living as his wife) Christian,
2 CONC  daughter of Magnaus Mowat of Buchollie. He married secondly, Catherine (born 1619), daughter of Hugh (Fraser), Lord Lovat [S], by Isabel, daughter of Sir John Wemyss. He was living May 1650 (Act Parliament) but died s.p.m. probab
2 CONC ly shortly afterwards, when the Baronetcy became extinct. His widow married, as his second wife, Robert (Arbuthnott), 1st Viscount Arbuthnott [S], who died 10 October 1655. She married, thirdly, in 1663, Andrew (Fraser) 3rd Lord F
2 CONC raser [S], who died 22 May 1674."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n409/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 391
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
