1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == LADY MARGARET SOMERVILLE ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Mary Somerville, here treated, is the elder daughter of Sir James Somerville of Cambusnethan (Velvet Eye). [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08paul/page/26/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VIII: 26]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == First Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Margaret Somerville, here treated, married Gilbert Somerville, eighth Lord Somerville in April 1592. Lord Somerville died in 1618. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08paul/page/26/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VIII
2 CONC : 26]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children of First Marriage == 
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/James-Somerville-Master-of-Somerville/6000000168156600821?through=6000000018044818473
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Somerville/6000000168156267886?through=6000000018044818473
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Somerville/6000000168156953821?through=6000000018044818473
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Somerville/6000000168156919847?through=6000000018044818473
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Second Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Following the death of her first husband, who died in 1618, Lady Margaret Somerville, here treated, married Sir James Muirhead of Lauchope. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08paul/page/26/mode/1up The Scots Peerage 
2 CONC VIII: 26] They were married before 7 March 1622. [NRS: RS40/I/144]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''21 March 1618 x 7 March 1622: James Muirhead of Lauchope, son of James Muirheid of Lauchope. James Muirheid, younger of Lauchope. Margaret Somerville, spouse of James Muirheid, younger of Lauchope. [Particular Register of Sasin
2 CONC es for the Sheriffdom of Lanark, reference RS40/I/144]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''26 January 1627 x 26 November 1631:  James Muirhead of Muirheid, son of James Muirheid of Lauchope. James Muirheid, younger of Lauchope. Margaret Somerville, spouse of James Muirheid, younger of Lauchope. [Particular Register o
2 CONC f Sasines for the Sheriffdom of Lanark, reference RS40/IIIA/332]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''12 January 1665: Margaret Somervell, relict of Gilbert, Lord Somervell, and spouse of James Muirhead, elder of Lauchope. James Muirhead, elder of Lauchope. [Register of Deeds, Grantees in Bond registered in the Office of Macken
2 CONC zie. Volume 12. Page 9] [https://archive.org/details/indexes400scotuoft/page/334/mode/1up Index to the Register of Deeds for 1665: pp. 334-35]'''
2 CONT
