2 CONT '''James Somerville, here treated, is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/James-Somerville-of-Cambusnethan/6000000181346052850?through=6000000181346465884 In a bond dated 24 January 1624 he is identified as the brother of https
2 CONC ://www.geni.com/people/John-Somerville-of-Cambusnethan/6000000181345145866?through=6000000181346465884 [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD109%2f1208&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=james+ki
