2 CONT William Stewart, 2nd Lord Blantyre was the son of Walter Stewart, 1st Lord of Blantyre and Nichola Somerville.1 He married Helen Scott, daughter of Sir William Scott and Jean Skene, before 12 August 1615.1 He died on 29 November 1
2 CONC 638.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He was invested as a Knight Bachelor on 2 June 1610.1 He succeeded to the title of 2nd Lord Blantyre [S., 1606] on 8 March 1617.1
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=maclaren&id=I40999
2 CONT
2 CONT William Stewart, 2nd Lord Blantyre was the son of Walter Stewart, 1st Lord of Blantyre and Nichola Somerville.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Helen Scott, daughter of Sir William Scott and Jean Skene, before 12 August 1615. He died on 29 November 1638.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was invested as a Knight Bachelor on 2 June 1610.1 He succeeded to the title of 2nd Lord Blantyre [S., 1606] on 8 March 1617.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p13098.htm#i130971
