2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anna Stewart, here treated: 'called senior filia, married (marriage-contract 30 December 1608) to John, eighth Lord Abernethy of Saltoun. He died in 1612, and his widow had subsequently, by James. Marquess of Hamilton, a natura
2 CONC l daughter, Margaret, who was married to James Hamilton, first Lord Belhaven.' [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun02pauluoft/page/85/mode/1up The Scots Peerage II: 85]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''30 April [1642]: Anna Stewart to the earl of Lanrike [Lanark], asking his support for the petition of her son, Lord Saltoun, who seeks a grant of certain escheats. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details
2 CONC .aspx?reference=GD406%2f1%2f1619&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Anna+Stewart&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1615&dt=1650&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Douglas Hamilton Family, Dukes of Hamilton and Brandon, reference GD406/1/1619]
2 CONC '''
2 CONT
