2 CONT
2 CONT == Bogus Genealogy Published by MyHeritage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Dorothy Stewart (born Dunlop), 1593 - Circa 1645. Dorothy Stewart (born Dunlop) was born on month day 1593, at birth place, to Robert Dunlop and Esther Dunlap (born Poole) .Robert was born Circa 1560, in Glasgow, Lanarkshire, S
2 CONC cotland. Esther was born Circa 1570, in Glasgow, Lanarkshire, Scotland. Dorothy married James Stewart on month day 1614, at age 21 at marriage place . James was born on May 3 1584, in Dunfermline, Fife, Scotland. They had 10 child
2 CONC ren: Mary Elizabeth Hande (born Stewart) , Duncan Stewart and 8 other children . Dorothy passed away on month day 1645, at age 52 at death place [https://www.myheritage.com/names/dorothy_dunlop MyHeritage]'''
