2 CONT ===[http://www.clandunlop.com/ Biographical Summary from Clan Dunlop]===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Thomas DUNLOP, 1st. of Househill. Born in 1596 in Paisley, Renfrewshire, Scotland, Thomas died in about 1646; he was about 50 years of age. Thomas married Grizell COCKRANE, daughter of Alexander COCKRANE of that Ilk & ? ?. She 
2 CONC was born in about 1615. They had one child: James'''
