2 CONT
2 CONT == Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Dunlop of that Ilk, here treated, died intestate in May 1634. [NRS: CC9/7/26]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == His Testament Dative and Inventory ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Confirmation was granted on 15 September 1634. [National Records of Scotland, Glasgow Commissary Court, The Testament Dative and Inventory of James Dunlope of that Ilk, reference CC9/7/26]'''
