2 CONC id father, to be pursued for payment of bond, (undated) by said deceased Sir John as cautioner for £1,000 scots. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD109%2f2167&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&
