2 CONT ===Her Mother's Testament Dative===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jean Lundie, widow of James Buchanan ofSheriffhall, died intestate on 6 May 1633. Her testament dative and inventory  was given up by John Buchanan and Anna Buchanan: "lawfull sone & dochter to the defunct exrs surrogate to the
2 CONC ir said umwle mothir". Confirmation was granted to her children on 29 June 1633. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Commissary Court, The Testament Dative and Inventory of Jeane Lundie, relict of James Buchannan of Sheriffha
2 CONC ll, reference CC8/8/56]'''
