1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JAMES GRAHAM===
2 CONT
2 CONT His father gave him Russland in Harray but he became a merchant  and settled in Edinburgh, where he died. [James M. Irvine, The Breckness Estate: A History of its Lairds, Tenants and Farms, and Skaill House (James M. Irvine, 2009)
2 CONC , p. 28]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT James Graham married Margaret Heart.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Second Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT James Graham married Margaret Nisbet.The marriage was booked on 5 February 1661, at Kirkwall in Orkney, Scotland. [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:XYSL-1JX Kirkwall Marriage Records]
