2 CONC t Ola. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD150%2f1666&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=+heart&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1700&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Earls of Morton, ref
