2 CONC ber 1643. and Bond of Corroboration by John Wynraham, of date 10 March 1653 [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD122%2f2%2f194&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=james+graham&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1570
