1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===REVEREND MR. PATRICK GRAHAM OF ROTHIESHOLM===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Minister of the Gospel and Holm and Paplay===
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://archive.org/stream/fastiecclesiaesc00scot#page/218/mode/1up Fasti Ecclesiae Scoticanae: the Succession of Ministers in the Church of Scotland from the Reformation, vii, p. 218]
2 CONT
2 CONT === Biographical Summary ===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Patrick Grahame of Rothiesholm and Graemeshall, born 1610, second son of George G., Bishop of Orkney; educated at Univ. of St Andrews; M.A. (1630); pres. by his father 5th April 1634; dep. by the Assembly July 1649; died 16 Jan
2 CONC . 1675. He marr. (1) (cont. 26th Jan. 1638), Annas (died March 1657), daugh. of William Stewart of Mains, and had issue - Barbara; Margaret; Katherine; Jean (marr. 1665, David Craigie of Oversanday); Ann (marr. 17th Dec. 1683, Tho
2 CONC mas Traill of Westove); Christian (marr. David Drummond), died 3rd March 1681; (2) Margaret Sinclair, who died 14th Feb. 1681, and had issue - James of Graemeshall; Henry'''
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/fastiecclesiaesc00scot#page/218/mode/2up Fasti ecclesiae scoticanae: the succession of ministers in the Church of Scotland from the reformation], Vol. VII, page 218
