2 CONT http://www.h-f-h.org.uk/gallery/crawfords.pdf
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT John Boyle of Kelburne Surname: Boyle Given Name: John Suffix: of Kelburne Sex: M Death: 1 Aug 1611 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: John Boyle Mother: Agnes Fraser
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Marion Crawfurd
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT     Has Children John Boyle b: ABT 1585
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT     Title: Genealogical Account of the Boyles of Kelburne, Earls of Glasgow
2 CONT     Author: Col. Robert Boyle
2 CONT     Publication: Privately printed, 1904 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Boyle of Kelburne was of lawful age when he succeeded his father (before 26 February 1559-60). On 1 June 1500 he had sasine of the lands of Kelburne, etc., proceeding on precept of Clare Constat from Chancery in his favour as
2 CONC  heir of his father." On 15 July 1583 he was served heir to his great-grandfather (iv. John Boyle) in the office of Maor of fee within the bounds of the lordship of Largs, etc.'" He was a most zealous loyalist in the service of Qu
2 CONC een Mary during the civil wars." On 21 November 1577 he seems to have executed a bond of man-rent in favour of Robert, Lord Boyd, under the style of John Boyle of Rysholm, whereby he bound himself, with his household, tenants, and
2 CONC  friends, etc., to ride with the said noble lord.' he executed a disposition and settlement by way of contract with John Boyle, his eldest son and apparent heir, dated 31 October 1610,' and died on 1 August 1611.' He married Mario
2 CONC n Crawfurd, second (daughter of Hugh Crawfurd of Kilbiruie. Her mother was Isobel Barclay,' daughter of David Barclay of Ladyland, second wife of the said Hugh. Marion Crawfurd died in the month of October 1596. John Boyle had by 
2 CONC her. [Genealogical Account of the Boyles of Kelburne, Earls of Glasgow]
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=aet-t&id=I93932
2 CONT ---------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
