1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===MARGARET LIVINGSTON===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Livingston is the daughter of Sir William Livingston of Kilsyth and his second wife Margaret Houston. [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft#page/190/mode/1up The Scots Peerage V: p. 190]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Livingston married Robert Montgomery of Hessilhead. They were contacted on 10 April 1656. [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft#page/190/mode/1up The Scots Peerage V: p. 190] The marriage was booked on
2 CONC  29 April 1656, at Kilsyth in Stirlingshire, Scotland. [National Records of Scotland, Kilsyth Marriages, reference OPR.483/1]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT # 
