2 CONT [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft#page/n6/mode/1up The Scots Peerage etc Edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, LL.D., Lord Lyon King of Arms, Volume V (David Douglas, Edinburgh, 1908), 640 pp. Dee pp. 183-96 for L
2 CONC ivingston, Viscount Kilsyth]
