2 CONT     William Livingston, b. 07 January 1638, Lanarch, SCOTLAND, d. 12 June 1700, Edinburgh, SCOTLAND.
2 CONT     Bartholomew Livingston, b. 03 September 1639, Stranraer, SCOTLAND, d. 24 September 1641, Stranraer, SCOTLAND.
2 CONT     Agnes Livingston, b. 20 September 1640, Stranraer, SCOTLAND, d. 17 October 1641, Stranraer, SCOTLAND.
2 CONT     Marion Livingston, b. 10 October 1642, Stranraer, SCOTLAND, d. July 1667, Hawick, SCOTLAMD.
2 CONT     Janet Livingston, b. 28 September 1643, Stranraer, SCOTLAND, d. August 1696, Hawick, SCOTLAMD.
2 CONT     John (2nd) Livingston, b. 20 August 1644, Stranraer, SCOTLAND, d. October 1645, Stranraer, SCOTLAND.
2 CONT     Agnes(2nd) Livingston, b. 18 October 1645, Stranraer, SCOTLAND.
2 CONT     James Livingston, b. 22 September 1646, Stranraer, SCOTLAND, d. 04 June 1700, Edinburgh, SCOTLAND.
2 CONT     Joanna Livingston, b. September 1647, Stranraer, SCOTLAND, d. October 1648, Ancrum, Teviotdale, SCOTLAND.
2 CONT     Barbara Livingston, b. 21 June 1649, Ancrum, Teviotdale, SCOTLAND, d. Bef. 1690, Edinburgh, SCOTLAND.
2 CONT     John (3rd) Livingston, b. 24 June 1652, Ancrum, Teviotdale, SCOTLAND, d. 12 October 1652, Ancrum, Teviotdale, SCOTLAND.
2 CONT     Andrew Livingston, b. August 1653, Ancrum, Teviotdale, SCOTLAND, d. 07 February 1655, Ancrum, Teviotdale, SCOTLAND.
2 CONT     +Robert Livingston, b. 13 December 1654, Ancrum, Teviotdale, SCOTLAND, d. 01 October 1728, Livingston Manor, New York, USA.
2 CONT     Elizabeth Livingston, b. 07 January 1657, Ancrum, Teviotdale, SCOTLAND, d.31 October 1666, Rotterdam, HOLLAND. 
