1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://awt.ancestrylibrary.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=:1397503&id=I24042&ti=5542
2 CONT
2 CONT 	Patrick CRAUFORD , 12th Laird of Auchinames (William CRAUFORD , 11th Laird of Auchinames6, Margaret FRASER , Lady of Auchinames5, Margaret STUART , Lady of Knockie4, Sir John STUART , Laird of Henrieston3, Sir John STUART , 1st o
2 CONC r 10th Earl of Lennox2, Sir John STUART , Count Devercux & Field Marshal1) was born ABT 1580 in Auchinames, co. Ayr, Scotland, and died Jan 1648/49 in Auchinames, co. Ayr, Scotland. He married Jane CRAUFORD , Lady of Crosby 1606, 
2 CONC daughter of James CRAWFORD , Laird of Crosby and Elizabeth CUNNINGHAM , Lady Cunningham. She was born ABT 1585 in Crosby, co. Ayr, Scotland, and died in Auchinames, co. Ayr, Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jane was Patrick's second cousin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT # [http://www.clancrawford.org/chiefs.asp Crawford Clan Chiefs] Crawfords of Auchinames-Crosbie.  Patrick, 12th Laird of Auchinames, grandson of #24, b ~1580, m Jean Crawford 1606, heiress of the estate of Crosbie, reuniting the a
2 CONC ncient Crawford estates of Auchinames and Crosbie (Corsbie)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://awt.ancestrylibrary.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=:1397503&id=I24043&ti=5542
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrick's marriage to Jean Crawford, heiress of the estate of Crosbie, reunited the ancient Crawford estates of Auchinames and Crosbie.
