2 CONT **2.Lady Elizabeth Cavendish1
2 CONT **3.William Cavendish, 2nd Duke of Devonshire+1 b. c 1673, d. 4 Jun 1729
2 CONT **4.Lord Henry Cavendish+1 b. 1673, d. 10 May 1700
