2 CONT *''''''Lady Anne Cavendish was the daughter of William Cavendish, 3rd Earl of Devonshire and Lady Elizabeth Cecil.1 She married, firstly, Charles Rich, Lord Rich, son of Charles Rich, 4th Earl of Warwick, before 1664.4 She and Joh
2 CONC n Cecil, 5th Earl of Exeter obtained a marriage license on 4 May 1670.4
2 CONT *''''''      From before 1664, her married name became Rich.4 From 4 May 1670, her married name became Cecil.
