1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == JAMES GRAHAM second Viscount Dundee, Lord Graham of Claverhouse ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Graham, second Viscount of Dundee and Lord Graham of Claverhouse, is the only son of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Graham-of-Claverhouse-Viscount-Dundee/6000000018446246040?through=6000000024015347064 and his wife http
2 CONC s://www.geni.com/people/Jean-Cochrane/6000000017898429445?through=6000000024015347064 He was born before 9 April 1689, the date upon which his baptism was registered at Mains in Angus, Scotland. [National Records of Scotland, Main
2 CONC s Baptisms, reference OPR.307/2] He died before 3 December 1689. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/page/331/mode/1up The Scots Peerage III: 331]'''
