1 NAME Francis /Graham of Morphie/
2 GIVN Francis
2 SURN Graham of Morphie
2 _MARNM Graham of Morphie
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 17 FEB 1744
1 OCCU
1 TITL Captain
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == CAPTAIN FRANCIS GRAHAM OF MORPHIE ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Captain Francis Graham of Morphie, here treated, is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Graham-of-Morphie/6000000035158407184?through=6000000206900836829 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Magdalene-Graham/60000
2 CONC 00035157978678?through=6000000206900836829 [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/gg/graham10.php Stirnet: Graham 10]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Captain Francis Graham of Morphie succeeded his father before 12 February 1726, when he had signature of the lands of Morphie. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=SIG1%2f68%2f31&st=1&t
2 CONC c=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=francis+graham&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1750&di=y NRS: SIG1/68/31]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''A date and place of death has not been identified for Captiain Francis Graham, here treated. However, he probably died before 13 February 1744, when the lands of Morphie passed to https://www.geni.com/people/William-Barclay-of-
2 CONC Morphie/6000000175724950826, the son of his maternal cousin, https://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Young-Barclay/6000000175724905843 [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/page/324/mode/1up T
2 CONC he Scots Peerage III: 324]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == His Testament Dative and Inventory ==
2 CONT
2 CONT GRAHAME
2 CONT FRANCIS
2 CONT 3 / 1 / 1744
2 CONT CAPTAIN, OF MORPHIE
2 CONT ...
2 CONT BRECHIN COMMISSARY COURT
2 CONT CC3/4/21
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''12 February 1726: Signature of the lands of Morphie Meikle and Pilmore granted to Capt Francis Graham (Graem, Graeme, Grahame). [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=SIG1%2f68%2f31&st=1&
2 CONC tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=francis+graham&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1750&di=y National Records of Scotland, Register of Signatures, boxed series, reference SIG1/68/31]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''13 February 1744: Signature of the lands of Morphie Meikle granted to William Barclay (Barkly) alias Graham. [ttps://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=SIG1%2f69%2f55&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&
2 CONC k=william+barclay&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1730&dt=1750&di=y National Records of Scotland, Register of Signatures, boxed series, reference SIG1/69/55]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/gg/graham10.php Stirnet: Graham 10]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/page/324/mode/1up The Scots Peerage III: 324]'''
