2 CONT "V. <strong>Hugh Munro, fourth of Balconie</strong>. He married Euphemia, daughter of Andrew Monro, V. of Milntown with issue — 
2 CONT * Robert, his heir and successor. 
2 CONT * George, who died unmarried. 
2 CONT * John
2 CONT * William
2 CONT * Andrew. 
2 CONT * Agones, who, as his third wife, married George Munro, II. of Katewell, with issue. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh died about 1640, when he was succeeded by his eldest son."
2 CONT
