2 CONT < [http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ss4tz/strachan01.php#lk1 Stirnet - Strachan01’] >
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. Sir John Strachan of Thornton (b c1516, d 20.08.1587). m. Margaret Erskine (dau of John Erskine of Dun by Margaret Ruthven)
2 CONT **A. Alexander Strachan of Thornton (d 05.1601) m1. Isobel Keith (dau of William Keith, Master of Marischal, by Elizabeth Hay)
2 CONT *** iv.	Elizabeth Strachan possible duplication here ?? 	m. William Forbes of Corse (d 1596)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/GDGM-B7F
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Elizabeth Strachan:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p17647.htm#i176463
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Strachan [1]
2 CONT *F, #176463
2 CONT *Last Edited=13 Jan 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Strachan is the daughter of unknown Strachan of Thornton.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married William Forbes of Corse, son of Patrick Forbes of Corse and Marjory Lumsden.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT She lived at Thornton, England.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Forbes.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Strachan and William Forbes of Corse
2 CONT *1. Sir Arthur Forbes, 1st Bt.+1 d. 14 Apr 1632
2 CONT *2. William Forbes of Menie and Craigievar+2 d. Dec 1627
2 CONT *3. John Forbes+2
2 CONT *4. Patrick Forbes of Corse+2 b. 1564
2 CONT
