1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Life Summary of Alexander
2 CONT
2 CONT When Sir Alexander Carnegie of Pittarrow was born in 1602, in Kinnaird Castle, Angus, Scotland, United Kingdom, his father, First Earl David Carnagie, was 27 and his mother, Countess Margaret Lindsay, was 24. He married Margaret A
2 CONC rbuthnott on 25 June 1640, in Arbuthnott, Aberdeenshire, Scotland, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 10 sons and 4 daughters. He died in March 1682, in Scotland, United Kingdom, at the age of 80.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Family Search.Org
