1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===LADY LILIAS ELPHINSTONE===
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Lilias Elphinstone</strong> was the daughter of Alexander, fifth Lord Elphinstone, and Dame Elizabeth Elphinstone, his wife. He birth is recorded in the Elphinstone Birthday Book in the words <em>Lilias Elphinstone was bo
2 CONC rne the 26 of November 1613, who was  married</em>.  Of the numerous children born to her parents she remained at the time of her majority in 1635 the sole survivor." [http://archive.org/stream/elphinstonefamil01fras#page/n345/mod
2 CONC e/2up The Elphinstone family book of the lords Elphinstone, Balmerino, and Coupar, Vol. I, page 211]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogical Accounts===
