1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == RACHEL LINDSAY ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Rachel Lindsay was not married to Opie Lindsay.  She was married to Lt. Col Bernard Lindsay In Dec of 1640  Her son Robert was born in 1641 and taken to VA. by his half Uncle (by second marriage of Sir Jerome) He was 11 yrs o
2 CONC ld on landing Va. Northumberland Co. 1652.  I am sure that someone else put in this mistake concerning her marriage.  This first Opie Lindsay was Roberts son.  His grandson was Col Robert Lindsay ,builder of the Mount Plantation. 
2 CONC in Fairfax Co.Va/
2 CONT Edit by Capt. Joseph W. Lindsay Haley III Esq ATP FSA Scot
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Opie Lindsay is the grandson of Lt. Col. Bernard Lindsay and wife Rachel Lindsay.  Their son is Robert, his son is the first Opie in the family.
