2 CONT Historical Records of the Family of Leslie from 1067 to 1868-9 ..., Volume 3 By Charles Joseph Leslie Page 330-331 [http://books.google.com/books?id=lyENAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA330#v=onepage&q=&f=false GoogleBooks] 
