2 CONC roximately 15 children born to his parents that included: Margaret Armstrong (1737–1817), who married Rev. George Duffield (1732–1790),[2] and Rebecca Armstrong (1738–1828), who married James Turner (1737–1803).[3][4]]  In 1747, A
2 CONC rmstrong was married to Rebecca Lyon Armstrong (1719–1797),[13] [daughter of Archibald Armstrong and Ann Armstrong.[6]] Together, they were the parents of:[14] James and John.  Comment: contains errors.
