2 CONT Succeeded to his father's estate, which was then divided between his two daughters - John Armstrong, 'The pedigree of the family of Armstrongs' (National Library of Ireland Ms 5216). Another version of this, that continued by the 
2 CONC Rev. W. A. Armstrong (no imprint, 1813), is attached as Source WAArmstrong p6.
