2 CONT
2 CONT '''Kathrine Pollock is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Pollock-of-Mearns/6000000042538027858?through=6000000203870086856 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Catherine-Ralston/6000000042538220828?through=600
2 CONC 0000203870086856 She was born before 23 December 1677, the date upon which her baptism was registered at Kilwinning in the Cunningham division of Ayrshire, Scotland. Her baptismal record reads as follows: "December 1677 . . Kathri
2 CONC ne Polock lall daughter to Rot Pollock & Kathrine Ralston baptized the 23 day." [National Records of Scotland, Kilwinning Baptisms, reference OPR.599/1] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000204114332832 Image of Bapt
