2 CONT
2 CONT *Father	Archibald Campbell,   b. Abt 1530, Lochnell, Ardchattan, Argyllshire, Scotland  ,   d. 4 Oct 1594, Glenlivet, Banffshire, Scotland   (Age ~ 64 years) 
2 CONT *Mother	Jane MacDougall,   b. Abt 1532, Dunollie, Argyllshire, Scotland  ,   d. Yes, date unknown Married	Abt 1560 	Dunollie, Argyllshire, Scotland    [1, 2, 3] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 
2 CONT #Isabel MacDougall,   b. Abt 1570, Raray, Kilninver Parish, Lorn, Argyllshire, Scotland  ,   d. Yes, date unknown  Married	Abt 1591 	Netherlorn, Argyllshire, Scotland    [1, 2] 
