2 CONT *1. John Campbell,   b. Abt 1592, Lochnell, Ardchattan, Argyllshire, Scotland  ,   d. 2 Feb 1645, Inverlochy, Inverness-Shire, Scotland   (Age ~ 53 years)
2 CONT *+2. Isobel Campbell,   b. Abt 1614, Lochnell, Ardchattan, Argyllshire, Scotland  ,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT *+3. Duncan Campbell,   b. 1596, Lochnell, Ardchattan, Argyllshire, Scotland  ,   d. 2 May 1695  (Age 99 years)
2 CONT *+4. Janet Campbell,   b. Abt 1603, Lochnell, Ardchattan, Argyllshire, Scotland  ,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT * 	5. Lochetive Campbell,   b. Abt 1609, Lochnell, Ardchattan, Argyllshire, Scotland  ,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT *+6. Mary "Mairi na Gleann" Campbell,   b. Abt 1610, Lochnell, Ardchattan, Argyllshire, Scotland  ,   d. Yes, date unknown
