2 CONT  	m. (1664) Margaret Shaw (dau of John Shaw of Ballygellie)
2 CONT  	i.	James Stewart of Killymoon
2 CONT  	m. (1709) Helen Agnew (dau of Patrick Agnew of co. Antrim) a.	William Stewart of Killymoon & Ballymenagh, Sheriff of co. Tyrone (b 1710, d 1797)
