2 CONT ===The Heraldry of the Hamiltons===
2 CONT
2 CONT =====Note: Pg. 15 Ch. 11 'The Hamiltons of Bargany' Ref. Sir John Hamilton of Lettrick=====
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) [http://archive.org/stream/heraldryofhamils00john#page/15/mode/1up Pedigree]
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) [https://archive.org/details/heraldryofhamils00john Heraldry] 
