1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir John Hamilton</strong>, the eldest son, had the designation of <strong>Carriden</strong> in the lifetime of his father, to whom he was served heir 23 April 1642. He had previously been created a Peer of Scotland under
2 CONC  the title of <strong>Lord Bargany</strong>, 16 November 1641, with limitation to the heirs-male of his body...
2 CONT
2 CONT ...He died April 1658. Lord Bargany married, 1632, Jean Douglas, second daughter of William, first Marquess of Douglas. She died 1669."
2 CONT
