2 CONT
2 CONT John Graham, 6th Earl of Menteith [1]
2 CONT *M, #29772, 
2 CONT *b. circa 1574, 
2 CONT *d. December 1598
2 CONT *Last Edited=19 Aug 2012
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.28%
2 CONT
2 CONT John Graham, 6th Earl of Menteith was born circa 1574.[1] He was the son of William Graham, 5th Earl of Menteith and Margaret Douglas.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Maria Campbell, daughter of Sir Colin Campbell of Glenorchy and Catherine Ruthven, circa 22 October 1589.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in December 1598.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded to the title of 6th Earl of Menteith [S., 1427] in September 1578.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Graham, 6th Earl of Menteith and Maria Campbell
2 CONT *1. Christian Graham+[3]
2 CONT *2. William Graham, 7th Earl of Menteith+[1] b. a Jul 1589, d. a 13 Apr 1661
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 2752. Hereinafter cited as Burke's 
2 CONC Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT *2. [S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 1, page 493.
2 CONT *3. [S15] George Edward Cokayne, editor, The Complete Baronetage, 5 volumes (no date (c. 1900); reprint, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 1983), volume II, page 315. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Baronetage.
