2 CONT "Note: 30 sep 1858 Contract between Lauchlan M'Lauchlane of that Ilk with consent of his curators and friends on the one part, and James Lamont of Inneryne, for himself and taking burden on him for Isobell Lamont his daughter on t
2 CONC he other part, whereby the said Lauchlan bound himself to infeft the said Isobell his future spouse in liferent in the six merkland of Enyngle, 2 1/2 merkland of Achinlochane and 20 land of Callow, lying in the lordship of Cowale 
2 CONC and shire of Argyle and resignation or confirmation as shall best please the said James Lamont of Inneryne and the said Isobell: and the said James Lamont as principal and Archibald Lamont of Silvercraig, John Lamont of Askog and 
2 CONC Robert Lamont of Steillage as cautioners bind themselves to pay to the said Lauchland and his curators the sum of 4500 ,erks in the name of tocher with the said Isobell. At Otter 1 Feb 1597 wit Archibald Lamont of Silvercraigs and
2 CONC  John Lamont of Row"
