2 CONC ttp://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD154%2f236&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=james+agnew&ko=p&r=&ro=m&df=&dt=1700&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Agnew Family of Lochnaw, Wigt
