2 CONT '''10 December 1685: Extract Registered Back-Bond and Discharge by Hew Kennedy, son of Thomas K. of Ardmillan, to Major Thomas Kennedy of Balterssan, whereby, in consideration of disposition of land [Note] made to him on this date
