2 CONC rges the said Major of all connection with this payment. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD25%2f8%2f728&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=baltersan&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1700&di=n National
