2 CONT 21. Alexander16 Kennedy of Craigoch and Kilhenzie (Alexander15, Thomas14, Gilbert13, Gilbert12, David11, John10, Gilbert9, James8, Gilbert7, John6, Gilbert5de Carrick, Gilbert4, Roland3, Nicol,2, Duncan1) married Anna Crawford, da
2 CONC ughter of William Crawford of Auchenames.97 He died in 1697/98.98 
