2 CONT
2 CONT      Alexander Kennedy was the son of Sir Alexander Kennedy and Agnes Kennedy.1 He married by contract, secondly, Anna Crawford, daughter of William Crawford, on 14 December 1683.2 He died circa 1698.2
2 CONT
2 CONT      Alexander Kennedy held the office of Justice of the Peace (J.P.) for Ayr.2 He lived at Kilhenzie, Argyllshire, Scotland.2 He lived at Craigoch.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Alexander Kennedy and Anna Crawford
2 CONT
2 CONT Archibald Kennedy+ b. c 1685, d. 14 Jun 17631 
