2 NICK Margariet
2 NICK Donchensen
2 NICK Denchesen
2 NICK Donchesen
2 NICK Dunchesen
2 NICK Donckesen
2 NICK Dunces
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 17 MAR 1618
2 ADDR
3 STAE Holland
