1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir John Graham, Baronet [S 1625] of Braco</strong>, son and heir, succeeded to the Baronetcy about 1635 and was served heir general of his father, 23 January 1636; was a Royalist and was imprisoned for aiding his cousin 
2 CONC the gallant Marquis of Montrose [S], but released 8 March 1645 on paying 2,000 merks, etc. He married Margaret, daughter of Sir Dugald Campbell, 1st Baronet [S 1628] of Auchinbreck, by his 1st wife, Mary, daughter of Sir Alexander
2 CONC  Erskine, of Gogar. He died before 1647."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n321/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 303
