2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Edmonstone of Broich married Catherine Cunningham. She is said to have belonged to the Glengarnock family. [https://drive.google.com/file/d/1n8MLsVdxL72BKPF67Ed_FBAwP0AyuReU/view Duntreth: pp. 13-4]'''
