2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/John-Edmonstone/6000000139198376850?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1592406036302&through=6000000008010284066
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/James-Edmonstone-of-Ballibantro/6000000139197353001?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1592406109848&through=6000000008010284066
