2 CONC t and John Andersone, baxter burgess in Stirling, then treasurers and box masters for the poor of said burgh, by assignation dated 1656 Oct 29. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD1%2f10
