1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>James</strong> 'was borne in the Keir on Thursday xxx of May 1622, just at xii horis at nicht'... James Stirling was abroad at his father's death; he was one of the Captains of the town of Berwick on 28th June 1675. He wa
2 CONC s afterwards a Major in the army. He married, before 1675, Margaret, a daughter of Colonel James Innes of Easter Denoon, Forfarshire. She died shortly before 13th May 1681, as appears from a letter from James of that date."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://www26.us.archive.org/stream/stirlingsofkeirt00fras#page/58/mode/2up The Stirlings of Keir, and their family papers]; Fraser, William Sir; page 59
