2 CONT "<strong>Henry Stirling, of Ardoch</strong>, 1st s. and h. of William Stirling, of the same, by Margaret (marr. contract 15 May 1602), da. of James Murray, Junior, of Strowan, suc. his father in 1652, and was cr. a Baronet [S.], a
2 CONC s above, 2 May 1666, with rem. to heirs male of his body. He m. Isobel, da. of John Haldane, of Gleneagles. He d. Feb. 1669."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524408#page/n271/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1904; Vol. IV; page 253
