2 CONC tions to Annabel Campbell, his spouse, of the £10 lands of Enterkine lying in the barony of Tarbolton and sheriffdom of Ayr, yet the infeftment should not prejudice the letters of reversion, if any be granted, by the said David Du
2 CONC nbar's predecessors or authors to the Duke of Lennox for the redemption of the said lands; dated 26 Aug, registered in the Books of Session, 27 Aug 1619. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?referenc
