1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===MR ARCHIBALD CAMPBELL OF GLENCARRDALE===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===His Father's Testament Dative===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''On 27 February 1647 Mr. Archibald Campbell of Glencarradale, here treated, gave up the testament dative of his deceased father and was confirmed as his only executor dative. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Commissary C
2 CONC ourt, Testament Dative of umqll Sir Archibald Campbell, brother german to umqll Sir James Campbell of Lawers, reference CC8/8/63]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000087823843924& Image of Testament Dative]
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000087823841874& Image of Testament Dative]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''10 August 1638: Archibald Campbell (of Glencarradale), Edinburgh, to the laird of Glenurchy. Money sent by recipient to David Jonkine is already delivered; sends purchases per John Smyth; is loath to send for Mr Archibald, writ
2 CONC er's son, as urged by recipient; arrival of the Commissioner at Holyroodhouse, accompanied in a sober manner; writer went to Dalkeith to speak to him and discuss Glenorchy's affairs; the Chancellor has demitted his place and Orbis
2 CONC towne is to be keeper of the seal until the king's pleasure is known; preparations for General Assembly and Parliament; has provided recipient with a chair to be carried, either by horse or man; price of sack; asks recipient to se
2 CONC nd venison to the Marquess of Hamilton, as he keeps his own house in Edinburgh. Postscript urges recipient to put his hand to the covenant. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD112%2f39%2
2 CONC f67%2f6&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=archibald+campbell+of+glencarradale&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Campbell Family, Earls of Breadalbane (Breadalbane Muniments), reference GD112/39/67/6]''
2 CONC '
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun05paul/page/n6 The Scots Peerage etc. Vol. V (David Douglas, Edinburgh, 1908), pp. 488-1515 for Campbell Earl of Loudoun]
2 CONT # [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/cc4aq/campbell16.php Stirnet: Campbell 16]
2 CONT # [http://thepeerage.com/p20064.htm#i200634 Darryl Lundy's Peerage: Archibald Campbell]
2 CONT # [https://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I20473&tree=CC Clan MacFarlane]
