1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===BEATRIX CAMPBELL===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Beatrix Campbell, here treated, is the daughter of Sir Archibald Campbell of Glencarradale and his wife Bessie Napier. She was born before 29 October 1618, the date upon which her baptism was registered at Edinburgh in Midlothi
2 CONC an, Scotland. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Baptisms, reference OPR.685/1/2]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Beatrix Campbell, here treated married, as his second wife, Sir William Hamilton of Manor Elieston and Shawfield. [https://archive.org/details/historicalgeneal00ande/page/278 Hamilton Memoirs: 278]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
