2 CONT
2 CONT '''8 September 1677: Extract disposition by Sir George Stirling of Glorat in favour of James Macfarlane of Keithton of lands of Ballincleroch. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD61%2f6
2 CONC 2&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=&ko=p&r=GD61%2f62&ro=m&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Macfarlane of Ballancleroch, reference GD61/62]'''
