2 CONC logue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD61%2f66&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=george+stirling+of+glorat&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Macfarlane of Ballancleroch, reference GD61/6
