1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == REVEREND MR. MICHAEL BRUCE ==
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Minister of the Gospel at Anworth in Kirkcudbrightshire, Scotland; Formerly Minister of the Gospel at Killinchy in County Down, Ireland===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://archive.org/details/fastiecclesiaesc00scot/page/527/mode/1up Fasti VII: 527]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://archive.org/details/fastiecclesiu02scotuoft/page/n397/mode/1up Fasti II: 386]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Notes ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Michael Bruce was the first Bruce minister who established a Presbyterian ministry in Ireland. In 1662 the Presbyterian minister was ordered to exile himself to Killinchy in county Down. Suffered persecution on religious ground
2 CONC s Minister of Killinchy Co Down. He had 3 sons 1 daughter.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy and Biography ==
2 CONT
