1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == SIR ROBERT ELPHINSTONE OF QUARREL ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir Robert Elphinstone of Quarrel is the son and heir of https://www.geni.com/people/Michael-Elphinstone-of-Quarrel/6000000199295422825?through=6000000199480101822 [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details
2 CONC .aspx?reference=GD1%2f1041%2f3&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=michael+elphinstone&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n NRS: GD1/1041/3]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''22 February 1642: Precept of clare constat by Lord Robert Spottiswood of Dunnypace in favour of Robert Elphinstone, now of Quarrell, as heir to his father Michael Elphinstone of Quarrell. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nr
2 CONC sonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD1%2f1041%2f3&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=michael+elphinstone&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Dundas of Fingask Charters; Halket of Pitfirrane Papers, reference GD1/1
2 CONC 041/3]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''15 July 1681: Signature of the lands of Skaithmure etc granted to Michael Elphinstone and Sir Robert Elphinstone (Elphingstone, Elphinston). [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=SIG1%2f
2 CONC 51%2f66&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Robert+Elphinstone&ko=p&r=&ro=m&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Register of Signatures, boxed series, reference SIG1/51/66]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''24 January 1685: (1) Precept of Clare Constat by Robert Milne of Barntoune [Barnton] and Henry Elphinstone, collector at Aberdeen, as tutors for Charles Elphinstone of Airth, in favour of Michael Elphinstone, now of Quarrell [Q
2 CONC uarrel], as son and heir of the deceased Sir Robert Elphinstone, in the lands of Quarrell and Easter Skeathmure. (2) Sasine following thereon. Dated 27 February 1685. Registered P.R.S. Stirling, 15 April 1685, vii, 5-6. [https://c
2 CONC atalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD65%2f97&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=michael+elphinstone&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Dundas of Fingask, reference GD65/97]'''
2 CONT
