2 CONT
2 CONT '''1 April 1685: Notes of information for Harry Graeme of Brecknes against William Moodie of Melsetter anent 20¼d. land in Stromnes, disponed, 1630, by '''Francis Moodie''' to Marion Crichtoun, grandmother of said Harry, in lifere
2 CONC nt, and to his father, in fee [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD217%2f18&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=francis+moodie&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the
2 CONC  Scarth Family of Breckness, Orkney, reference GD217/18]'''
