1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===HARIE MUDIE OF ELSETTER (aka HENRY MOODIE OF ELSETTER)===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Harie Mudie of Elsetter is the son of James Mudie of Melsetter. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=E19%2f45&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=james+mudie&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y NRS: E19/45
2 CONC ] His mother is Margaret Bellenden. [http://archive.org/stream/moodiebookbeing00ruvi#page/24/mode/1up The Moodie Book, p.24]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Harie Mudie of Elsetter died before 23 April 1690, the date upon which his brother arranged  that he should be buried. [http://archive.org/stream/moodiebookbeing00ruvi#page/25/mode/1up The Moodie Book, p. 25]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Harie Mudie of Elsetter married Catherine Graham. [http://archive.org/stream/moodiebookbeing00ruvi#page/24/mode/1up The Moodie Book, p.24] The marriage was booked on 25 June 1672, at Kirkwall in Orkney, Scotland. [Kirkwall Marr
2 CONC iages] Catherine Graham died on 19 November 1688. [http://archive.org/stream/moodiebookbeing00ruvi#page/25/mode/1up The Moodie Book, p. 25]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
