1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JEAN STEWART===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jean Stewart is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Stewart-of-Culbeg/6000000077015408050?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1522357984781&through=6000000076864499890 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Annabella-Ersk
2 CONC ine/6000000076863287266?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1522357195976&through=6000000077101835072 She was born before 3 November 1625, the date upon which her baptism was registered at Gargunnock in Stirlingshire, Scotland. Her baptismal
2 CONC  record reads as follows: "Bapt to Robert Stewart of Culbeg and Annable Erskine a daughter called Jean wit Alexander Leckie of Leckie and James Forrester of Culmore." [National Records of Scotland, Gargunnock Baptisms, 1615-1819, 
2 CONC reference OPR.481/1] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000077991973868& Image of Baptismal Record]
