2 CONT '''Isabell Stewart is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Stewart-of-Culbeg/6000000077015408050?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1524479642465&through=6000000076864499890 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Annabella-E
