2 CONT
2 CONT '''22 September 1658: Harry, son to the late Mr. Walter Stewart, minister of South Ronaldshay, with John Kinross, merchant [in Edinburgh]. [https://archive.org/stream/scottishrecordso28scotuoft#page/175/mode/1up The Register of Ap
2 CONC prentices of the City of Edinburgh, 1583-1666, p. 171]'''
