2 CONT <blockquote>'''Contrary to what is claimed elsewhere, James Craig, here treated, is not the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-Lewis-Craige-of-Riccarton/6000000010281380818?through=6000000076994129897 and his first wife https:
2 CONC //www.geni.com/people/Beatrix-Chirnside/6000000005229766145?through=6000000076994129897 Sir Lewis Craige of Riccarton and his second wife https://www.geni.com/people/Marie-Somervell/6000000204563887821 did have a son named https:/
2 CONC /www.geni.com/people/James-Craig/6000000204564038830 whose baptism was registered at Edinburgh on 3 February 1620, but he is not the same person as James Craig, here treated, who is said to have been born in Sutherland in about 15
2 CONC 85.'''</blockquote>
