2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT === Sir John Gibson of Pentland and Addistone / Alderston
2 CONT * Birth. 	1600 - Edurie, Fife, Scotland
2 CONT * Forældre:	Alexander Gibson, Margaret Gibson (born Craig)
2 CONT * Søskende:	Alexander Gibson Ii, Alexander George Gibson, George Alexander Gibson, Lord Durie, Elizabeth Murray (born Gibson), Helen Brillie (born Gibson), Margaret Gibson, Jean Preston (born Gibson), James Gibson
2 CONT * Hustru:	Maragret Jean Hays
2 CONT * Børn:	Sir Alexander Of Pentland Gibson, Margaret Innes (born Ker), John Gibson, Anne Fleming (born Ker)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir john Gibson of Pentland, son of Sir Alexander Gibson and Lady Craig, apparently did not leave Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT This John Gibson  apparently did not leave Scotland (where he was knighted circa 1647) and is not to be confused with John Gibson of Cambridge, Massachusetts, born about 1601 in England and died, Cambridge, 1694, who has another g
2 CONC eni profile:  https://www.geni.com/people/John-Gibson-of-Cambridge/6000000003939209751
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Gibson of Pentland, his lordship's 2d son: A steady loyalist Sir John Gibson of Pentland attended Charles I in all his vicissitudes of fortune, and in 1651 accompanied King Charles II to the unfortunate battle of Worceste
2 CONC r where he lost a leg and for his gallant behaviour was knighted by the king. 
2 CONT
2 CONT See, among others: Source: (p. 296) The Scottish Nation: Or, The Surnames, Families, Literature, Honours, and Biographical History of the People of Scotland, Volume 2, by William Anderson, A. Fullerton & Co., Edinburgh, 1867]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p41948.htm#i419475
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Gibson of Pentland and Addistone is the son of Sir Alexander Gibson, Lord Durie and Margaret Craig.2 He married, firstly, Jean Hay, daughter of Alexander Hay of Kennet.1 He married, secondly, unknown wife (?).1 He married
2 CONC , thirdly, Elizabeth Thomson, daughter of Sir Thomas Thomson, 1st Bt..1 He was appointed Knight in 1647.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Sir John Gibson of Pentland and Addistone and unknown wife (?)
2 CONT #Sir Thomas Gibson of Keirhill, 1st Bt.+2 d. 1713
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir John Gibson of Pentland and Addistone and Jean Hay
2 CONT
2 CONT # Sir Alexander Gibson of Pentland+2 d. 1693
2 CONT # George Gibson2
2 CONT # Sir John Gibson+2 b. c 1637, d. 24 Oct 1717
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
