2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''18 July 1637: Sheriffdom of Midlothian: Extract decreet cognitionis causa at the instance of George Wynrame of Libbertoune, against Jean, Margaret, Anna and Helen, daughters of the deceased Mr Alexander Hay of Eister Kennet, cl
2 CONC erk of Session, and John Gibson, spouse of the said Jean for registration of certain bonds forming grounds for adjudication. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD6%2f950&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&t
2 CONC n=n&tp=n&k=John+gibson&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1700&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Brooke Family of Biel, East Lothian, reference GD6/950]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''16 January 1680: Extract Heritable Bond by Sir John Nicolson [Nicholson] of that ilk and William Nicolson, his brother, to Thomas Gibson, son of deceased Sir John Gibson of Pentland, of 10,000 merks and annualrent of 600 merks 
2 CONC from lands and barony of Lesswade [Lasswade]. Registered in B. of C. and S., 24 Nov 1682. With papers following thereon, including disposition of said annualrent to Sir John Clerk of Pennicook [Penicuik], dated 27 Feb 1700, and in
2 CONC ventory of progress. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD18%2f1504&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=thomas+gibson&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1640&dt=1700&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of Cle
2 CONC rk family of Penicuik, Midlothian, reference GD18/1504]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''14 August 1685: Heritable bond by Lord Neil Campbell to Thomas Gibson, son of deceased Sir John Gibsone of Paintland and deceased Dame Elizabeth Thomsone, his spouse, for his security, following bond, 18, 20 November 1675, by g
2 CONC ranter and others to said Sir John, for 5000 merks scots, over lands and isles of Loyng and Seill and other lands in lordship of Lorne. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD112%2f23%2f58
2 CONC &st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=thomas+gibson&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1640&dt=1700&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Campbell Family, Earls of Breadalbane (Breadalbane Muniments), reference GD112/23/58]'''
2 CONT
