2 CONT '''21 June 1598: Charter by which David Seton of Parbroath confirms that he has given an anualrent from the land called three Urquartis to Master Edward Bruce and his wife. His charter was witnessed by his son John Seton and other
2 CONC s: "Jo. Setoun filiis legitimis dicti Dav.". [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi06scot/page/233 Regrisrum Magni Sigilli Regum Scotorum, Register of the Great Seal of Scotland, A.D. 1593-1608, charter number 715 on pp. 23
2 CONC 3-4]'''
2 CONT
