1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Find a Grave Memorial [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/185630537/margaret-keith  Margaret ''Ogilvy'' Keith]==
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT https://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I6875&amp;tree=CC
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Ogilvy was born in Berwickshire, Scotland, United Kingdom in 1575, to James Ogilvie and Jean Forbes. Later in life, Margaret Ogilvy married George Keith;
2 CONT children were: 
2 CONT *Jane Keith, 
2 CONT *Alexander Keith, 
2 CONT *George Keyth or Keith, 
2 CONT *James Keith of Benholm, 
2 CONT *George Keith,
2 CONT *Mary Keith,
2 CONT *Johne Keith and 
2 CONT *Elizabeth Keith. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Ogilvy died in Dunnottar, Kincardineshire, Scotland, United Kingdom, 1627. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:
2 CONT The Scots Peerage lists George Keith as 5th Earl Marischal[2] but this biography is using the numbering given in Cracroft's Peerage[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT *The Scots Peerage; Vol 1; pp 119-122; https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun01pauluoft#page/128/mode/2up
2 CONT *The Scots Peerage; Vol 6; p 53; https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06pauluoft/page/52
2 CONT Cracroft's Peerage 
