2 CONC of Sauchie, and had issue — Alexander, d.s.p., and '''Ludovick''', 14th Earl of Crawfurd. (Douglas's Peerage of Scotland, Vol. I., p. 381.)" https://archive.org/details/anent1884/page/119/mode/1up
