2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Captain James Colville''' was born in 1597 in Scotland, United Kingdom. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743165542 Robert Colville, of Cleish] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-64602902 Beatrix Colville]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT James married [https://www.geni.com/profile-59657639 Margaret Colville] on December 10, 1636, in Largo,,Fife,Scotland. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-69124621 James Colville];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-92560334 Rev. Alexander Colville];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-69097609 William Colville];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34710904328 Robert Colville];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34710904371 Margaret Colville]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1670 in County Down, Ireland. 
