1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == SIR JAMES SINCLAIR OF MURKLE ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir James Sinclair, Knight, Second of Murkle, appears to have been twice married. In January, 1633, a disposition was granted by him, with consent of Dame Margaret Dundas, his spouse, of part of the lands of Ormlie; and in Octo
2 CONC ber, 1634, there is a contract of marriage between him and Jean, daughter of William Stewart of Burray, Orkney. By Jean Stewart he had two sons and five daughters. [http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getp
2 CONC erson.php?personID=I7185&tree=CC Scots Clans Genealogy]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I7185&tree=CC Scots Clans Genealogy]'''
2 CONT # '''[http://www.thepeerage.com/p19852.htm#i198520 Darryl Lundy's Peerage]'''
