2 CONT It was also agreed that John Mackay, Sir Donald's brother, should marry his lordship's niece, daughter of James Sinclair of Murkle, sheriff of Caithness, afterwards Sir James, by his wife, who was daughter of Patrick, Earl of Orkn
2 CONC ey : which marriage was consummated in the year 1619 ;  pg. 202
2 CONT
2 CONT HISTORY THE HOUSE AND CLAN MACKAY,BY ROBERT MACKAY, 1829
