1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JOHN SINCLAIR OF ASSERY===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Sinclair of Assery is the bastard son of https://www.geni.com/people/James-Sinclair-of-Murkle/4622833893320071468?through=6000000177193308836 The name of his mother is not known. [https://archive.org/details/saintclairsofi
2 CONC sl00sain/page/227 The Saint Clairs of the Isles: p. 227]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Sinclair obtained in 1628 from William Sinclair, Lord Berriedale, a charter of the lands of Assery, to himself in liferent, and to his eldest son James in fee. In 1631. He got a charter of Brawlbin ; and in 1633 a wadset o
2 CONC f Forsie ; and from him are descended the Sinclairs of Assery, of Lybster, of Geise, and of Scotscalder. [https://archive.org/details/saintclairsofisl00sain/page/227 The Saint Clairs of the Isles: p. 227]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://archive.org/details/saintclairsofisl00sain/page/227 The Saint Clairs of the Isles: pp. 227-28 for Sinclair of Assery]'''
