1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == MARGARET HOME ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Home, here treated, is reported to be the daughter of Sir John Home of Cowdenknows and his first wife Marie Sinclair. She is said to have married first Sir Mark Ker of Littledean (contract dated 6 March 1601), and seco
2 CONC nd, Sir David Home of Wedderburn, Baronet (contract dated 6 March 1607). [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/hh4bz/home03.php Stirnet: Home 03]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
