1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == PATRICK SINCLAIR OF ULBSTER ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Patrick Sinclair of Ulbster is the son of John Sinclair of Ulbster and Jean Chisholm.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''20 February 1640: Extract Registered Contract of Marriage between Patrick Sinclair of Ulbster and Elizabeth McKy [McKay], eldest lawful daughter of John McKy of Dilret. Dated 20th February 1640 and Registered in the Sheriff Cou
2 CONC rt Books of Caithness 25th February 1647. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD84%2f2%2f130&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=patrick+sinclair&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scot
2 CONC land, Papers of the Mackay Family, Lords Reay, reference GD84/2/130]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Child of Patrick Sinclair of Ulbster===
2 CONT
2 CONT * Elizabeth Sinclair+
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Citations===
2 CONT
2 CONT [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 3, page 3631. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Peer
