1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anna Sutherland, daughter of William Sutherland, 10th of Duffus, married to Patrick Grant, brother of James Grant of Freuchie. A disposition dated 7 December 1660 was granted to her and her spouse by her uncle Jame
2 CONC s over Cluniemoir, Clunieberg, and other lands. She was still alive in 1663.[13] 
2 CONT
2 CONT [13] Gen. Reg. Inhibitions, 5th ser., vol. vii, 9 January 1664. This marriage is not noticed by Sir William Fraser in his Chiefs of Grant. 
