2 CONC age/29/mode/1up Archive.Org] The said Colin, earl of Seaforth, marryit Dame Margaret Seaton, who bure two daughters ; Jean, who was first countess of Caithness, and bure the earl of Caithness, thereafter marryed lord Duffus, and b
