1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "(260) <strong>Sir Robert Moray of Ogilvie</strong>, died v.p. Will recorded 13th March 1621 (Dunblane). He married Helen, daughter of Alexander Bruce of Cultmalundie, and had: -
