2 CONC Abeyant, Forfeited, and Extinct ... By Sir Bernard Burke, page 218 "Fleming - Earl of Wigton" 
2 CONT *  [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun08pauluoft#page/550/mode/1up The Scots Peerage] Vol 8 page 55.  
