2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Lilias Graham is the daughter of John Graham, 4th Earl of Montrose and Lady Margaret Ruthven.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Sir John Colquhoun of Luss, 1st Bt., son of Sir Alexander Colquhoun of Luss and Helen Buchanan, on 6 July 1620.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Lilias Graham and Sir John Colquhoun of Luss, 1st Bt.
2 CONT *Sir James Colquhoun of Luss, 4th Bt.+2 d. 1688
2 CONT *Sir John Colquhoun of Luss, 2nd Bt.+2 d. 11 Apr 1676
2 CONT *Alexander Colquhoun, 1st of Tilliquhoun+2 d. 1718
2 CONT *Jean Colquhoun2
2 CONT *Lilias Colquhoun+2
2 CONT *Katherine Colquhoun2
2 CONT
