2 CONT
2 CONT Lillias (Graham) Colquhoun (1596 - 1625)
2 CONT *Lillias Colquhoun formerly Graham
2 CONT *Born 1596 in Luss, Dunbartonshire, Scotland
2 CONT *Daughter of John Graham and Margaret (Ruthven) Graham
2 CONT *Sister of Margaret (Graham) Napier, James Graham and Beatrix (Graham) Drummond
2 CONT *Wife of John Colquhoun 1st Bt — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT *Mother of James (Colquhoun) Colquhoun of Colquhoun 4th Bt,John Colquhoun 2nd Bt, Alexander Colquhoun and Alexander Colquhoun
2 CONT *Died 1625 in Biggar Road, Lanarkshire, 
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Lillias Graham
2 CONT
2 CONT Also Known As: Sister to 1st Marquis of Montrose
2 CONT
2 CONT Lillas was born in 1596. She passed away in 1625. [1]
