1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir James Colquhoun, Baronet [S 1625] of Luss</strong>, uncle and heir male, formerly of Coreagh, co Donegal; succeeded to the Baronetcy in 1680. He married before November 1669, being hen of Coreagh, Penuel coheir of her
2 CONC  brothers John and Robert Cunningham, of Ballyachen, co Donegal, youngest daughter of James Cunningham of the same. He died 1688."
2 CONT
