1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===SIR JAMES SOMERVILLE OF CAMBUSNETHAN ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir James Somerville of Cambusnethan, here treated, is the eldest son and apparent heir of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Somerville-of-Cambusnethan-younger/6000000181112800898 and the oy or grandson of https://www.geni.com/p
2 CONC eople/James-Somerville-of-Cambusnethan-elder/6000000181021808823 [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD109%2f1210&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=John+Somervell&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1650&di
2 CONC =n NRS: GD109/1210]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Cambusnethan ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir James Somerville of Cambusnethan, here treated, sold Cambusnethan to https://www.geni.com/people/James-Somerville-of-Drum-younger/6000000079122452829 de jure tenth Lord Somerville, [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/britis
2 CONC h/ss4as/somerville02.php Stirnet: Somerville 02] who with his wife Martha Ballantyne (aka Martha Bannatyne) had signature of the lands of Cambusnethan on 19 July 1653. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/detail
2 CONC s.aspx?reference=SIG1%2f144%2f52&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=james+somerville&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1650&dt=1700&di=n NRS: SIG1/144/52]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir James Somerville of Cambusnethan, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Helen-Hamilton/6000000023676116055?through=6000000023678173866 [Particular Register of Sasines for the Sheriffdom of Lanark, reference RS40
2 CONC /IIB/94]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir James Somerville of Cambusnethan, here treated, is reported to have had a son named https://www.geni.com/people/John-Somerville/6000000181337034855 by his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Helen-Hamilton/6000000023676116055?
2 CONC through=6000000023678173866 '''
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/John-Somerville/6000000181337034855
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John Somerville of Cambusnethan, here treated, also had a son named https://www.geni.com/people/James-Somerville/6000000181085879843 but the name of the mother has not been identified.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/James-Somerville/6000000181085879843
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Bastard Children ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir James Somerville of Cambusnethan, here treated, had at least one bastard son, that is https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Somerville-Tailor-in-Edinburgh/6000000181050423828?through=6000000023678173866 who was the brother of 
2 CONC  https://www.geni.com/people/Somerville/6000000181080455897 and https://www.geni.com/people/Agnes-Somerville/6000000181081844833 The name of their mother has not been identified.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Somerville-Tailor-in-Edinburgh/6000000181050423828?through=6000000023678173866
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Somerville/6000000181080455897
