1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == SIR JOHN SOMERVELL OF CARSWELL fiar of Cambusnethan ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John Somerville of Carswell, here treated, is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Somerville-younger-of-Cambusnethan/6000000019459772315 and the grandson of https://www.geni.com/people/James-Somerville-of-Cambusneth
2 CONC an-Velvet-Eye/6000000019458395989 [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD109%2f1208&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=john+somervell&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1650&di=n NRS: GD109/1208]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John Somerville of Carswell, here treated, died intestate in August 1620. [National Records of Scotland, Glasgow Commissary Court, The Testament Dative of Inventory of Sir Johnne Someruell of Carswoll, knight, parish of Cam
2 CONC busnethaine, reference CC9/7/17]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == His Testament Dative and Inventory ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Testament Dative and Inventory of Sir John Somerville of Carswell was given up by: "Jonn Someruell forrester of the wodis of Cambusnethaine and exer dative surrogat in place of the procr fiscall be decreit of the Cmssr of G
2 CONC lasgw the vij day of Aprile 1621 yeirs". James Somerville, younger of Cambusnethen, acted himself as cautioner for the executor dative and confirmation was granted on 12 April 1621.The value of Sir John's moveable estate was divid
2 CONC ed into three parts, one third for the widow, one third for the children, and one third for the deceased (which could have been allocated according to Sir Joh's wishes, if he had made a will). It seems clear, therefore, that Sir J
2 CONC ohn was survived by his wife, and at least one child, although their names are not mentioned. [National Records of Scotland, Glasgow Commissary Court, The Testament Dative of Inventory of Sir Johnne Someruell of Carswoll, knight, 
2 CONC parish of Cambusnethaine, reference CC9/7/17]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000181316699823 Image of Testament]
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000181316620821 Image of Testament]
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000181284656231 Image of Testament]
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000181284418218 Image of Testament]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John Somerville of Carswell, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Hamilton/6000000054120362918?through=6000000181099468883  [Particular Register of Sasines for the Sheriffdom of Lanark, reference RS40/1/15
2 CONC 7]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John Somerville of Carswell, here treated, had two children whose names are known. They may be the children of  https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Hamilton/6000000054120362918?through=6000000181099468883 but, presently, evide
2 CONC nce which proves this is wanting.'''
2 CONT
