2 CONT '''23 December 1620 and 15 February 1642: Extract bond by James Somervell, elder of Cambusnethan, John Somervell, his son, and James Somervell, his eldest son now living, to infeft Jean Somervell, said James, elder's, pronevoy, da
2 CONC ughter of deceased Sir John Somervell of Kerswell, kt., eldest son of said John, in annualrent of £500 from lands and barony of Cambusnethan, reg. B. of C. and S., 24 January, 1624; with bond of relief by said Sir James Somervell 
2 CONC to Sir John Hamiltoune, elder, of Bargany, kt., Sir John Hamiltoune, younger, of Carridden, kt., his eldest son, Sir James Hamiltoune of Broomhill, kt., and Gavin Hamiltoune of Raploch, his cautioners, over £4 land of Nethertoun o
2 CONC f Cambusnethan, premonition, renunciation, and ratification thereof, with consent of James Kincaid of that ilk, her spouse. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD109%2f1208&st=1&tc=y&tl=n
2 CONC &tn=n&tp=n&k=john+somervell&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1650&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the family of Dalrymple-Hamilton of Bargany, Ayrshire, reference GD109/1208]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     6
2 CONT
2 CONT '''4, 10 and 19 February 1637: Extract bond by Sir James Somervell of Cambusnethane, kt., to Jean Somervell, daughter of deceased Sir John Somervell of Carswell, kt., fiar of Cambusnethane, for £5,000 scots. Reg. B. of C. and S., 
2 CONC 10 June, 1640. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD109%2f1214&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=&ko=p&r=GD109%2f1214&ro=m&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the family of Dal
2 CONC rymple-Hamilton of Bargany, Ayrshire, reference GD109/1214]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     7
2 CONT
2 CONT '''15 February 1642: Discharge by Jean Somervell, daughter of deceased Sir John Somervell of Carswall, kt., with consent of James Kincaid of that ilk, her spouse, to Sir John Hamiltoune of Bargenie, kt., of GD109/1214 [https://cat
2 CONC alogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD109%2f1225&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=john+somervell&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1650&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the family of Dalrymple-Hamilton o
2 CONC f Bargany, Ayrshire, reference GD109/1225]'''
