2 CONT http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=maclaren&id=I41001
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander Stewart, 4th Lord Blantyre was born after 1631.  He was the son of William Stewart, 2nd Lord Blantyre and Helen Scott.  He married Margaret Shaw, daughter of John Shaw and Helen Houston, circa September 1649. He died cir
2 CONC ca May 1676 at Bute, Scotland, probably from smallpox.
2 CONT
2 CONT      He succeeded to the title of 4th Lord Blantyre [S., 1606] in October 1641. In 1647 he was one of the "Engagers" for King Charles I, but he escaped punishment due to his youth.1
