1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir Robert Richardson, Baronet [S 1630] of Pencaitland</strong>, 1st son and heir, born 24 January 1613, succeeded to the Baronetcy in April 1635, and was on 30 of that month served heir general of his father, and on 30 S
2 CONC eptember following, heir special. He sold his estate of Pencaitland to James Macgill of Cranstoun Riddell. He died s.p., being then as 'indweller of Smeaton' in 1640 or 1642, when the Baronetcy became dormant and remained so for n
2 CONC early forty years."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n399/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 380-381
