1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.thepeerage.com/p2574.htm#i25731 The Peerage]
2 CONT
2 CONT Eupheme Scott was the daughter of Sir William Scott and Jean Skene.1  She married William Cochrane, 1st Earl of Dundonald, son of Alexander Cochrane and Elizabeth Cochrane, after 14 April 1633.1 Her married name became Cochrane. A
2 CONC s a result of her marriage, Eupheme Scott was styled as  Lady Cochrane of Dundonald on 26 December 1647. As a result of her marriage, Eupheme Scott was styled as  Countess of Dundonald on 12 May 1669.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Eupheme Scott and William Cochrane, 1st Earl of Dundonald
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.William Cochrane, Lord Cochrane+1 d. 25 Aug 1679
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.Sir John Cochrane+1 d. a 23 Jun 1707
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.Lady Grizel Cochrane+1 d. c Jan 1665
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.James Cochrane1 d. b 13 Feb 1694
2 CONT
