2 CONT '''28 September 1672: JACOBUS DUNLOP, haeres Magistri Joannis Dunlop de Garnkirk, patris. xxxi. 108. [https://books.google.co.uk/books?id=PiVDAAAAcAAJ&pg=PR17&lpg=PR17&dq=Nether+Carmyle&source=bl&ots=qkxdEQg71e&sig=HyjCNPSI5Zn-R82
2 CONC Uv3MfsmcM1os&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwivnPu529DTAhWlKsAKHeowAM0Q6AEIRDAG#v=snippet&q=dunlop&f=false Inquisitionum Ad Capellam Domini Regis Retornatarum, etc., ii, Inquisitiones Gererales., entry number 5574]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1 September 1697: (435) Sep. 1. 1697. JACOBUS DUNLOPE hares Jacobi Dunlope de Garnkirk, patris, - in 4 libratis 6 solidatis 8 denariatis terris antiqui extentus terrarum de Garnkirk, cum parte molendini de Bedlay eisdem terris 
2 CONC spectante: - E. 3l. 12s. 9d. etc. firmae. - 24 solidatis terrarum antiqui extentus de Casnockhill cum laqueo ejusdem: - E. 26s. 8d. etc. firmae: - omnibus infra parochiam de Calder et regalitatem de Glasgow. xlvi. 734. [https://bo
2 CONC oks.google.co.uk/books?id=PiVDAAAAcAAJ&pg=PR17&lpg=PR17&dq=Nether+Carmyle&source=bl&ots=qkxdEQg71e&sig=HyjCNPSI5Zn-R82Uv3MfsmcM1os&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwivnPu529DTAhWlKsAKHeowAM0Q6AEIRDAG#v=snippet&q=garnkirk&f=false Inquisitionum
2 CONC  Ad Capellam Domini Regis Retornatarum, etc. II]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''Newsletter of the Glasgow and West of Scotland Family History Society, No. 47 Autumn 1996, pp. 11-16 for the first part of Donald Whyte's scholarly account of the family of Dunlop of Garnkirk'''
2 CONT # '''Newsletter of the Glasgow and West of Scotland Family History Society, No. 48 Spring 1997, pp. 9-1 for the second part of Donald Whyte's scholarly account of the family of Dunlop of Garnkirk'''
2 CONT # '''[http://www.clandunlop.com/dunlop%20of%20Gankirk.htm Stirnet: Dunlop 02]'''
2 CONT # '''[http://www.clandunlop.com/dunlop_manor_houses.htm Dunlop Manor Houses]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===[http://www.clandunlop.com/ From the Genealogy Tab of the Clan Dunlop website]===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James DUNLOP, 2nd. of Garnkirk. Born in 1633, James died in February 1695; he was 62. On 5 April 1654, when James was 21, he married Elizabeth ROBERTSON [Note 1] of Bedlay, daughter of James ROBERTSON of Bedlay, Lord Bedlay & I
2 CONC sabel CAMPBELL of Loudoun, in Bedlay [Note 2], Lanarkshire, Scotland.   She was born in about 1633.   Elizabeth died in August 1695; she was 62. They had the following children: (1) James (1655-1719) (2) John (1657-1683) (3) Willi
2 CONC am (1662-) (4) Alexander (1666-) (5) Thomas (1668-) (6) Archibald (1672-) (7) Jean (1665-) (8) Elizabeth (1670-) (9) Margaret (1676-)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note: (1) It was Elizabeth Roberton (aka Elizabeth Robertoune) who married James Dunlop of Garnkitk. Her father was James Roberton of Bedlay. Robertson is a different surname.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[Note 2] Loudoun is in Ayrshire. It is not in Bedlay in Lanarkshire.'''
