2 CONT
2 CONT 23 June 1747: Extract Decreet of Adjudication in action at the instance of Thomas Traill of Westove, against '''Janet Buchanan, daughter and only child in life to deceased Thomas Buchanan of Sandside for herself and as lawfully ch
2 CONC arged to enter heir in special to deceased Arthur Buchanan of Sound, her granduncle, and to William Buchanan of Sound, her said granduncle's son, or either of them, and James Fea of Clestron, her husband,''' adjudging tenements of
2 CONC  land in burgh of Kirkwall, the isle of Damsay in parish of Firth, 2 merk udal land in Grimbuster, 2½ cows worth of land there, ¾d. udal land in How, in parish of Harray, 2d. feu land in Elbuster, in parish of Rendall, 1d. land in
2 CONC  Palace, 3d. land in Midhouse, and 1/3d. land called Charlesland, ½d. land called Hammiger, in parish of Evie, the room and land of Grind, in parish of St. Otto, the isle and lands called the Calf of Ethey with salt pan thereof an
2 CONC d manor house of Ethey, and lands of Noup, 1½d. land of Selskerrie, 1d. land of Fairns, 5d. land of Carpoquoy, lying in the west end of said isle, 5½d. land called Barcaland, on the east side of said isle, 36d. land of Sound, with
2 CONC  the holm called Ellingholme, 18d. land of Weeland, with quoy called Quilarock, 1d. land of Foreland, 7d. land of Wathies, 1d. land of How, 8d. land of Elvick, 1d. udal land in Hollandgairth, 3d. land in Ness, and 6d. land in Holl
2 CONC ond, all in island of Shapinshey, 12¾d. King's land in Tinkquoy, ¾d. and four quoys of land called Muckle Quoy there, 1¼d. land in Sheall, 1¼d. udal land in Aikerness, in island of Westray, the island and lands of North Ronaldshay
2 CONC , two farthing and two part farthing udal land called Gyer in town of Marwick, ½d. land called Windbreck, there, ¼d. udal land called Suplesland, there, two farthing two part farthing udal land called Creyga, there, 1d. half farth
2 CONC ing udal land called Upper and Nether Flaws, there, 2d. udal land called Howarhouse, there, 1 meills mailing udal land called Sutterquoy, there, ½d. udal land called Couperhouse, there, ¼d. udal land called Swirdie's Land, there, 
2 CONC ¼d. land called Steirhouse, there, two meills one setting mailing in Quoylang, there, 3 settings mailing of land in Garuot's Land in Biriay, ¾d. udal land called Clerkhouse quenny udal land in town of Housbie, in parish of Birsay,
2 CONC  two farthings two part farthings udal land in Neither in Corstan, in parish of Harray, ¼d. udal land in town of How in Costa, 1d. udal land in Ulterbreck, there, 1d. udal land called Arsedale, 1d. half farthing udal land in Frow,
2 CONC  ¼d. udal land in Innerbreik, two farthing two part farthing land in Hammiger, 12d. land of Woodwick, 6d. land of Midland Garson and Hameron, in parish of Rendall, 1d. land called Charlesland, 4d. land called Deale, 3d. land of Dy
2 CONC ck, 3d. land of Fiolquoy, 2d. land of Pow and Stow, all in parish of Evie, 6d. land of Chimlay, in parish of Sandwick, 6d. land of Flaws, 6d. land of Midhouse, in Costay, in parish of Evie, 7½d. land of Tingwall and Midgair, 1½d. 
2 CONC land of How, ½d. udal land of Cott, ½d. udal land called Brittabreck, lands of Massiter, ½d. land of Crook and 1d. lands of Banks, in parish of Randall, to belong to said Thomas Traill in satisfaction of debt due to him; and Extra
2 CONC ct Abbreviate of Adjudication attached thereto [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD31%2f258&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=sandside&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1500&dt=1800&di=y National Records of Scot
