2 DATE 1659
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir James Oliphant, Baronet [S 1628]</strong>, son and heir by 1st wife, who, having stabbed his mother, fled the country, and when by his father's death he succeeded to the Baronetcy, probably never assumed that dignity.
2 CONC  He died s.p. 1659."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n387/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 368
