1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===THOMAS GRAHAM (aka THOMAS GRAHAME)===
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Graham is the son of James Graham and Margaret Nisbet. He was born before 14 November 1660, the date upon which his baptism was registered at Kirkwall in Orkney, Scotland. [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:X18D-TFX K
2 CONC irkwall Baptismal Records] It would appear that he was born out of wedlock for his parents were not booked to marry until 5 February 1661. [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:XYSL-1JX  Kirkwall Marriage Records]
