1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===HARRY GRAHAM OF BRECKNESS (aka HENRY GRAHAM OF BRECKNESS)===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Harry Graham of Breckness died in Edinburgh in July 1718. [James M. Irvine, The Breckness Estate: A History of its Lairds, Tenants and Farms, and Skaill House (James M. Irvine, 2009), p. 65]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Euphemia Honeyman married Harry Graham of Breckness. [James M. Irvine, The Breckness Estate: A History of its Lairds, Tenants and Farms, and Skaill House (Pinted in Orkney for James M. Irvine by The Orcadian Limited, 2009), p. 
2 CONC 41]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Second Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Harry Graham of Breckness married for a second time to Janet Law. She died childless in July 1698.  [James M. Irvine, The Breckness Estate: A History of its Lairds, Tenants and Farms, and Skaill House (Pinted in Orkney for Jame
2 CONC s M. Irvine by The Orcadian Limited, 2009), p. 58]'''
2 CONT ]
2 CONT ===Third Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Harry Graham of Breckness married for a third time to Ann Coult.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children of the First Marriage===
2 CONT
