1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===REVEREND JAMES GRAHAM===
2 CONT [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/232421877/james-graham James Graham Memorial]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===[https://archive.org/stream/fastiecclesiaesc00scot#page/218/mode/1up Minister of the Gospel and Holm and Paplay;] [https://archive.org/stream/fastiecclesiaesc00scot#page/215/mode/1up Formerly Minister at Evie and Rendall]=== 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Reverend Mr. James Graham, Minister of the Gospel at Holm and Paplay, married Elspet Craigie, The marriage was booked on 15 September 1673, at Kirkwall in Orkney, Scotland. [National Records of Scotland, Kirkwall Marriages,
2 CONC  1657-1820, reference OPR.21/4]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Graham/6000000051135706826
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/George-Graham/6000000088014347081
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Andrew-Graham-Minister-of-the-Gospel-at-Firth-and-Stenness/6000000017932518392?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1550739676303&through=6000000051135706826
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Mungo-Graham-of-Upatoune/6000000086844550927
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/James-Graham/6000000051134412230?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1550739994375&through=6000000017932524203
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Marjorie-Graham/6000000088022103917?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1550740070893&through=6000000017932524203
