1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sir William Murray, 1st Bt.''' was born on 30 October 1615. He was the son of Patrick Murray, 7th of Ochtertyre and Mary Moray. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married '''Isabel Oliphant''', daughter of John Oliphant of Bachiltoun, on 7 June 1649. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 18 February 1681 at age 65.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was created 1st Baronet Murray, of Ochtertyre, co. Perth [Nova Scotia] on 7 June 1673
2 CONT
2 CONT M.P. for perthshire 1673-74.
2 CONT
