2 CONT
2 CONT VI. Ranald Udny of that Ilk was served heir of his father 8 Jan. 1509, had a Crown Charter 10th August 1511. Married in 1510 Isabella Pantoun, probably a daughter of the Pitmedden family. Alexander, son and heir apparent of John P
2 CONC antoun of Pitmedden, witnesses a charter by Ranald 9 Aug. 1511. On the 8th January 1511 he granted a Bond of Manrent cc to ane rycht nobill and potent lord Wylyeam Erll of Eroll Lord Hay and Constabill of Scotland to become his ma
2 CONC n and servant all the  days of his life and do him service with his kinsmen and frinds/' signing " Ranald Oudne of that Ilk/'' 
2 CONT
2 CONT He had issue:  
2 CONT * William. 
2 CONT * Andrew, of Tillery, married Janet Lyell, and had a son William. 
2 CONT * Jane, married Michael, 3d son of George Leslie of New Leslie. 
