2 CONT viii.	Joanna LIVINGSTON was born 10 DEC 1694, and died ABT. 6 APR 1735. She married Cornelius Gerrit VAN HORNE 7 JUL 1720 in Albany, Albany, New York. He was born 1694 in New York, New York.
