2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''William Crawford of Auchinames died in 1674. [NRS: CC9/7/41]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == His Testament Dative and Inventory ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''William Crawford of Auchinames died in 1674. On 28 September 1675, his Testament Dative and Inventory was given up by his widow, Anna Lamont. At the time of his death William Crawford of Auchinames owed five hundred pounds to h
2 CONC is son, Archibald Lamont of Auchinames, due to him under the terms of a contact of marriage. . Confirmation was granted to Anna Lamont on 15 October 1675. [National Records of Scotland, Glasgow Commissary Court, The Testament Dati
2 CONC ve and Inventory of William Craufurd of Auchinnames, parish of Kilbride, reference CC9/7/41]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000187720841865 Image of Testament]'''
