1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ELIZABETH CRAWFORD===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Crawford is the eldest daughter of Robert Crawford of Awchnames [https://archive.org/stream/scottishrecordso45scotuoft#page/57/mode/1up M. S. Shaw, WS. for Lt.-General Sir Aylmer Hunter-Weston of Hunterston, Some Fami
2 CONC ly Papers of the Hunters of Hunterston (J. Skinner and Company for the Scottish Record Society, Edinburgh, 1925), page 57]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Crawford died before 12 June 1649, the date upon which her widowed husband was contracted to marry Marion Cunningham  [https://archive.org/stream/scottishrecordso45scotuoft#page/57/mode/1up M. S. Shaw, WS. for Lt.-Gen
2 CONC eral Sir Aylmer Hunter-Weston of Hunterston, Some Family Papers of the Hunters of Hunterston (J. Skinner and Company for the Scottish Record Society, Edinburgh, 1925),  charter printed on pp. 57-60]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Crawford married Robert Hunter of Hunterston. The marriage contract was signed on 29 August 1635  [https://archive.org/stream/scottishrecordso45scotuoft#page/57/mode/1up M. S. Shaw, WS. for Lt.-General Sir Aylmer Hunt
2 CONC er-Weston of Hunterston, Some Family Papers of the Hunters of Hunterston (J. Skinner and Company for the Scottish Record Society, Edinburgh, 1925), page 57]'''
