2 CONT Margaret Vans [1]
2 CONT *F, #132725
2 CONT *Last Edited=7 May 2008
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.95%
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Vans was the daughter of Sir John Vans of Barnbarroch and Margaret Macdowall.1 She married, firstly, James Gordon of Buittle.1 She married, secondly, James Maxwell of Breckonside.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Maxwell.1 Her married name became Gordon.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Margaret Vans and James Maxwell of Breckonside
2 CONT *1. John Maxwell [1]
2 CONT *2. Alexander Maxwell [1]
