2 CONT *2. Robert Gordon [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 263. Hereinafter cited as Burke's P
2 CONC eerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT James Gordon of Barncrosh, parish of Tongland. He married Margaret, daughter of Sir John Vaus of Longcastle, parish of Kirkinner, and had issue— John and Robert afterwards in succession, Viscount Kenmure.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1621 she pursued him for a divorce for sundry adulteries said to have been committed. 
2 CONT
