2 CONT Margaret Maxwell (Vans)  Birth: 1602 Blackburn, West Lothian, Scotland  Death: April 13, 1659 (57) Scotland 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Sir John Vans of Barnbarroch and Margaret Vans of Barnbarroch
2 CONT  Wife of James Gordon of Buittle and James Maxwell of Breckonside
2 CONT  Mother of Alexander Maxwell and John Maxwell, 2nd of Breconside andTerraughty
2 CONT  Sister of Rev. John Vans, AM and Joseph Vance
2 CONT  Half sister of Andrew Vans; Janet Maxwell; Grizell Glendinnen; Florence Gordon; Joanna Blain and 1 other
2 CONT  Added by: Nicole Rockwell on February 10, 2008 Managed by:Judi Judith Elaine Mc Kee and 3 others Curated by: Ben M. Angel
