2 CONC 00 merks, and to Janet Dalyell 6coo merks, all children of the marriage of Captain Thomas Dalyell, eldest son of the General, and the late Katherine Drummond. Dated at Canongate, II January 1683. Witnesses, John Cant, servant of t
2 CONC he said General, and James Hay, W.S. (Written by Robert Gumming, servitor of the said James Hay.) [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecords54scotuoft/scottishrecords54scotuoft/page/77/mode/1up The Binns Papers I: 386]'''
