2 CONC 000000222275357850?through=6000000008947052895. '''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mary Dalyell, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/John-Moubray-in-Manerstoune/6000000222276419870. Their postnuptial contract of marriage is dated 24 July 1686. [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecords54scotuo
2 CONC ft/scottishrecords54scotuoft/page/81/mode/1up The Binns Papers II: 400]'''
2 CONT
