1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jean Drummond Married James Murray, 2nd Duke of Athol, KT PC on  7 May 1749  (She mar. (2) 2 Sep 1767 Gen Lord Adam Gordon (dsp. 13 Aug 1801), 4th son of Alexander [Gordon], 2nd Duke of Gordon;  dsp. 22 Feb 1795), 
2 CONC only dau. of John Drummond, 10th of Lennoch and 3rd of Megginch, by his wife Bethia Murray, dau. of James Murray of Dencar
2 CONT
2 CONT She apparently jilted  Adam Austin MD, whose portrait is at the Royal Colleg of Physicians.  He wrote the song "For lack of gold she left me".
