2 CONC  and appeirand air wt the said Murdowis awin consent on the uyr prt in maner form and effect as efter followes That is to cay the said Murdow shall rnarrie God willing and tak to his spousit wyff' the said Cristtane MLKy lyk as th
2 CONC e said Dond and the said Cristane burding-takares upone them off the said Cristane oblisss thame to caus the said Cristane marie and tak to hir spousit busband the said Murdow and to yt effect bothe the said Murdow and Cristane ob
2 CONC lissis thame be the faith and trowthe in their bodies to fulfill and solempnizat the honoble band of  rnatrirnonie ather wt uther in face of halie kirk per verba depresenti befoir the feast and   terme of Witsonday nixt to cum unn
2 CONC o presenli sax hunder and thrittene zeiris And siclyk the said Murdow oblisss him and his airs exers assnis and intromitters with his wuids and geir to perfurnis and provyde of his awin frie proper geir the sowme of an thowsand pu
2 CONC n& guid and usuale mony of North Brittane at the feast and terme of Whitsonday Jij sax hundret and fourtene zeiris and thaireftel* to dedicat imploy and give furth the samyn to sufficient crecliters or upone land for annual rent a
2 CONC nd zeirlie profit or upone merchand obligationis as may be haid ancl to infeft the said Cristane McKy in the conjunct liferent ryt thniroff, for all the dnyis of hir lyftyme and quhowe oft soever, the lands qrupone the samyn sall 
2 CONC be gevin furt sall happin to redem it or the samyn upliftit furth of the creditoris handis to quhome the saymn sall be gewin yt so oft and als oft the sayinin sall be off new agane yewin furth upone new securitie, and the said Cri
2 CONC stane  to be in the conjunct liferent ryt tliairoff for all the days of hir lyftyme For cilk causis the said Eufame Monro moyr to the said Cristane and the said Dod M'Ky as cautioner sovertie and full dettour for the said Eufanle 
2 CONC bindis and oblissis thame thair airs exers or assis and all others intromitters wt thair lands to thankfullie content pay and deliver to the said Murdow his airs exers or assis the sowme of an thousand merks rno forsaid as doit an
2 CONC d tocherguid wt the said Cristane at the terms following viz thairoff at the feast and terme of Whitsonday nixt to cum anno presenti Jij sax hundret and threttene zeiris the sowme of fyve hundret inks moy usuale forsaid and the so
2 CONC wme of oyr five hundret inerks moy in haill and complit payinent of the forsaid sowrne of an thousand merks dott abone written at the feast and terme of Martimes nist thairafter anno supra srx hundret and threttene zieris But lang
2 CONC er delay fradwe or gyle and hrto and to the premises boith the saids prties binds and oblisses thame to reiterate and renew thir pets at desyre and optionn of ather prtie ay and qll the samyn be aim put in sure forme to the effect
