1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "VI. <strong>Robert Munro, fifth of Balconie</strong>. He married first, Helen, daughter of Hector Munro, II. of Assynt, with issue — 
2 CONT * John, who died unmarried, before his father. 
2 CONT * Isobel, who married Hugh Munro, IV. of Fyrish, with issue. 
2 CONT * Margaret. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Margaret, daughter of Donald Mackay of Scourie, with issue — 
2 CONT * Donald, who succeeded his father, 
2 CONT * Helen, married, with issue. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was succeeded by his only surviving son."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/historyofmunroso00mack#page/348/mode/2up History of the Munros of Fowlis: with genealogies of the principal families of the name to which are added those of Lexington and New England]; Alexander
2 CONC  Mackenzie; 1898; page 349
