1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT ALEXANDER ROSE, born about 1653, fourth son of David R. of Earlsmill, Nairn, and brother of Hew R., min. of Nairn ; educated at King's College, Aberdeen ; M.A. (1673) ; schoolmaster of Inverness, 1673-80 ; pres. by George, Marques
2 CONC s of Huntly, and ord. (at Forres) 16th Sept. 1680; dep. 31st Oct. 1716 for reading the Earl of Mar's proclamation. He died before 1725. He marr. Anna, daugh. of James Gordon of Daach, Ruthven, and had issue — 
2 CONT * Alexander ; 
2 CONT * David, Episcopal min. at Lethnot [great-grandfather of Sir Hugh Henry Rose, Bart., Baron Strathnairn, eminent Indian soldier], died 4th Nov. 1758; 
2 CONT * James.
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/fastiecclesiaesc06scot#page/302/mode/2up Fasti ecclesiae scoticanae: the succession of ministers in the Church of Scotland from the reformation], Vol. VI, page 303
