2 CONT TEXT Date of Import: Oct 13, 2001Ninian was ye youngest of the six brothers said Deaf Robert Cochran.  His wife was Jean White from ye Ro Waters and children were ten (2 sons and 8 daughters) being:
2 CONT Marmaduke, James, Janet, Jean, Mary, Aenas (Agnus?), Elizabeth, Isabel, and Martha.  He was an elder to Mr. John Will of Glendermont.  His age not seventy (before his death).[Monroe2001.FTW]9.
2 CONT Ninian14 Cochran (James13, John12, John11, John10, Robert9, Alan8, John7, Robert6, William5, Gosiline4, John3, William2, Waldeve ? Walddemar1 de Cochrane) was born Abt. 1602 in County Donegal,
2 CONT Ireland. He married Jean White Abt. 1645 in Ireland. She was born Abt. 1628. Notes for Ninian Cochran:
2 CONT Ninian was ye youngest of the six brothers said Deaf Robert Cochran. His wife was Jean White from ye Ro Waters and children were ten (2 sons and 8 daughters) being: Marmaduke, James, Janet, Jean,
2 CONT Mary, Aenas (Agnus?), Elizabeth, Isabel, and Martha. He was an elder to Mr. John Will of Glendermont. His age not seventy (before his death). Children of Ninian Cochran and Jean White are:
2 CONT i.   JANET15 COCHRAN, b. Abt. 1647.
2 CONT ii.   JAMES COCHRAN, b. Abt. 1648.
2 CONT iii.   MARMADUKE COCHRAN, b. Abt. 1650, Ireland.
2 CONT iv.   ROBERT COCHRAN, b. Abt. 1651.
2 CONT v.   JOHN COCHRAN, b. Abt. 1652.
2 CONT vi.   NINIAN COCHRAN, b. Abt. 1654.
2 CONT vii.   GEORGE COCHRAN, b. Abt. 1656, Ireland.
2 CONT viii.   AGNES COCHRAN, b. Abt. 1658.
