2 CONT James, John, George, Isabel and Christian. His age not 40 (before he died).[Monroe2001.FTW]8. George14 Cochran (James13, John12, John11, John10, Robert9, Alan8, John7, Robert6, William5, Gosiline4,
2 CONT John3, William2, Waldeve ? Walddemar1 de Cochrane) was born Abt. 1601 in County Donegal, Ireland. He married Janet Leslie. She was born Abt. 1622 in of Torkalihew, Londonderry, Ireland (Source: LDS
