1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Margaret Carnegie''' was the daughter of David Carnegie, Lord Carnegie and Lady Margaret Hamilton.2,1 She married Gavin Dalzell, 2nd Earl of Carnwath, son of Robert Dalzell, 1st Earl of Carnwath and Christian Do
2 CONC uglas, circa 21 July 1637, with a tocher of £2,000 Scots.1,3 She died between 1648 and 1663.
