1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===MARY SANDILANDS===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mary Sandilands, here treated, is the daughter of Sir James Sandilands of St, Monance and his wife Agnes Carnegie. [https://archive.org/details/fastiecclesiaesc05scot/page/410/mode/1up Fasti V: 410]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT SANDILANDS
2 CONT MARIE SIR JAMES SANDILANDS AGNES CARNEGIE FR76 (FR76) F
2 CONT 09/05/1636 453/ 10 71 St Andrews and St Leonards
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''According to the Fasti of the Church of Scotland, it was Mary Sandilands who married the Reverend David Lyell, Minister of the Gospel at Montrose. [https://archive.org/details/fastiecclesiaesc05scot/page/410/mode/1up Fasti V: 4
2 CONC 10] Stirnet reports that it was Marjory Sandilands who married him. [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ss4as/sandilands01.php#link5 Stirnet: Sandilands 01] [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ll/lyell1.php#con2 St
2 CONC irnet: Lyell 1]'''
2 CONT
