1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == SIR WILLIAM PRIMROSE OF CARRINGTON ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == His Testament Dative and Inventory ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Confirmation was granted on 5 January 1716. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Commissary Court, The Testament Dative and Inventory of Sir William Primrose of Carringtoun, reference CC8/8/86]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir William Primrose, Baronet [S 1651] of Carrington</strong>, son and heir by 1st wife, born 14 January 1649, at Edinburgh; Clerk of Notaries, 1 November 1660; succeeded to the Baronetcy, 27 November 1679. He married, in
2 CONC  or before 1677, Mary, 3rd daughter of Patrick Scott of Thirlestane, co. Selkirk. He died 23 September 1687, in his 39th year."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524390#page/n343/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. III; page 325
