2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Not sure how Janet could have been born in 1630. Either date is wrong, or line is wrong.
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Anna Mackenzie''' was born in 1620 in Kintal, Ross-shire, Scotland. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-38482613 Colin Mackenzie, 1st Earl of Seaforth] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-38482651 Margaret Seton]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna married [https://www.geni.com/profile-30799730 Alexander Lindsay, 1st Earl of Balcarres] in April 1640. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-12491365 Anne Lindsay]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-25273498 Lady Henrietta Lindsay]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-12491384 Lady Sophia Campbell (Lindsay)]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-12491279 Charles Lindsay, 2nd Earl of Balcarres]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-12491346 Colin Lindsay, 3rd Earl of Balcarres]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna married [https://www.geni.com/profile-45129833 Archibald Campbell, 9th Earl of Argyll] on June 28, 1670. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on May 2, 1707 in Kilconquhar, Fife, Scotland and was buried on May 29, 1707 in Lindsay Family Chapel at Balcarres House, Colinsbergh, Fife, Scotland, United Kingdom. 
