2 CONT Gender: Male Christening Date: 27 May 1645 Christening Place: KILSYTH, STIRLING, SCOTLAND Birth Date:  Birthplace:  Death Date:  Name Note:  Race:  Father's Name: John Earl Of Wigtown Fleming Father's Birthplace:  Father's Age:  M
2 CONC other's Name: Jane Drummond Mother's Birthplace:  Mother's Age:  Indexing Project (Batch) Number: C11483-2 System Origin: Scotland-ODM GS Film number: 1041949, 0102118 Reference ID: 
