2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Sophia Lindsay married Colonel Hon. Charles Campbell, son of Archibald Campbell, 9th Earl of Argyll and Lady Mary Stuart, in 1678.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1698.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Alexander Lindsay, 1st Earl of Balcarres and Lady Anne Mackenzie.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Campbell.
