1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1.	Caleb Lindsey was born 1670 in Scotland, and died 1717 in Essex, Virginia. He was the son of 2. James Lindsey and 3. Fnu Lnu. He married Clara Daniel 1663/1685 in Scotland. She was born ABT 1674, and died ABT 17
2 CONC 24.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Caleb Lindsey b: ABT 1685 in Virginia
2 CONT # James Lindsey b: ABT 1687
2 CONT # Elizabeth Lindsey b: ABT 1689
2 CONT # James William Lindsey , Sr b: ABT 1700 in Essex County, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Caleb Lindsay settled a home on the Rappahannock River in Essex, now Caroline County, but died in St. Mary's parish in Gloucester County in 1712. His wife was a Miss Clara. He left two sons, Joshua, b. 1698 and James, b. 1700. (no
2 CONC te the difference in the death dates of 1712 and 1717-18.)
2 CONT
