1 TITL Reverend Mr.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===REVEREND MR. ALEXANDER BRUCE OF GARLET MA===
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Minister of the Gospel at Kirkcurd in Peeblesshire, Scotland; afterwards Minister of the Gospel at Donaghadee or Castlereagh, in County Down, Ireland, and then Minister of the Gospel at Vinecash in County Down. Irel
2 CONC and'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Reverend Mr. Alexander Bruce of Garlet, here treated, is the third second son of Robert Bruce of Kennet.[https://archive.org/details/fastiecclesiaesc01scot/page/277/mode/1up Fasti of the Church of Scotland I: 277] His mothe
2 CONC r is Agnes or Annas Murray. He was born before 13 June 1637, the date upon which his baptism was registered at Ckackmannan in Clackmannanshire, in Scotland. [National Records of Scotland, Clackmannan Baptisms, reference OPR.466/1]
2 CONC '''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Reverend Mr. Alexander Bruce, here treated, married Margaret Clelland, the eldest daughter of James Clelland of Stoneypath. [https://archive.org/details/fastiecclesiaesc01scot/page/277/mode/1up Fasti of the Church of Scotla
2 CONC nd I: 277-8]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Marion-Bruce/6000000169730098905?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1609978580368&through=6000000002666375212
