2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Forrester of Little Denovan, was admitted Minister of Alva  but refusing to accept the Revolution Settlement in 1688, he settled  in Holland where he remained for several years. After his return he  was appointed Principal 
2 CONC of the New College of St. Andrews and d.  there on Saturday 2 November 1706. He m. Anne, eldest daughter  of Mr. John Govan, Minister of Muckhart, had d. by 7 August 1730  when she is styled his relict in her service as heir to he
2 CONC r brother, Mr.  John Govan, Minister at Campsie, and was father of, 2c} David Forrester of Denovan,
