2 CONC rs in 1677 (pp. 340, 364). – (John Davidson 1878, Inverurie and the Earldom of the Garioch)
2 CONT
2 CONT John Erskine, who dsp in 1702, and whom his brother William was served heir general on 4 August 1709. - Erskine of Balhagertty and Pittodrie, Red Book of Scotland
