2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT In the Will Oliver McCausland (#3455) - 7 Oct 1721 [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT * I  do herby appoint my brother Dr. Andrew Hamilton, my son Richard Hamilton Esq & said Alexdr McCausland of Rash & Robt McCausland of Newtown Limavaddy – Exors &c. (Dr Andrew Hamilton is her brother)
2 CONT *Codicil - 1721 bequeath to my brother Dr. Andrew Hamilton £10/-, & to my brother Nathaniel Cooper Clk 10/-, to my son-in-law Richard Hamilton Esq, to my nephew Robert Conyngham of Strabane £10/-, & to Archibald McCausland son of 
2 CONC Thomas McCausland (another rendition of this will has this name as “Robert”) £5
2 CONT
2 CONT In the Marriage Settlement John McCausland (#4085) and Anne Sampson (#4078) – 28 November 1728 [2] Trustees - Rev. Wm Hamilton of Caledon, Co. Tyrone, Archdeacon of Armagh (her Brother)
2 CONT
