2 CONT ****** 	(3)	Amelia Hamilton mentioned by 'HamiltonHistory' 	m. Thomas Smith of Londonderry
2 CONT ****** 	(4)	Sarah Hamilton (coheir of Sir Henry) mentioned by TCB=m. (1755) Hugh Stewart (b 1711, d 01.1800, rector of Termon)
2 CONT ****** 	(5)	Letitia Hamilton mentioned by TCB 	m. John Olphert
