1 DEAT
2 DATE 29 APR 1731
2 ADDR
3 CITY Perth Amboy
3 STAE NJ
3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU Businessman
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Questionable birthdate (in relation to his son’s birthdate)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT John Barclay immigrated to New Jersey about 1684, and settled at Perth Amboy, New Jersey.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Col David Barclay and Katherine Gordon, brother of Robert Barclay, the Quaker Apologist; David Barclay; Lucy Barclay; and Jean (Barclay) Cameron. He came to East New Jersey c. 1685 where his brother Robert had be
2 CONC en appointed as an absentee Governor. John had been deeded much land by his brother Robert and others and when their brother David died at sea on his way to America Robert deeded David’s East New Jersey land to John.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Barclay died at Perth Amboy in April of 1731, after a life of holding public offices of trust and responsibility. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Acknowledgement: Genealogist Jim Baucom
