2 CONT John Fobes 1 July 1679–5 August 1725 (Age 46) Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America
2 CONT
2 CONT The Life Summary of John
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Fobes was born on 1 July 1679, in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Edward Fobes, was 28 and his mother, Elizabeth Howard, was 29. He married Abigail Robinson on 14 No
2 CONC vember 1704, in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. He died on 5 August 1725, in his hometown, at the age of 46, and was buried in Br
2 CONC ockton, Plymouth, Massachusetts, United States.
