2 CONT They were the parents of Mary (b. 1705; mar. Daniel Hudson Jr (1726)), Edward (1707-1736), Abigail (b. 1709; mar. Josiah Snell (1728)), Sarah (b. 1711; mar. William Hudson (1757)), John (1714-1783), Josiah (1716-1794), Nathan (171
