2 CONT ===John Fobes (1679 - 1725)===
2 CONT
2 CONT John Fobes
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1 Jul 1679 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Edward Fobes and Elizabeth (Howard) Fobes
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Elizabeth (Fobes) Keith, Bethiah (Fobes) Keith, Hannah (Fobes) Keith, Joshua Fobes, Benjamin Fobes and William Forbes
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Abigail (Robinson) Fobes — married 14 Nov 1704 in Braintree, Norfolk, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Mary (Fobes) Hudson, Edward Fobes, Abigail (Fobes) Snell, Sarah (Forbes) Hudson, John Fobes, Josiah Fobes, Nathan Fobes and Silence Fobes
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 16 Aug 1725 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT When Fobes-55 was merged into Fobes-15 on 20 December 2017, father and son, both named John and both having a son named Edward, were merged together. The youngest three children in the merged profile, the second Edward (Fobes-16),
2 CONC  Martha (Fobes-18), and Libeus Fobes-17, were all born 14 or more years years after Fobes-15 died because he was their grandfather, not their father. Fobes-243 is a new profile for the son, in essence undoing the merge. --- Glenn 
2 CONC Fobes (Fobes-241) 04/26/2020
2 CONT
