2 CONT Brief Life History of Joshua
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joshua Fobes was born on 20 May 1689, in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts, United States, his father, Edward Fobes, was 38 and his mother, Elizabeth Howard, was 39. He married Abigail Dunbar on 4 December 1711, in Bridgew
2 CONC ater, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 8 daughters. He died on 6 April 1767, in his hometown, at the age of 77, and was buried in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Mass
2 CONC achusetts, United States.
