2 CONT Husband of Abigail (Dunbar) Fobes — married 4 Dec 1711 (to about 1750) in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Province of Massachusetts Baymap
2 CONT Husband of Marcy (Churchill) Fobes — married 5 Jun 1754 (to 6 Apr 1767) in Plympton, Plymouth Co., Province of Massachusetts Baymap
