2 CONT Brief Life History of William
2 CONT
2 CONT When William Russell was born on 6 May 1681, in Dartmouth, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States, his father, Joseph Russell Sr, was 31 and his mother, Elizabeth Forbes, was 24. He married Elizabeth Handley on 6 July 1704, in Bost
2 CONC on, Suffolk, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 1 daughter. He died on 9 April 1706, in his hometown, at the age of 24, and was buried in Apponagansett Friends Cemetery, Dartmouth, Bristol, Massachuset
2 CONC ts, United States.
