1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In1688, Alexander became a freeman by birth and then in 1690, he fought in King William's War. John and his brother, Alexander, moved form County Fife, Scotland, to County Derry, ireland, prior to 1687. He was a wo
2 CONC olen merchant in Dublin 1691-1736.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Fought in King William's War, 1690. Merchant in Dublin 1691-1706 (Albert Finley France) According to Stout, pg.14, went to Ireland in 1674, served in King William's War, 1690, wool & linen merchant in Dublin, most o f his sons wen
2 CONC t to America on "Eagle Wing." Baptismal records of children at St. Peters (In Dublin?)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
