2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/genealogy/Elliot-Descendants-840 Margaret (Elliot) Armstrong married William Armstrong (1648 - 18 Jul 1679) and is the mother of one child and the grandmother of 2 grandchildren. Listed below are details o
2 CONC n up to five generations of descendants. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander Armstrong  (abt 1677 - 17 May 1762) m. Elizabeth Carlisle (abt 1681).
2 CONT
2 CONT Helen (Armstrong) Carruthers (18 Dec 1703) m. William Carruthers (bef 1703). William Thomas Robert Armstrong  (20 Jul 1707 - abt 1753) m. Susanna Blythe (abt 1702 - 1740) on 1 Oct 1724.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lancelot Thomas Armstrong  (abt 1735 - abt 1802) m. Rachel Gamble (abt 1747 - abt 1802).
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander L. Armstrong  (1770 - abt 1826) m. Margaret McCollum (1772 - bef 1826) on 11 Dec 1795.
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew Jackson Armstrong (1812 - 1892) James Armstrong  (abt 1815 - 03 Apr 1895)
