1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Note about placement===
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew's marriage comes from the Clogher marriage records.  When trying to determine where Andrew belonged in the Armstrong tree, I noted that John Joseph Armstrong had a son Andrew, and that was the only use of Andrew in all of t
2 CONC he published Armstrong pedigree for the Armstrongs.  He therefore belongs as a brother of John Joseph.
2 CONT This is backed up by the fact that he married a Finlay, and so did one of John Joseph's daughters, tying this all together.
