1 NAME William /Armstrong/
2 GIVN William
2 _MARNM Armstrong
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 CITY Middletown Township
3 STAE PA
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1718
2 ADDR
3 CITY Enniskillen
