2 CONT
2 CONT '''Barbara Pollock, here treated, is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Pollock-of-Mearns/6000000042538027858?through=6000000203870086856 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Catherine-Ralston/60000000425382208
2 CONC 28?through=6000000203870086856 She was born before 23 April 1676, the date upon which her baptism was registered at Kilwinning in the Cunningham division of Ayrshire, Scotland. Her baptismal record reads as follows: "April 1676 . 
2 CONC . Barbara Pollok lall daughter to Rot Pollock & Cathrine Ralston baptized the 23 day." [National Records of Scotland, Kilwinning Baptisms, reference OPR.599/1] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000204114892825 Image 
2 CONC of Baptismal Record]'''
