2 CONT '''Kathrine Pollock, here treated, is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Pollock-of-Mearns/6000000042538027858?through=6000000203870086856 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Catherine-Ralston/6000000042538220
