1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Gavin Ralston was born in 1764 in Dreghorn, Ayrshire and died on 12 Jan 1833 in Dunduff, Maybole, at age 69.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: 9 Jan 1819 farmer, in Drumbain, Maybole
2 CONT
2 CONT 29 Dec 1818 farmer in Castlehill, Maybole
2 CONT
2 CONT Ayr observer 15 Jan 1833
2 CONT
2 CONT Deaths
2 CONT
2 CONT Suddenly, at Dunduff, on Saturday morning last, Mr. Gavin Ralston, farmer, much lamented by an attached circle of relations and friends.
2 CONT
2 CONT Air advertiser 17 January 1833
2 CONT
2 CONT At Dunduff, on the morning of Saturday last, Mr Gavin Ralston at an advanced age. Mr Ralston's experience in, and knowledge of agricultural matters, had gained for him a high character as a farmer. In the relations of father and h
2 CONC usband he was dearly beloved, and as a respectable member of society and a warm and steady friend to individuals, his death will be deeply regretted, and his name fondly cherished.
2 CONT
2 CONT Noted events in his life were:
2 CONT
2 CONT • Baptism: 24 Aug 1764, Dreghorn, Ayrshire.
2 CONT
2 CONT • Occupation: captain in Army
2 CONT
2 CONT Gavin married Unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT The child from this marriage was:
2 CONT
2 CONT     i. David Ralston was born in 1800 and died on 1 May 1878, at age 78.
2 CONT
2 CONT David married Janet Ralston , daughter of Robert Ralston and Elisabeth Bryce , on 12 Jan 1828 in Tasmania. Janet was born in 1798 and died on 24 Aug 1861 in Tasmania, at age 63.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gavin next married Sara McCUTCHESON , daughter of Alexander McCUTCHESON and Agnes Stewart , on 28 Jun 1800 in Dreghorn, Ayrshire. Sara was born on 31 Oct 1777 in Kirkmichael, Ayrshire and died on 30 Aug 1858 in Lagg, Maybole, Ayrs
2 CONC hire, at age 80.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT    i. Agnes (Nancy) Ralston was born in 1802 in Maybole and died in 1857 in Raymond Terrace, Sydney?, at age 55.
2 CONT
2 CONT    ii. Sarah Ralston died on an unknown date.
2 CONT
2 CONT   iii. Hannah Heywood Ralston was born in 1803 in Maybole and died on 26 Aug 1880 in 14 West End, Park St, Glasgow, at age 77.
2 CONT
2 CONT    iv. Gavin Ralston was born in 1805 and died on 27 Feb 1874 in Bendigo, Victoria, at age 69.
2 CONT
2 CONT     v. Alexander Ralston was born in 1808 in Maybole and died on 13 Jun 1861 in Lagg, Maybole, at age 53.
2 CONT
2 CONT    vi. Adam Hutchison Ralston was born about 1816 and died in 1884 in Dookie?, Victoria, about age 68. 
2 CONT ======================
2 CONT He is the late Gavin Ralston (Captain 3rd Light Dragoons)   of Lagg, Ayrshire, Scotland. In his son Gavin's 1874 obit. 
2 CONT
