2 CONT
2 CONT [https://archive.org/stream/fastiecclesiu04scotuoft#page/n77/mode/1up Fasti Ecclesiæ Scoticanæ; The Succession of Ministers in the Church of Scotland from the Reformation by Hew Scott, DD., New Edition. Volume IV. Synods of Argyll
