2 CONT Name: Lachlan Buidhe MCNEILL
2 CONT Sex: M
2 CONT Birth: 1611 in Lossit, Isle Of Islay, Argyllshire, Scotland Death: 1695
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lachlan Buidhe McNeill was twice married: first to a kinswoman Mary McNeil, daughter to Carskiey, by whom he had John, Neil buys, Archibald, Torquil, Isobell and Elizabeth, and secondly to Margaret, daughter of MacAlister of Tore 
2 CONC in Arran, by whom he had Hector, Malcolm, Daniel (or Donald), Neil oig, Mary, Annabell, Isabell and Margaret. He also produced a natural daughter Margaret. During his lifetime Lachlan acquired substantial lands in Kintyre beginnin
2 CONC g with a wadset Charter of Tirfergus and Largieban in 1660 followed in 1668 by Losset, Knockhantie and Glenahantie.
2 CONT
