1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir William Graham, Baronet [S 1625] of Braco</strong>, son and heir, succeeded to the Baronetcy about 1646 and was, on 9 October 1647, served heir special in Braco, etc, co Perth, and in the Barony of Aithray, co Stirlin
2 CONC g. He registered arms about 1672 in the Lyon office. He married Mary, daughter of John Cowan, of Tailzartoun, co Stirling, by Katherine, daughter of Patrick Smith, of Braco, in the parish of Redgorton, co Perth. He died before 168
2 CONC 5."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n321/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 303
