2 CONT '''20 March 1707: Instrument of Intimation by Anna Maxwell, daughter of the late Patrick Maxwell of Tealing, intimating to John Scrymgeour of Kirktoun that a Bond for 10,000 merks was assigned to her by George Napier of Kilmahew, 
