1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == JOHN MAXWELL OF BLACKSTOUN ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Maxwell of Blackstoun, here treated, is the second son of https://www.geni.com/people/Patrick-Maxwell-of-Newark/6000000002116164996?through=6000000055692411899. [https://archive.org/stream/geographicalcoll02macf#page/206/m
2 CONC ode/1up Geographical Collections II: 206]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == The Lands of Blackstoun ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The following description is taken from Walter MacFarlane's geographical collections: "Upon back Cart below Johnstoun two myles is Blackstoun .......... the house was improven and much beautified by James Earl of Abercorn .....
2 CONC ..... from Abercorn Blackstain was transfer'd to Sir Patrick Maxwell of Newark and given to John Maxwell his 2nd son his patrimony from whose heiress Kattrin it came to Alexr Napier now of Blackstoun."[https://archive.org/stream/g
2 CONC eographicalcoll02macf#page/206/mode/1up Geographical Collections Relating to Scotland made by Walter MacFarlane (Scottish Records Society, Edinburgh, 1907), ii, p. 206]'''
