1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Campbell-1133
2 CONT
2 CONT ohn Campbell IVth of Lochnell formerly Campbell
2 CONT Born about 1592 in Lochnell, Ardchattan, Argyllshire, Scotland
2 CONT Ancestors ancestors
2 CONT Son of Alexander (Campbell) Campbell IIIrd of Lochnell and Isobel (MacDougall) Campbell
2 CONT Brother of Duncan Campbell and Isobel Campbell	
2 CONT Husband of Anne (Campbell) Campbell of Auchinbreck — married 31 Oct 1618 [location unknown]
2 CONT Descendants descendants
2 CONT Father of Margaret (Campbell) Stewart, Colin (Campbell) Campbell Vth of Lochnell, Archibald Campbell, Archibald Campbell 1st and John Campbell
2 CONT Died 2 Feb 1645 at about age 53 in Inverlochy, Inverness-shire, Scotland
