1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The lineage of Yardley to Hunter to Gilmour to Boyd to Margaret Stewart of Scotland goes down to descendant (in-law) Bev Yardley through her husband. It is also provided here by Bev Yardley. The Boyd down to Yardle
2 CONC y line is actually the paternal lineage of Bev Yardley's husband. Also the Boyd sister Margaret who married Abraham Steell is in the maternal line through Archibald and King to Bev's husband.   Finally back up the line, Margaret S
2 CONC tewart was from the Ochiltree Stewarts of Ayrshire, Scotland because her great uncle was Lord of Ochiltree, Andrew Stewart, later Baron of Castle Stewart, Ireland.
