1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''From [https://www.scotlandspeople.gov.uk/search-records/church-registers/church-births-baptisms#form&record_type=opr_births&church_type=Old%20Parish%20Registers&surname=Hill&surname_so=exact&forename_so=exact&fr
2 CONC om_year=1684&to_year=1706&parent_names=Ninian&parent_names_so=exact&parent_name_two_so=exact&county=GLASGOW%20CITY&sort=asc&order=Date&field=year Scotland's People: Old Parish Registers: Births and Baptisms] NOTE: missing Jean 168
2 CONC 7 and Laurence 1700'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Possible list of 8 [or 10] children of Ninian Hill and Craufurd from first: 25 May 1686 Bethia Hill to last: 3 February 1706 Issobell Hill
2 CONT
2 CONT * 25 May 1686 birth or baptism of Bethia Hill, daughter of Ninian Hill and Craufurd [child 1], in the parish of Barony
2 CONT * 8 March 1691 birth or baptism of Hellen Hill, daughter of Niniang Laird Lambhill Hill [child 2 or 3], in the parish of Barony
2 CONT * 23 January 1693 birth or baptism of Ninian Hill, son of Ninian Hill [child 3 or 4], in the parish of Barony
2 CONT * [unknown day] January 1695 birth or baptism of Heugh Hill, son of Ninian Hill [child 4 or 5], in the parish of Barony
2 CONT * 10 May 1697 birth or baptism of Margaret Hill, daughter of Ninian Hill [child 5 or 6], in the parish of Barony
2 CONT * 23 February 1701 birth or baptism of Anna Hill, daughter of Ninian Hill and Mary Crauford [child 6 or 8], in the parish of Barony
2 CONT * 4 April 1703 birth or baptism of Mary Hill, daughter of Ninian Laird Lambhill Hill and Mary Crawford [child 7 or 9], in the parish of Barony
2 CONT * 3 February 1706 birth or baptism of Issobell Hill, daughter of Ninian Laird Lambhill Hill and Mary Crauford [child 8 or 10], in the parish of Barony
2 CONT
2 CONT '''From [https://archive.org/details/earlyrecordsofol00hill/page/n147/mode/2up?q=%22Mary+Craufurd%22 Early records of an old Glasgow family - Hill family, 1520-1901, by William Henry Hill, Published 1902 Page 147]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Issue of Ninian Hill and Mary Craufurd.''
2 CONT
2 CONT By Mary Craufurd, Ninian Hill had several children. They were married in 1685, and I think the probability is that the daughters, Bethia, Jean, Helen, and Margaret, were the eldest born.
