1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography==
2 CONT "<strong>John, second Lord Bargany</strong>, was served heir to his father 17 October 1662...
2 CONT
2 CONT ==family==
2 CONT ...Lord Bargany married, first, in 1662, Margaret Cunningham, second daughter of William, ninth Earl of Glencairn, Lord High Chancellor of Scotland, and had issue ...
2 CONT
2 CONT ...Lord Bargany married, secondly, in 1676, Alice Moore, eldest daughter of Henry, first Earl of Drogheda, dowager of Henry, second Earl of Clanbrassil. She died at Roscommon House, Dublin, 25 December 1677, without issue."
2 CONT
2 CONT ==sources==
2 CONT * [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun02pauluoft#page/28/mode/2up ''The Scots Peerage''], Vol. II, page 28-32
2 CONT
