1 TITL General
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Patrick Stewart of Ledcriech, an Officer in the Army of Charles I and suffered much on account of his loyalty, married Margaret, daughter of Robert Buchannan of Drumlain.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT  Patrick served as a General in the English army of Charles I, Charles II, and James VII & II. He fought in 25 battles, besides skirmishes, and suffered much financially because of his loyalty to the royal families.  The testament
2 CONC  for "Margaret Buchanan and Patrick Stewart her husband" was registered on 22 AUG 1682. (DCR)  Patrick married to Margaret BUCHANAN, daughter of Robert Buchanan of Drumbain.  They had only one child:  Alexander STEWART, 4th of Led
2 CONC creich and Stronslany, b: ABT 1676 in Ledcreich, Balquhidder, Perthshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT https://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=dansswing&id=P2300642205
