2 _MARNM Alexander
1 NAME Hon. John Alexander of Gartmore
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1612
2 PLAC Menstrie
2 ADDR
3 STAE Scotland
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1642
2 ADDR
3 CITY Eredy (Raphoe)
