1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Patrick Stewart''' was born circa 1608 in Stirling, Scotland,. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34624568842 John Stewart, of Upper Kirkton, Cumbrae] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34692404170 NN Stewart]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrick married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34779646674 Jonet Stewart] on January 19, 1630, in Gargunnock, Stirling, Scotland. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34702558950 William Stewart]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-128703267 Andrew Stuart]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34702558613 James John Stewart]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died circa 1674 in Lancaster, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
