2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Neil Maclean was the third son of Lachlan Maclean, 6th of Coll, and Florence Macleod, and lived on the farm of Drimnacross in Mull. He served under Sir Lachlan Maclean of Duart in the time of Montrose. He was at the batt
2 CONC le of Inverkeithing in 1651, and was severly wounded. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Florence Macdonald, daughter of Allan Macdonald of Morar and his wife Catherine. Neil and Florence had two sons and six daughters.
