1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Archibald Kennedy, of Culzean</strong>, co. Ayr, s. and h. of John Kennedy, of the same (d. 1665), by Margaret, da. of John (Hamilton), 1st Lord Bargeny [S.], which John was 1st s. and heir of Sir Alexander Kennedy, of Cu
2 CONC lzean (d. Sep. 1652), 3d and yst. s. but eventually heir to the estate of the Hon. Sir Thomas Kennedy, of Culzean aforesaid (d. 1611), 2d s. of Gilbert (Kennedy), 3d Earl or Cassillis [S.], suc. his father in 1665, being served he
2 CONC ir to him, 17 April 1672, and was cr. a Baronet [S.], as above, 8 Dec. 1682, with rem. to heirs male of the body. He m., when a minor (probably before 1680), Elizabeth, 1st da. of David (Leslie), 1st Lord Newark [S.], by Jean, da.
2 CONC  of Sir John Yorke. She was living 4 March 1693. He d. 1710."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524408#page/n335/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1904; Vol. IV; page 316
2 CONT
