1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JOHN KENNEDY===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Kennedy is the eldest son of John Kennedy of Culzean and his wife Margaret Hamilton. He is mentioned in his father's testament dated 26 March 1658 but he died without issue. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02p
