2 NICK Maria Willemse Teller
1 NAME Maritje Pieterse /Teller/
2 GIVN Maritje Pieterse
2 SURN Teller
2 _MARNM Loockermans
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Menands, Albany County, New York, United States of America
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 3 NOV 1641
2 PLAC Beverwyck
2 ADDR
3 CITY New York
3 STAE New York
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE BET 1707 AND 1715
2 ADDR
