1 NAME Joan /Adair/
2 GIVN Joan
2 SURN Adair
2 _MARNM Adair
2 NICK Jean Margaruete Adair
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1631
2 ADDR
3 CITY Kinhilt
3 CTRY Scotland
