2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''6 May 1667: Assignation by Antonia Broune [Brown], daughter of deceased Sir John Broune [Brown] of Fordell, with consent of Alexander Dunlope [Dunlop], fiar of that Ilk, her future spouse, to James Dunlope [Dunlop] of that Ilk,
2 CONC  father of said Alexander, of GD26/4/134 in part payment of her tocher as contained in marriage contract dated as above. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD26%2f4%2f144&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&
2 CONC tn=n&tp=n&k=Dunlop+of+that+ilk&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1601&dt=1700&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Leslie family, Earls of Leven and Melville, reference GD26/4/144]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''20 February 1669: Signature of the lands of Over Auldhall etc granted to Alexander Dunlop and Antonia Brown (Broun, Broune), his wife. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=SIG1%2f38%2f1
2 CONC 16&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Alexander+Dunlop&ko=p&r=&ro=m&df=1650&dt=1750&di=n National Records of Scotland, Register of Signatures, boxed series, reference SIG1/38/116]'''
