1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == PATRICK HOUSTON ==
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Merchant in Glasgow; Burgess and Guild Brother of Glasgow===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Patrick Houston, Merchant in Glasgow, here treated, is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-Patrick-Houstoun-of-that-Ilk-1st-Baronet/6000000002115890870 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Hamilton/6000000002785
2 CONC 582286?through=6000000001440157058 [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/hh4bz/houston01.php Stirnet: Houston 01]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT ''' Patrick Houston, Merchant in Glasgow, here treated, died before 16 February 1716, the date upon which his son George was enrolled as a burgess and guild brother of Glasgow. [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecordso43scotuo
2 CONC ft/page/317/mode/1up Glasgow Burgesses 1573-1751: 317]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the Burgess Records of Glasgow ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''22 August 1693: Houston, Patrick, merchant, B. and G.B. wife. [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecordso43scotuoft/page/229/mode/1up Glasgow Burgesses 1573-1751: 229]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''16 February 1716: Houston, George, merchant, B. and G.B., as eld. l. son to dec. Patrick H., merchant, B. and  G.B. [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecordso43scotuoft/page/317/mode/1up Glasgow Burgesses 1573-1751: 317]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                    3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''19 April 1719: Houston, Patrick, merchant, B. and G.B., as second l. son to dec. Patrick H., merchant, B. and G.B. [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecordso43scotuoft/page/335/mode/1up Glasgow Burgesses 1573-1751: 335]'''
2 CONT
