1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir William Stirling, Baronet [S. 1666], of Ardoch</strong>, s. and h. ; suc. to the Baronetcy, in Feb. 1669. He m. firstly (contract 22 Jan. 1685), Mary, 1st da. of Sir Charles Erskine, 1st Baronet [S. 1666], of Alva, by
2 CONC  Christian, da. of Sir James Dundas. He m. secondly (contract 24 May 1699), Janet, da. of John Murray, of Touchadam. He d. Feb. 1702. His widow m. 3 Dec. 1702, Robert Murray, s. of Sir Robert Murray, of Abercairney."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524408#page/n271/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1904; Vol. IV; page 253
