2 CONC  Sanda, Argyllshire, reference GD92/174]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                    25
2 CONT
2 CONT '''21 September 1694: BOND by Patrick Hamiltoun of Coatts [Hamilton of Coats], binding himself to infeft Isobell McDonald, his spouse, daughter of deceased Ronald McDonald of Sanna [Macdonald of Sanda], in an annuity of 300 merks 
