2 CONT BIOGRAPHY
2 CONT
2 CONT Apparently the details of the regrant of the Forrester title were not made known as, in 1676, his brother's right to the title was questioned. Even though it was his right, he never assumed the title. This may have something to do
2 CONC  with the rumours that his wife had had an incestuous affair with his brother. In 1679 this brother seduced a niece who stabbed him to death for which the niece was executed at the Cross of Edinburgh. However, he did not survive v
2 CONC ery much longer as he died in 1681 only forty-eight years old
2 CONT --------------------
