1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == JEAN HENDERSON ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''11-13 July 1654: Extract disposition and renunciation by John Henryson of Fordell, William Henryson, his brother, Margaret Henryson, spouse of Sir Henry Wardlaw of Pitreavie (Pittreavie), bart, Jean Henryson, spouse of Thomas B
2 CONC ruce of Blairhall, and Elizabeth Henryson, in favour of James Henryson, their third brother, of all goods which might belong to them through the decease of George Henryson, their brother. Registered in Inverkeithing burgh court bo
2 CONC ok, 15 August 1654. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD172%2f311&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=thomas+bruce+of+blairhall&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of 
2 CONC the Henderson Family of Fordell, reference GD172/311]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                    2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''14 March 1681: Copy of marriage contract between John Bruce, fiar of Blairhall, and his parents, Thomas Bruce of Blairhall and Dame Jean Hendesone, on one part and Mrs Jean Lesly, relict of John Stewart of Innernytie, with cons
2 CONC ent of John, Lord Lindores, her brother, on the other. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD29%2f1219&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=thomas+bruce+of+blairhall&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n Natio
2 CONC nal Records of Scotland, Papers of the Bruce family of Kinross (Kinross House Papers), reference GD29/1219]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == [http://www.thepeerage.com/p27461.htm#i274604 Biographical Summary by Darryl Lundy's Peerage] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jean Henderson is the daughter of Sir John Henderson, 5th of Fordell and Margaret Menteith. She married Thomas Bruce of Blairhall, son of Robert Bruce and Catherine Preston, on 27 April 1748. Children of Jean Henderson and Thom
2 CONC as Bruce of Blairhall (1)  John Bruce (2)  Alexander Bruce (3) Margaret Bruce (4) Catherine Bruce. [http://www.thepeerage.com/p27461.htm#i274604 Darryl Lundy's Peerage]'''
