2 CONT * [S8444] William Stephen, History of Inverkeithing and Rosyth (Aberdeen: G & W Fraser, 1921). Hereinafter cited as History of Inverkeithing and Rosyth.
2 CONT * [S37] BP2003. [S37]
2 CONT * [S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 1865. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [
