1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Unknown-383374
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Her maiden name is unknown.''' Some descendants believe it was Finley, based on the frequency that the name Finley appears among succeeding generations, but this theory is pure conjecture and not based on facts or any supportin
2 CONC g evidence.
2 CONT
2 CONT Please do not change her surname to Finley unless a creditable source can be provided.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ==concerns==
2 CONT '''Although this Isabella is usually reported as a daughter of Robert Finley and Margaret Lauder, she has not been reported to have been born at any location where her reported parents resided, and no evidence of her parentage has
2 CONC  yet been found.  Further research is warranted.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Birth surname has also been reported to be [https://www.geni.com/surnames/findley Findley].
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of birth have also been (erroneously?) reported to be circa 1672 at Omagh, County Tyrone, Ulster, Ireland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1675 at an unspecified location
2 CONT * 1740 in Adams County, Pennsylvania
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of burial have also been (erroneously?) reported to be:
2 CONT
2 CONT * an unspecified date at Glen Rock, York County, Pennsylvania
2 CONT * 1740 at Chestnut Hill, York County, Pennsyvlania
2 CONT
