2 CONT Chester County PA Archives Wills.....Robert FINLEY, w. 1739 p. 1741
2 CONT FINLEY, ROBERT. W. Nottingham. October 10, 1739. November 24, 1741. B. 101.
2 CONT To wife Sarah £10.
2 CONT To son Robert £10, large bible, gun.
2 CONT Remainder to wife and every one of my children in equal shares, children not named.
2 CONT Refers to his son (in-law) John Johnson and daughter Mary.
2 CONT Executrix: wife Sarah and Wm. Finley of Chestnut Level and Saml. Anderson of W. Nottingham, trustees.
2 CONT Witnesses: John Dick, John Johnson.
2 CONT This file is located at: http://files.usgwarchives.net/pa/chester/wills/f/finley-r.txthttp:/...
2 CONT
2 CONT Sincerely,
2 CONT
2 CONT VL Mincey
