1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Name: Michael FINLEY 1 2 Sex: M Birth: 7 May 1683 in Mullaghbrack, Armagh, Ireland 2 Death: Abt 1747 1750 in Chester, Pennsylvania 1 2 Note: JV Thompson Journals Vol. 3; vol. 5; vol. 12; vol. 13, p. 3 54-355; vol.
2 CONC  25 JV Thompson Journals vol. 13, p. 170-171,188-189 [quotes An jou, USE WITH CAUTION] Michael Finley came to the US with his wife & children (9 i n the family) arriving in Philadelphia, PA 28 Sep 1734. Th e family first settled o
2 CONC n Neshaminy Creek, Bucks Co., P A & later in Sadsbury Twp, Chester Co., PA. Presbyterian.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Michael Finley and Ann O' Neill: Marriage: 12 Jul 1712, Mullaghabrac, Armagh, Ireland.233
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Michael Finley and Ann O'Neill: Baptished: 07 May 1683, Parish of Mullaghbrace Co.. Marriage: 12 Jul 1712, Mullaghabrac,Armagh,Ireland By Rev. George Hall.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Michael Finley and Ann O' Neill are:
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. +John Finley, b. 03 May 1713, Sadsbury, Chester, Pennsylvania,USA233, d. 1759, Lurgan, Cumberland, Pennsylvania, USA233.
2 CONT    2. Samuel Finley, b. 02 Jul 1715, Armagh, Ireland233, d. 17 Jul 1766, Philadelphia, Pa. USA.
2 CONT    3. Andrew Finley, b. 10 Apr 1717, Armagh, Ireland233, d. 06 Oct 1780, Guilford, North Carolina, USA233.
2 CONT    4. William Finley, b. 10 Apr 1717, Armagh, Ireland233, d. 16 Sep 1800, Hamilton Bann Township, Adams, Pennsylvania, USA233.
2 CONT    5. Michael Finley, b. 03 Feb 1718, Armagh, Ireland233, d. 19 Jun 1785, Hamilton, York, Pennsylvania, USA233.
2 CONT    6. Martha Finley, b. 02 Jan 1722, Armagh, Ireland233, d. 1782, Cumberland, Pennsylvania, USA233.
2 CONT    7. Robert Clement Finley, b. 1723, Armagh, Ireland233.
2 CONT    8. George Finley, b. 04 Jun 1723, Armagh, Ireland233, d. 1802, Greensboro, Guilford, North Carolina, USA233.
2 CONT    9. James Finley, b. 04 Feb 1725, Armagh, Ireland233, d. 06 Jan 1795, Rostraver, Westmoreland, Pennsylvania, USA233.
2 CONT   10. Susannah Finley, b. 10 Apr 1728, Armagh, Ireland233, d. 1772, Redstone, York, Pennsylvania, USA233.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Emigrated to America September 28, 1734, settles in Bucks Co., Pa. 
