2 CONT
2 CONT    4.  Agnes FINLEY b: Oct 1737 in Bucks Co, Philadelphia/ Mullaghabrac, Armagh, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT    5.  Archibald FINLEY b: 8 Dec 1738
