2 CONT '''2 February 1681: Decree of Certification in action of Reduction-Improbation at instance of William and Bessie Dick, son and daughter to Sir Andrew Dick of Craighouse, Kt., against Mr. William and Andrew Dick as heirs to decease
2 CONC d Mr. John Dick of Braid, their father and deceased Sir William Dick of Braid, Kt., their grandfather, for fulfilment of terms of Contract of Marriage, dated 6 April 1638, between said Sir William Dick, Mr. John Dick and Sir Andre
2 CONC w Dick on one part and Christian Morisone, future spouse of said Sir Andrew Dick on other part. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD41%2f45&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=john+dick+of+braid
2 CONC &ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Dick-Lauder family of Fountainhall, reference GD41/45]'''
