1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===MARGARET RICHAN (aka MARGARET RICHEN)===
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Richan is the daughter of Robert Richan of Linkletter and his wife Isabel Ballenden. She was born before 28 November 1660, the date upon which her baptism was registered at Kirkwall in Orkney, Scotland. [https://familysea
2 CONC rch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:X18Z-8R5 Kirkwall and St. Ola Baptismal Records]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Richan married James Kaa on 3 September 1684: [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:XYSG-3QS Kirkwall and St. Ola Marriage Records] "Thursday, about 3 in the afternoon, James Kaa, merchant, burgess of Kirkwall, was mar
2 CONC ried to Margaret Richan, only lawful daughter to Robt Richan of Linklater, procreat betwixt him and Isobel Ballenden." [https://archive.org/stream/kirkwallinorkne00hossgoog#page/n393/mode/1up Kirkwall in the Orkneys, page 351]
2 CONT
