1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===CHARLES STEWART===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Charles Stewart is the son of Alexander Stewart and his wife Beatrix Mushet. He was born before 3 February 1662, the date upon which his baptism was registered at Alloa in Clackmannanshire, Scotland. His baptismal record reads 
2 CONC as follows: "Alexander Stewarte & Beatrix Mushett had a sone baptized called Charles Witnesses". [National Records of Scotland, Alloa Baptisms, 1660-1699, reference OPR.469/1A] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=600000007
2 CONC 7310555841& Image of Baptismal Record]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note: Alexander Stewart was the cousin of John, Earl of Mar, who had a son Charles, afterwards Charles, Earl of Mar, who was baptised at Alloa on 24 October 1650. [National Records of Scotland, Alloa Baptisms, 1609-90, referenc
2 CONC e OPR.465/1] Image of the Baptismal Record]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1701: Draft ante-nuptial contract of marriage between Charles Stewart, son of deceased Alexander Stewart, sometime bailiff of burgh of Stirling, and Jean Jameson [Jamieson], daughter of Mr Edward Jameson, minister at Monymeall 
2 CONC [Monimail]. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD124%2f3%2f76&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=alexander+stewart&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1676&dt=1725&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Er
2 CONC skine Family, Earls of Mar and Kellie, reference GD124/3/76]'''
