1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ELIZABETH STEWART (aka ELIZETH STEWART)===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Stewart is the daughter of Alexander Stewart and his wife Beatrix Mushet. She was born before 16 December 1672, the date upon which her baptism was registered at Stirling in Stirlingshire, Scotland. Her baptismal reco
2 CONC rd reads as follows: "Monday the 26 of december. Alexr Stewart serjeant in the castle [and] Beatrix Mushet [a daughter called] Elizeth [witnesses] Capt Geo Areskine Leut : Coll : Alexr Home." [National Records of Scotland, Stirlin
2 CONC g Baptisms, 1671-1755, reference OPR.490/2] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000077309320021& Image of Baptismal Record]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note: The winess named Captain George Erskine (aka Captain George Areskine) is probably that son of John, Earl of Mar, who is reported to have died at Muckall on 21 June 1676. [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun05pauluo
2 CONC ft#page/626/mode/1up The Scots Peerage, V, p, 626] Alexander Stewart was the son of Mar's illegitimate sister Annabella, making him Captain George Erskine's first cousin. The Earl of Mar was the Governor of Stirling Castle. [http:
2 CONC //archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft#page/625/mode/1up Ibidem, p. 625]'''
