1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ARCHIBALD STEWART===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Archibald Stewart is the third child and second son of Alexander Stewart and his wife Beatrix Mushet. He was born before 6 November 1674, the date upon which his baptism was registered at Stirling in Stirlingshire, Scotland. Hi
2 CONC s baptismal record reads as follows: "Fryday the 6th of Novemb[er] [1674] Alexr Stewart serjeant in the castle [and] Beatrix Mushet [a son called] Archibald [witnesses] Mr Colin Mackenzie Capt Geo Areskine John Buchanan Capt Alexr
2 CONC  Home". [National Records of Scotland, Stirling Baptisms, 1671-1755, reference OPR.490/2]  [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000077308815856& Image of Baptismal Record]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note: The winess named Captain George Erskine (aka Captain George Areskine) is probably that son of John, Earl of Mar, who is reported to have died at Muckall on 21 June 1676. [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun05pauluo
2 CONC ft#page/626/mode/1up The Scots Peerage, V, p, 626] Alexander Stewart was the son of Mar's illegitimate sister Annabella, making him Captain George Erskine's first cousin. The Earl of Mar was the Governor of Stirling Castle. [http:
2 CONC //archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft#page/625/mode/1up Ibidem, p. 625]'''
2 CONT
