1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == JOHN STEWART (aka JOHNE STEWART) ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Stewart, here treated, is the son of Alexander Stewart and his wife Beatrix Mushet. He was born before 25 December 1676, the date upon which his baptism was registered at Stirling in Stirlingshire, Scotland. His baptismal 
2 CONC record reads as follows: "Saturday [the 25th December] Alexr Stewart [and] Beatrix Mushet [a son called] Johne [witnesses] Sir Patrick Home of Polwart Captain George Areskine". [National Records of Scotland, Stirling Baptisms, 167
2 CONC 1-1755, reference OPR.490/2] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000077315091618& Image of the Baptismal Record]''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note: The witness named https://www.geni.com/people/George-Erskine/6000000002115993749 (aka Captain George Areskine) is probably that son of John, Earl of Mar, who is reported to have died at Muckall on 21 June 1676. [http://ar
2 CONC chive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft#page/626/mode/1up The Scots Peerage, V, p, 626] Alexander Stewart was the son of Captain George Erskine's illegitimate sister Annabella Erskine, making him Captain George Erskine's first
2 CONC  cousin. [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft#page/625/mode/1up Ibidem, p. 625]'''
1 FAMC @F6000000077189720231@
