1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == V. LEWIS CRAIG OF RICCARTON ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == His Last Will and Testament ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lewis Craig of Riccarton, here treated, made his last will and testament on 13 November 1680. He nominated and appointed his eldest son Thomas Craig to be his only executor and universal legator and intromitter. In the event of
2 CONC  his decease this duty was to pass to his younger sons in succession, that is to his second son Robert Craig, to his third son John Craig, to his fourth son James Craig, and finally to his fifth son William Craig. Confirmation was
2 CONC  granted on 14 February 1682. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Commissary Court, The Testament Testamentar and Inventory of Lewes Craig of Rickarton, reference CC8/8/77]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lewis Craig of Riccartoun, here treated, died before 15 April 1681. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD118%2f217&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Sarah+Craig&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y NRS:
2 CONC  GD118/217]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
