2 CONC  said sasine the last day of July 1692 and ecorded in the Particular Register of Sasines at Edinburgh the 9th September 1682. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=CS228%2fC%2f2%2f24&st=1&tc
2 CONC =y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=lewis+craig&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Court of Session: Unextracted processes, 1st arrangement, Adams-Dalrymple office, reference CS228/C/2/24]'''
