2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT
2 CONT James Craig (son of James Craig)163, 163 was born 20 Apr 1617 in Inveresk, M Loth, Scotland163, 163 He married Agnes Mudie. Children of James Craig and Agnes Mudie are: +John Craig, b. 1644, Edinburgh, Scotland163, 163, 163, d. da
2 CONC te unknown. Born in Edinburgh, Scotland on 1644 to James Craig and Agnes Mudie. John married Janet Mitchell and had a child.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Critical Commentary ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''It is claimed here that James Craig, here treated, was born at Inveresk in Midlothian on 20 April 1617. It should be noticed, however, that a baptismal record for James Craig cannot be found at Inveresk and Musselburgh on this 
2 CONC date. Possibly he is the child of the same name whose baptism was registered there on 20 April 1612.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Craig, here treated, is said to have married Agnes Mudie and to have had a son by her named John who was born in Edinburgh in 1644. It should be noticed, however, that the baptism of their son John was registered on 23 Ju
2 CONC ne 1644, at Inveresk and Musselburgh in Midlothian, and not at Edinburgh.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
