2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34812739899 Andrew Gibson];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34812739901 George Gibson Gibson, II];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34812739900 Bartholmew Gibson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died before 1720 possibly, Boston, MA
