2 CONC b Ruadh Buchanan on month day 1648, at age 23 at marriage place . James was born on September 26 1620, in Callander, Perth, Scotland, United Kingdom. They had 10 children: Robert Buchanan , Agnes Buchanan and 8 other children . Ja
2 CONC net passed away on month day 1666, at age 41 at death place [https://www.myheritage.com/names/janet_fotheringham MyHeritage]'''</blockquote>
