2 CONT '''Lady Elizabeth Ogilvy, here treated, is the daughter of James, Lord Ogilvy of Airlie, and his wife ;ady Jean Ruthven. [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun01pauluoft#page/133/mode/1up The Scots Peerage I: 123]'''
