2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Frances Howard was the daughter of Theophilus Howard, 2nd Earl of Suffolk and Elizabeth Home.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Sir Edward Villiers, son of Sir Edward Villiers and Barbara St. John.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died circa November 1677.[2] She was buried on 27 November 1677 at Westminster Abbey, Westminster, London, England.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Villiers.
2 CONT
