2 CONT                     8
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1634-1635: Instrument of Sasine in favour of said Katherine Peblis, spouse of Sir John Hammiltoun of Trabroun, knight, of the templelands of Bourhill etc. following on a Precept of Clare Constat, dated 2 January, 1627, by Thoma
2 CONC s, earl of Hadingtoun, Lord Bynning and Byres, in her favour as heir to Mr. Alexander Peblis of Skirling, advocate, her father, who acquired them under GD89/1/51, 23 December, 1634. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecat
2 CONC alogue/details.aspx?reference=GD89%2f1%2f65&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=katherine+peblis&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, [Registered in the Particular Register of Sasines, Roxburgh etc., 15 January, 1635]. [
