2 CONC =1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Hamilton+of+Trabroun&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of Clerk family of Penicuik, Midlothian, reference GD18/2376]'''
