2 CONC randice of seven yards in the burgh of Perth, following on a disposition, dated 12 June 1650, by Katharine Peblis, relict of Sir John Hammilton of Trabroune and heir of Mr. Alexander Peibles of Skirling, advocate, her father. [htt
2 CONC p://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD1%2f788%2f1&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=alexander+peibles&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Sasine on annualrent of lands in Kinnoul,
