1 NAME George /Home of Wedderburn/ Baronet
2 GIVN George
2 SURN Home of Wedderburn
2 NSFX Baronet
2 _MARNM Home of Wedderburn
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 3 SEP 1650
2 PLAC Battle of Dunbar
2 ADDR
3 CITY Dunbar
3 CTRY Kingdom of Scotland (not yet part of the United Kingdom)
1 TITL Sir
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sir George was killed with his father at the battle of Dunbar, 1650. His patent of Baronatage passed the Great Seal, Sibbold's Geneal. Cal., but it was not entered on the record.  Lieutenant Colonel in Army of the 
2 CONC Covenant; created a Baronet, 1638; served in Irish Rebellion of 1641.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married
2 CONT # Catherine Morrison, daughter of Sir Alexander Morrison of Prestongrange and Helonora Maule, on 14 Aug 1635 in Scotland. (Catherine Morrison was born in 1615 of Prestongrange and died after 1695 in Wedderburn Castle, Berwickshire
2 CONC , Scotland.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir George Hume, the son of Sir David, did not live to inherit his father's estate, but was killed in the battle of Dunbar with his father. His wife was Catherine Morrison. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had three children, as follows:
2 CONT * 1. Catherine, m. John Bethune, of Fife.
2 CONT * 2. Margaret Hume.
2 CONT * 3. Sir George Hume, 8th Baron of Wedderburn, was born in 1651.  Sir George Hume married Isobel, daughter of Sir Frances Liddell. of Ravensworth. He died in 1716, leaving two children, George and Francis.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT # From History of Dunbar Hume and Dundas from Drummond's Noble British Families, William Pickering, London 1846, page 25
2 CONT # [http://books.google.com/books?id=y2lVAAAAMAAJ&lpg=PA17&ots=PzpQA6V1G9&dq=George%20Hume%2C%209th%20Baron%20Of%20Wedderburn&pg=PA17#v=onepage&q=George%20Hume,%209th%20Baron%20Of%20Wedderburn&f=false History of the Hume, Kennedy a
2 CONC nd Brockman Families:] In Three Parts. By William Everett Brockman.  Page 17
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~hume/tree/1356.htm
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''George Home, Younger of Wedderburn'''
2 CONT * https://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I92240&tree=CC
2 CONT -
