2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p34927.htm#i349261
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrick Oliphant was the son of Sir Laurence Oliphant, 2nd of Gask and Lilias Oliphant.2 He married Margaret Murray, daughter of Reverend John Murray.1 He died in 1694.1
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He was disinherited by his father.1 He lived at Williamston, ScotlandG.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Patrick Oliphant and Margaret Murray
2 CONT #James Oliphant, 5th of Gask+2 b. c 1660, d. 10 Apr 1732
2 CONT
