2 CONT # Maxtone-Graham Ethel.  ''The Oliphants of Gask : records of a Jacobite family'' (1910).  “House of Gask.”  Page 99.  < [https://archive.org/details/oliphantsofgaskr00maxtuoft/oliphantsofgaskr00maxtuoft/page/98/mode/2up Archive.O
2 CONC rg] > 
