2 CONC 496466736d6e4e652f4c6263466d2f52633d222c22746f6b656e5f76657273696f6e223a225632227d AncestrySharing] > Oliphant, John, of Pencaitland, his wife Janet Gilchrist, and daughters Margaret and Janet, indentured as servants to John Hanco
2 CONC ck in Edinburgh, for 4 years in East New Jersey, the daughters until they were 21.  19.8.1685.[EJ Deeds, Liber A, fo. 252] 
