2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Laurence Oliphant, 2nd of Gask ( – d. 1679), Lilias Oliphant  (1620–1669) had 9  children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. David, who was a merchant burgess of Perth, and was in the Perthshire Militia in 1680. He died at Edinburgh, 2nd November 1707, and was buried in the Greyfriars.
2 CONT
