2 CONT
2 CONT THE STRATIIY BRANCH OF MACKAYS.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Hugh Mackay of Strathy, eldest son of John of Dilred and Strathy, was twice married, lst, to a daughter of the second William Mackay of Bighouse; issue, two sons, 
2 CONT * John who succeeded him, and  
2 CONT * William. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, 2d, Jane, eldest daughter of John Lord Reay, and widow of Robert Gordon of Langdale, (see page392,) by whom it does not appear that he had any issue.  pg. 574
2 CONT
2 CONT John Lord Reay, it has been recently discovered, died previous to the year 1654. He was twice married: first, to Lady Isabella Sinclair, daughter of George, Earl of Caithness, by whom he had ... , a daughter, Jane, who was twice m
2 CONC arried ; 1st, to Robert Gordon of Langdale ; and, 2d, to Hugh Mackav of Strathy
