2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>William Sinclair, third of Ratter</strong>, acquired the lands of Freswick in 1661 from Mowat of Buquhollie. He died after 4 May 1663, the date of his will. He married, first, contract dated 18 and 24 March 1642, Elizabet
2 CONC h, only daughter of John Sinclair of Ulbster...
2 CONT
2 CONT ...He married, secondly, Jean, daughter of John Cunningham of Gesie and Brownhill, and relict of Alexander Sinclair of Latheron."
2 CONT
