1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://thepeerage.com/p42862.htm#i428614 John Gunn of Kilearnan and Navidale, 5th Mackeamish]
2 CONT
2 CONT , #428614, b. circa 1601
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=4 Aug 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT  John Gunn of Kilearnan and Navidale, 5th Mackeamish was born circa 1601.1 He was the son of Alexander Gunn of Kilearnan and Navidale, 4th Mackeamish and Catherine Gordon
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, firstly, Ann MacLeod, daughter of Donald 'ban mor' MacLeod of Assynt, circa 1624.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of John Gunn of Kilearnan and Navidale, 5th Mackeamish and Ann MacLeod
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander Gunn, 6th Mackeamish+2 d. b 1714
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Catherine Sinclair, daughter of Francis Sinclair, on 6 March 1641.1\
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of John Gunn of Kilearnan and Navidale, 5th Mackeamish and Catherine Sinclair
2 CONT
2 CONT George Gunn+2
2 CONT
2 CONT  In 1670 he was served heir general to his father in the lands of Navidale.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations [S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 1705. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37] [S37] BP2003. [S37]
