0 @N6000000002187899897@ NOTE Sir William Graham1 (M)
1 CONT b. before 1374, d. 1424, #5152
1 CONT
1 CONT Last Edited 24 Aug 2003
1 CONT
1 CONT      Sir William Graham was born before 1374. He married, firstly, Gille Stewart, daughter of Sir John Stewart. He married, secondly, Lady Mary Stewart, daughter of Robert III Stewart, King of Scotland and Annabel Drummond, on 13 
1 CONC November 1413.2 He died in 1424.1
1 CONT      Sir William Graham lived in Kincardine, Aberdeenshire, Scotland. He was invested as a Knight.
1 CONT
1 CONT Family 1 Gille Stewart b. before 1374
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. Sir Patrick Graham, Earl of Strathearn+ b. b 1390, d. 10 Aug 1413
1 CONT    2. Alexander Graham+ b. b 1398, d. a 10 Aug 1423
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Family 2 Lady Mary Stewart b. before 1382, d. circa 1458
1 CONT
1 CONT Citations 
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. [S2] Peter W. Hammond, editor, The Complete Peerage or a History of the House of Lords and All its Members From the Earliest Times, Volume XIV: Addenda & Corrigenda (Stroud, Gloucestershire, U.K.: Sutton Publishing, 1998), p
1 CONC age 26. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage, Volume XIV.
1 CONT    2. [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family: A Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 228. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Family.
1 CONT
1 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p516.htm#i5152
