0 @N6000000002187899837@ NOTE Patrick Graham, 1st Lord Graham1 (M)
1 CONT b. before 1423, d. 1478, #108234
1 CONT Pedigree
1 CONT Last Edited=13 Jan 2006
1 CONT
1 CONT      Patrick Graham, 1st Lord Graham was born before 1423. He was the son of Alexander Graham.1 He died in 1478.1 He was also reported to have died in 1466.2
1 CONT      Patrick Graham, 1st Lord Graham gained the title of 1st Lord Graham. He held the office of Archbishop of St. Andrews.1
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Child of Patrick Graham, 1st Lord Graham and Christian Erskine
1 CONT     William Graham, 2nd Lord Graham+ b. b 1445, d. 1472
1 CONT
1 CONT Citations
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family: A Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 228. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Family.
1 CONT    2. [S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Ex
1 CONC tinct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume VI, page 53. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
