0 @N6000000005598831219@ NOTE He was the 2nd Duke of Devonshire.
1 CONT Son of William Cavendish, 1st Duke of Devonshire, and Mary Butler; m. Rachel Russsell; father of: William Cavendish, 3rd Duke of Devonshire.
1 CONT
1 CONT William Cavendish, 2nd Duke of Devonshire, KG, PC (1672 - June 4, 1729) was a British nobleman and politician, the eldest son of William Cavendish, 1st Duke of Devonshire and Lady Mary Butler. He married The Hon. Rachel Russell (1
1 CONC 674-1725), daughter of William, Lord Russell on June 21, 1688.
1 CONT
1 CONT A prominent Whig, he was sworn of the Privy Council in 1707, and served as Lord President of the Council from 1716 to 1717 and 1725 to 1729.
0 @N6000000005598819925@ NOTE Lord Henry Cavendish (1673 – 10 May 1700) was a British politician, the second son of William Cavendish, 1st Duke of Devonshire.
